#: ../../about/introduction.rst:2 ../../porting/introduction/index.rst:2
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ບົດນຳ"

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:4
msgid ""
"Our goal is to create a copylefted libre mobile operating system. One you "
"can use, study, change and share; with all."
msgstr ""
"ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງພວກເຮົາແມ່ນເພື່ອສ້າງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການມືຖືແບບເສລີທີ່ເປັນ copyleft. "
"ເປັນລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້, ສຶກສາ, ປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນ; ໃຫ້ກັບທຸກຄົນໄດ້."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:7
msgid "About UBports"
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບ UBports"

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:9
msgid ""
"The project was founded by Marius Gripsgard in 2015 and in its infancy a "
"place where developers could share ideas and educate each other in hopes of "
"bringing the Ubuntu Touch platform to more mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງການນີ້ກໍ່ຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ Marius Gripsgard ໃນປີ 2015 ແລະ ໃນໄລຍະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"ມັນເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ນັກພັດທະນາສາມາດແບ່ງປັນແນວຄວາມຄິດ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຄວາມຮູ້ເຊິ່ງກັນແລະກັນ "
"ດ້ວຍຄວາມຫວັງທີ່ຈະນຳເອົາແພລັດຟອມ Ubuntu Touch ໄປສູ່ອຸປະກອນມືຖືໃຫ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:11
msgid ""
"After Canonical suddenly announced `plans to terminate support for Ubuntu "
"Touch <https://insights.ubuntu.com/2017/04/05/growing-ubuntu-for-cloud-and-"
"iot-rather-than-phone-and-convergence/>`_ in April of 2017, UBports and its "
"sister projects began work on the source code; maintaining and expanding its "
"possibilities for the future. Today, UBports is a volunteer group, "
"formalised as a charitable foundation."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກ Canonical ໄດ້ປະກາດ `ແຜນການຍຸຕິການສະໜັບສະໜູນ Ubuntu Touch <https://"
"insights.ubuntu.com/2017/04/05/growing-ubuntu-for-cloud-and-iot-rather-than-"
"phone-and-convergence/>`_ ຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນໃນເດືອນເມສາ ປີ 2017, UBports ແລະ "
"ໂຄງການເຄືອຂ່າຍກໍໄດ້ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກກັບຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source code); ເພື່ອບຳລຸງຮັກສາ ແລະ "
"ຂະຫຍາຍຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ຂອງມັນສຳລັບອະນາຄົດ. ປະຈຸບັນ, UBports ແມ່ນກຸ່ມອາສາສະໝັກ "
"ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຈົດທະບຽນຢ່າງເປັນທາງການໃນນາມມູນນິທິການກຸສົນ."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:14
msgid "About the Documentation"
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບເອກະສານ"

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:16
msgid ""
"Changes to the documentation are made by the UBports community. It is "
"written in reStructuredText and converted into this readable form by `Sphinx "
"<https://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/master/>`_, `recommonmark <http://"
"recommonmark.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`_, and `Read the Docs <https://"
"readthedocs.io>`_. Start contributing by checking out "
"the :doc:`Documentation contribution document </contribute/documentation>`."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງເອກະສານແມ່ນເຮັດໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ UBports. ມັນຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ reStructuredText ແລະ "
"ປ່ຽນເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ນີ້ໂດຍ `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/master/>`_, "
"`recommonmark <http://recommonmark.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`_, ແລະ `Read "
"the Docs <https://readthedocs.io>`_. "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການປະກອບສ່ວນໂດຍການເບິ່ງທີ່ :doc:`ເອກະສານການປະກອບສ່ວນເອກະສານ </contribute/"
"documentation>`."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:18
msgid ""
"All documents are licensed Creative Commons Attribution ShareAlike 4.0 (`CC-"
"BY-SA 4.0 <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>`_). Please give "
"attribution to \"The UBports Community\"."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານທັງໝົດໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດພາຍໃຕ້ Creative Commons Attribution ShareAlike 4.0 (`CC-"
"BY-SA 4.0 <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>`_). "
"ກະລຸນາລະບຸແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາໃຫ້ກັບ \"The UBports Community\"."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:21
msgid "Attribution"
msgstr "ການລະບຸແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ"

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:23
msgid ""
"This documentation was heavily modeled after the `Godot Engine's "
"Documentation <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/>`_, by Juan "
"Linietsky, Ariel Manzur and the Godot community."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການອອກແບບຕາມ `ເອກະສານຂອງ Godot Engine <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/>`_ ເປັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ໂດຍ Juan Linietsky, Ariel "
"Manzur ແລະ ຊຸມຊົນ Godot."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:2
msgid "Branch-naming convention"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຊື່ສາຂາ (Branch-naming convention)"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:4
msgid ""
"Our branch-naming convention ensures software can be built by our CI and "
"tested easily by other developers."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຊື່ສາຂາຂອງພວກເຮົາຮັບປະກັນວ່າຊອບແວສາມາດຖືກສ້າງ (build) ໂດຍ CI ຂອງພວກເຮົາ ແລະ "
"ທົດສອບໄດ້ງ່າຍໂດຍນັກພັດທະນາຄົນອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:6
msgid ""
"Every Git repository's README file should state which branch-naming "
"convention is used and any deviations from the norm."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ README ຂອງ Git repository ທຸກອັນຄວນລະບຸວ່າໃຊ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຊື່ສາຂາແບບໃດ ແລະ "
"ມີອັນໃດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງໄປຈາກມາດຕະຖານ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:9
msgid "Click-Packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ Click"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:11
msgid ""
"Software exclusively distributed as a click-package (and not also as a DEB) "
"only uses one ``master`` branch that is protected. Separate temporary "
"development branches with arbitrary descriptive names can be created and "
"merged into master when the time comes. Ideally Git tags or GitHub releases "
"should be used to mark and archive milestones in the development history."
msgstr ""
"ຊອບແວທີ່ແຈກຢາຍສະເພາະເປັນແພັກເກດ click (ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນເປັນ DEB) ຈະໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ສາຂາ ``master`` "
"ດຽວທີ່ຖືກປ້ອງກັນໄວ້. ສາຂາການພັດທະນາຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກພ້ອມຊື່ທີ່ອະທິບາຍຕາມໃຈມັກ ສາມາດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ "
"ແລະ ລວມ (merge) ເຂົ້າສູ່ master ເມື່ອເຖິງເວລາ. ຕາມທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ຄວນໃຊ້ Git tags ຫຼື GitHub "
"releases ເພື່ອໝາຍ ແລະ ເກັບຮັກສາຈຸດໝາຍສຳຄັນໃນປະຫວັດການພັດທະນາ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:14
msgid "DEB Packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ DEB"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:16
msgid ""
"To help us deliver our code into Ubuntu Touch as effortlessly as possible, "
"our CI automatically build our Git repositories into a number of APT "
"archives hosted at http://repo.ubports.com/, according to the branch name."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສົ່ງໂຄ້ດເຂົ້າສູ່ Ubuntu Touch ໄດ້ຢ່າງສະດວກທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້, CI "
"ຂອງພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງ Git repositories ເປັນ APT archives ຫຼາຍໆອັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເຊິ່ງໂຮສຢູ່ທີ່ "
"http://repo.ubports.com/, ໂດຍອີງຕາມຊື່ສາຂາ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:18
msgid "We maintain the following branches across Git repositories:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາຮັກສາສາຂາຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນທົ່ວ Git repositories:"

