#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:25
msgid "``main``, ``ubports/latest``"
msgstr "``main``, ``ubports/latest``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:25
msgid ""
"Represents the latest development of Ubuntu Touch. All kinds of changes are "
"allowed in this branch."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຖິງການພັດທະນາຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງ Ubuntu Touch. ການປ່ຽນແປງທຸກປະເພດແມ່ນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີໃນສາຂານີ້."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:25
msgid "``devel-<Ubuntu LTS>`` (e.g. ``devel-noble``)"
msgstr "``devel-<Ubuntu LTS>`` (ເຊັ່ນ: ``devel-noble``)"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:25
msgid "Latest or upcoming Ubuntu LTS."
msgstr "Ubuntu LTS ຫຼ້າສຸດ ຫຼື ທີ່ກຳລັງຈະມາເຖິງ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:28
msgid "``devel-debian``"
msgstr "``devel-debian``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:28
msgid "Debian testing."
msgstr "Debian testing."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:30
msgid "``ubports/<major version>.x`` (e.g. ``ubports/24.6.x``)"
msgstr "``ubports/<major version>.x`` (ເຊັ່ນ: ``ubports/24.6.x``)"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:30
msgid ""
"Represents the code in a particular major version. It branches off of the "
"``main`` branch before the major release, and will become a part of the "
"releases of that major version. Only bugfixes and non-breaking changes are "
"allowed in this branch."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເຖິງໂຄ້ດໃນເວີຊັນຫຼັກສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ. ມັນແຍກສາຂາອອກຈາກສາຂາ ``main`` ກ່ອນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນຫຼັກ, "
"ແລະ ຈະກາຍເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນຂອງເວີຊັນຫຼັກນັ້ນ. ສະເພາະການແກ້ໄຂບັກ ແລະ "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບເສຍຫາຍ (non-breaking changes) ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃນສາຂານີ້."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:30
msgid "``<major version>.x`` (e.g. ``24.6.x``)"
msgstr "``<major version>.x`` (ເຊັ່ນ: ``24.6.x``)"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:30
msgid "Ubuntu LTS at the time of branching."
msgstr "Ubuntu LTS ໃນເວລາທີ່ແຍກສາຂາ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:38
msgid "``ubports/focal``"
msgstr "``ubports/focal``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:38
msgid ""
"A special case of ``ubports/<major version>.x``, which is branched after the "
"release of Ubuntu Touch 20.04 OTA-4."
msgstr ""
"ກໍລະນີພິເສດຂອງ ``ubports/<major version>.x``, ເຊິ່ງຖືກແຍກສາຂາຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ອຍ Ubuntu "
"Touch 20.04 OTA-4."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:38
msgid "``focal``"
msgstr "``focal``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:38
#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:43
msgid "Ubuntu 20.04 LTS."
msgstr "Ubuntu 20.04 LTS."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:43
msgid "``ubports/focal_-_<ext>``"
msgstr "``ubports/focal_-_<ext>``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:43
msgid ""
"Branches which use the deprecated \"branch extensions\" system for cross-"
"components changes. No longer recommended for usage."
msgstr ""
"ສາຂາທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບ \"branch extensions\" ທີ່ຍົກເລີກແລ້ວ ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງຂ້າມອົງປະກອບ. "
"ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:43
msgid "``focal_-_<ext>``"
msgstr "``focal_-_<ext>``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:48
msgid "``personal/<user>/<name>``, and any other branches."
msgstr "``personal/<user>/<name>``, ແລະ ສາຂາອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:48
msgid ""
"All other branches may be used for proposing merge requests or for other "
"reasons. Theses branches are not built by the CI unless proposed as a merge "
"request."
msgstr ""
"ສາຂາອື່ນໆທັງໝົດອາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະເໜີ merge requests ຫຼື ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນອື່ນໆ. "
"ສາຂາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍ CI ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່ວ່າຈະຖືກສະເໜີເປັນ merge request."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:48
msgid ""
"N/A, unless proposed as an MR against aforementioned branches (see below)."
msgstr "N/A, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່ວ່າຈະຖືກສະເໜີເປັນ MR ຕໍ່ກັບສາຂາທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ (ເບິ່ງລຸ່ມນີ້)."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:55
msgid ""
"To ensure the ``main`` branch doesn't miss any changes, all changes must be "
"made against ``main`` branch first before backporting to the major release "
"branches. An exception is when a change is not applicable to the ``main`` "
"branch anymore due to other changes in that branch."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າສາຂາ ``main`` ບໍ່ພາດການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ, ທຸກການປ່ຽນແປງຕ້ອງເຮັດກັບສາຂາ ``main`` "
"ກ່ອນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງ backport ໄປຍັງສາຂາການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນຫຼັກ. "
"ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນແມ່ນເມື່ອການປ່ຽນແປງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບສາຂາ ``main`` "
"ອີກຕໍ່ໄປເນື່ອງຈາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງອື່ນໆໃນສາຂານັ້ນ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:58
msgid ""
"If the next development version is not available for testing yet, and you "
"need the change to be made available for install for testing, it's allowed "
"to temporarily target the changeset to the major version branch to get "
"packages built against that version. When the changeset is ready for merge, "
"the changeset must be re-targeted to the ``main`` branch."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເວີຊັນການພັດທະນາຕໍ່ໄປຍັງບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຫ້ທົດສອບເທື່ອ, ແລະ "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງນັ້ນພ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອທົດສອບ, ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍ changeset "
"ໄປຍັງສາຂາເວີຊັນຫຼັກຊົ່ວຄາວໄດ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ແພັກເກດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບເວີຊັນນັ້ນ. ເມື່ອ changeset ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະ "
"merge, changeset ດັ່ງກ່າວຕ້ອງຖືກປ່ຽນເປົ້າໝາຍກັບໄປທີ່ສາຂາ ``main``."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:61
msgid "APT archives for Merge Requests"
msgstr "APT archives ສຳລັບ Merge Requests"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:63
msgid ""
"In addition to archives mentioned above, we also create APT archives for MRs "
"made against our Git repositories. This allows us to test the result of the "
"build on real devices using ubports-qa_ before merging the code. For each "
"MR, the CI will build the code against all the same targets as the MR's "
"target branch, and then will append ``_-_PR_<repository name>_<MR number>`` "
"to them [1]_. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກ archives ທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາຍັງສ້າງ APT archives ສຳລັບ MRs ທີ່ເຮັດຕໍ່ "
"Git repositories ຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາທົດສອບຜົນຂອງການ build "
"ໃນອຸປະກອນຕົວຈິງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ ubports-qa_ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ merge ໂຄ້ດ. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ MR, CI ຈະ build "
"ໂຄ້ດຕໍ່ກັບເປົ້າໝາຍດຽວກັນທັງໝົດກັບສາຂາເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງ MR, ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນຈະຕື່ມ ``_-_PR_<repository "
"name>_<MR number>`` ໃສ່ທາງທ້າຍພວກມັນ [1]_. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:65
msgid ""
"An MR numbered 100 made against the ``main`` branch of Git repository "
"``lomiri`` (when the current Ubuntu LTS is ``noble``) will have APT archives "
"named ``devel-noble_-_PR_lomiri_100`` *and* ``devel-debian_-_PR_lomiri_100``."
msgstr ""
"MR ໝາຍເລກ 100 ທີ່ເຮັດຕໍ່ສາຂາ ``main`` ຂອງ Git repository ``lomiri`` (ເມື່ອ Ubuntu "
"LTS ປະຈຸບັນແມ່ນ ``noble``) ຈະມີ APT archives ຊື່ວ່າ ``devel-noble_-_PR_lomiri_100`` "
"*ແລະ* ``devel-debian_-_PR_lomiri_100``."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:66
msgid ""
"An MR numbered 125 made against the ``ubports/24.6.x`` branch of Git "
"repository ``morph-browser`` will have an APT archive named ``24.6.x_-"
"_PR_morph-browser_125``."
msgstr ""
"MR ໝາຍເລກ 125 ທີ່ເຮັດຕໍ່ສາຂາ ``ubports/24.6.x`` ຂອງ Git repository ``morph-"
"browser`` ຈະມີ APT archive ຊື່ວ່າ ``24.6.x_-_PR_morph-browser_125``."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:68
msgid ""
"The word ``PR`` stuck around from the time we hosted our code on GitHub."
msgstr "ຄຳວ່າ ``PR`` ຍັງຄົງຕິດມາຕັ້ງແຕ່ຕອນທີ່ພວກເຮົາຝາກໂຄ້ດໄວ້ໃນ GitHub."

#: ../../about/process/index.rst:2
msgid "Processes"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການ"

#: ../../about/process/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"This section of the documentation details standardized processes for "
"different teams."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ຂອງເອກະສານຈະລົງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຂະບວນການມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບທີມຕ່າງໆ."

#: ../../about/process/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"The process definitions are still a work in progress and need to be "
"completed by the respective teams."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນິຍາມຂະບວນການຍັງຢູ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການດຳເນີນງານ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ສຳເລັດໂດຍທີມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:2
msgid "Issue-Tracking Guidelines"
msgstr "ແນວທາງການຕິດຕາມບັນຫາ (Issue-Tracking Guidelines)"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:4
msgid ""
"This document describes the standard process of dealing with issues in "
"UBports projects. (Not to be confused with the :doc:`guide on writing a good "
"bugreport </contribute/bugreporting>`.)"
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານນີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງຂະບວນການມາດຕະຖານໃນການຈັດການກັບບັນຫາໃນໂຄງການ UBports. "
"(ຢ່າສັບສົນກັບ :doc:`ຄູ່ມືການຂຽນລາຍງານບັກທີ່ດີ </contribute/bugreporting>`.)"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:8
msgid "Where are bugs tracked?"
msgstr "ບັກຖືກຕິດຕາມຢູ່ໃສ?"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:10
msgid ""
"The primary issue tracker for Ubuntu Touch is the `ubports/development/"
"ubuntu-touch GitLab project`_. This project tracks all system-level Ubuntu "
"Touch issues, and serves as an entry point for users to report issues "
"they've encountered."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືຕິດຕາມບັນຫາຫຼັກສຳລັບ Ubuntu Touch ແມ່ນ `ໂຄງການ ubports/development/ubuntu-"
"touch ໃນ GitLab`_. ໂຄງການນີ້ຕິດຕາມບັນຫາລະບົບ Ubuntu Touch ທັງໝົດໃນລະດັບລະບົບ, ແລະ "
"ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນການລາຍງານບັນຫາທີ່ພວກເຂົາພົບພໍ້."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:12
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, other projects in the group also have their issue trackers "
"enabled too:"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະດຽວກັນ, ໂຄງການອື່ນໆໃນກຸ່ມກໍມີເຄື່ອງມືຕິດຕາມບັນຫາຂອງຕົນເອງທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານເຊັ່ນກັນ:"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:14
msgid ""
"Device-specific issues are tracked under each device's project under "
"`ubports/porting`_ group."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຫາສະເພາະຂອງອຸປະກອນຖືກຕິດຕາມພາຍໃຕ້ໂຄງການຂອງແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນໃນກຸ່ມ `ubports/porting`_."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:15
msgid ""
"Core applications under `ubports/development/apps`_ track their own issues."
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຫຼັກພາຍໃຕ້ `ubports/development/apps`_ ຕິດຕາມບັນຫາຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:16
msgid ""
"System issues can also be filed against each component under `ubports/"
"development/core`_ directly as well, if it's clear which component is "
"responsible for an issue."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຫາລະບົບຍັງສາມາດຖືກຍື່ນຕໍ່ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບພາຍໃຕ້ `ubports/development/core`_ "
"ໂດຍກົງໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ຖ້າຫາກວ່າມັນຈະແຈ້ງວ່າອົງປະກອບໃດທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບຕໍ່ບັນຫານັ້ນ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:18
msgid ""
"GitLab allows showing `issues across the group`_, cross-project issue "
"reference, and issue transfer between projects, making the exact project an "
"issue is filed less important. If a port-specific or website issue ended up "
"in ubports/development/ubuntu-touch project, they can be moved to the "
"appropriate project."
msgstr ""
"GitLab ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະແດງ `ບັນຫາທົ່ວທັງກຸ່ມ`_, ການອ້າງອີງບັນຫາຂ້າມໂຄງການ, ແລະ "
"ການໂອນຍ້າຍບັນຫາລະຫວ່າງໂຄງການ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຄງການທີ່ແນ່ນອນທີ່ບັນຫາຖືກຍື່ນນັ້ນມີຄວາມສຳຄັນໜ້ອຍລົງ. "
"ຖ້າບັນຫາສະເພາະຂອງພອດ ຫຼື ເວັບໄຊທ໌ໄປຕົກຢູ່ໃນໂຄງການ ubports/development/ubuntu-touch, "
"ພວກມັນສາມາດຖືກຍ້າຍໄປຍັງໂຄງການທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄດ້."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:27
msgid "Labels"
msgstr "ປ້າຍກຳກັບ (Labels)"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:29
msgid ""
"All issues — even closed ones — should be labeled to allow use of GitLab's "
"filtering. For example, these are `issues labeled 'Kind: enhancement' inside "
"ubports/development group`_. Consult the `GitLab help pages`_ to learn more "
"about searching and filtering."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກບັນຫາ — ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າບັນຫາທີ່ປິດໄປແລ້ວ — ຄວນຖືກຕິດປ້າຍກຳກັບເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການກັ່ນຕອງຂອງ "
"GitLab ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, ນີ້ແມ່ນ `ບັນຫາທີ່ຕິດປ້າຍກຳກັບ 'Kind: enhancement' ພາຍໃນກຸ່ມ "
"ubports/development`_. ສຶກສາ `ໜ້າຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງ GitLab`_ ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຄົ້ນຫາ "
"ແລະ ການກັ່ນຕອງ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:34
msgid ""
"The following labels are used inside UBports projects. Since merge requests "
"(MRs) in GitLab share the same set of labels, some of the labels below might "
"also apply to merge requests as well."
msgstr ""
"ປ້າຍກຳກັບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໂຄງການ UBports. ເນື່ອງຈາກ merge requests (MRs) ໃນ GitLab "
"ໃຊ້ຊຸດປ້າຍກຳກັບດຽວກັນ, ປ້າຍກຳກັບບາງອັນຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ອາດຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບ merge requests ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:36 ../../appdev/webapp/index.rst:19
#: ../../systemdev/kernel-hal.rst:57
msgid "Todo"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດ (Todo)"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:37
msgid ""
"Consider also writing a document about process of dealing with merge "
"requests."
msgstr "ພິຈາລະນາຂຽນເອກະສານກ່ຽວກັບຂະບວນການຈັດການກັບ merge requests ດ້ວຍ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:39
msgid "**Kind:** describe the nature of the issue"
msgstr "**Kind:** ອະທິບາຍລັກສະນະຂອງບັນຫາ"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Kind: bug**: this issue describes something that doesn't work correctly."
msgstr "**Kind: bug**: ບັນຫານີ້ອະທິບາຍບາງສິ່ງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Kind: enhancement**: this issue is a feature request or describes "
"something that can be improved."
msgstr "**Kind: enhancement**: ບັນຫານີ້ແມ່ນການຮ້ອງຂໍຟີເຈີ ຫຼື ອະທິບາຍບາງສິ່ງທີ່ສາມາດປັບປຸງໄດ້."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Kind: maintenance**: this issue describes a technical debt; something we "
"need to clean up."
msgstr ""
"**Kind: maintenance**: ບັນຫານີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງໜີ້ສິນທາງເຕັກນິກ; "
"ບາງສິ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ທຳຄວາມສະອາດ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Kind: FTBFS**: this issue describes a \"Fails To Build From Source\" issue "
"(`an accronym from Debian`_)."
msgstr ""
"**Kind: FTBFS**: ບັນຫານີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງບັນຫາ \"Fails To Build From Source\" (`ຄຳຫຍໍ້ຈາກ "
"Debian`_)."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Kind: process**: this issue is a tracking issue for some process. For "
"example, a process on releasing an Ubuntu Touch release."
msgstr ""
"**Kind: process**: ບັນຫານີ້ແມ່ນບັນຫາການຕິດຕາມສຳລັບຂະບວນການໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, "
"ຂະບວນການໃນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ Ubuntu Touch."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Kind: question**: This issue is a support request or general question. It "
"should be directed to forums instead."
msgstr ""
"**Kind: question**: ບັນຫານີ້ແມ່ນການຮ້ອງຂໍການສະໜັບສະໜູນ ຫຼື ຄຳຖາມທົ່ວໄປ. "
"ມັນຄວນຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປທີ່ເວທີສົນທະນາແທນ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:46
msgid "**Needs:** describe some action that can/has to be done"
msgstr "**Needs:** ອະທິບາຍການກະທຳບາງຢ່າງທີ່ສາມາດ/ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເຮັດ"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Needs: help from community**: the maintainers currently don't have "
"capacity to solve this issue and would like help from the community."
msgstr ""
"**Needs: help from community**: ຜູ້ບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃນປະຈຸບັນບໍ່ມີຄວາມສາມາດໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ "
"ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກຊຸມຊົນ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Needs: confirmation/more info**: the bug needs confirmation and / or "
"further detailing by affected users."
msgstr ""
"**Needs: confirmation/more info**: ບັກຕ້ອງການການຢືນຢັນ ແລະ / ຫຼື "
"ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Needs: feedback from author**: used to flag a merge request which requires "
"a feedback from author after a review. This is different from **Needs: "
"confirmation/more info** which is intended to be used on an issue."
msgstr ""
"**Needs: feedback from author**: ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍ merge request "
"ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄຳຕິຊົມຈາກຜູ້ຂຽນຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບ. ນີ້ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ **Needs: confirmation/more "
"info** ເຊິ່ງມີຈຸດປະສົງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບບັນຫາ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Needs: discussion**: it is not clear how to solve this issue and further "
"discussion is required."
msgstr ""
"**Needs: discussion**: ມັນບໍ່ຈະແຈ້ງວ່າຈະແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ແນວໃດ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການການສົນທະນາເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Needs: rebase**: this merge request has to be rebased, but maintainers do "
"not have a permission to push to the source branch."
msgstr ""
"**Needs: rebase**: merge request ນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ rebase, ແຕ່ຜູ້ບຳລຸງຮັກສາບໍ່ມີສິດໃນການ push "
"ໄປຍັງສາຂາຕົ້ນທາງ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:52
msgid "**Severity:** how severe is the issue."
msgstr "**Severity:** ບັນຫາມີຄວາມຮຸນແຮງເທົ່າໃດ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Severity: critical**: this issue is very severe and should block the "
"rollout of the release (defined by its milestone)."
msgstr ""
"**Severity: critical**: ບັນຫານີ້ຮຸນແຮງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ຄວນຢຸດຢັ້ງການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ (ກຳນົດໂດຍ "
"milestone ຂອງມັນ)."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Area:** this issue is related to a certain area of Ubuntu Touch (e.g. HAL, "
"middleware, UI). Labels of this prefix can be created as appropriate."
msgstr ""
"**Area:** ບັນຫານີ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງ Ubuntu Touch (ເຊັ່ນ: HAL, middleware, UI). "
"ປ້າຍກຳກັບຂອງຄຳນຳໜ້ານີ້ສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Topic:** this issue is related to a certain topic of interest (e.g. VoLTE, "
"contact backend migration). Labels of this prefix can also be created as "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"**Topic:** ບັນຫານີ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ສົນໃຈໃດໜຶ່ງ (ເຊັ່ນ: VoLTE, contact backend "
"migration). ປ້າຍກຳກັບຂອງຄຳນຳໜ້ານີ້ກໍສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Resolution:** used when the issue is closed for other reason than the "
"issue being fixed."
msgstr "**Resolution:** ໃຊ້ເມື່ອບັນຫາຖືກປິດດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນອື່ນນອກເໜືອຈາກບັນຫາຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Resolution: unable to confirm**: we are unable to reproduce the issue and "
"not enough information is provided."
msgstr ""
"**Resolution: unable to confirm**: ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບັນຫາເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຫ້ມານັ້ນບໍ່ພຽງພໍ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Resolution: not our bug**: the issue is not an issue in Ubuntu Touch, but "
"rather is an issue in a third-party software installed by the user."
msgstr ""
"**Resolution: not our bug**: ບັນຫານີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນບັນຫາໃນ Ubuntu Touch, "
"ແຕ່ເປັນບັນຫາໃນຊອບແວຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Resolution: won't fix**: A bug it does not make sense to fix, since it "
"will probably resolve itself, be too much work, isn't fixable, or an "
"underlying component will soon change."
msgstr ""
"**Resolution: won't fix**: ບັກທີ່ບໍ່ສົມເຫດສົມຜົນທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າມັນອາດຈະແກ້ໄຂຕົວມັນເອງ, ເປັນວຽກຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ, ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້, ຫຼື "
"ອົງປະກອບພື້ນຖານກຳລັງຈະປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄວໆນີ້."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Resolution: work as intended**: The behavior described in the issue is the "
"intended behavior of the software."
msgstr ""
"**Resolution: work as intended**: ພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນບັນຫາ "
"ແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຕັ້ງໃຈໃຫ້ເປັນຂອງຊອບແວ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Backport to: <branch name>**: used by the automation to automatically "
"backport an MR to a stable release branches."
msgstr ""
"**Backport to: <branch name>**: ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍລະບົບອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອ backport MR ໄປຍັງສາຂา "
"stable release ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:62
msgid "Miscellaneous labels"
msgstr "ປ້າຍກຳກັບເບັດຕະເລັດ"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:63
msgid ""
"**Good first issue**: the report contains instructions or hints required to "
"fix it. It is an excellent place for someone new to learn about the project "
"by fixing a real issue."
msgstr ""
"**Good first issue**: ລາຍງານມີຄຳແນະນຳ ຫຼື ຄຳໃບ້ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການແກ້ໄຂມັນ. "
"ມັນເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ດີເລີດສຳລັບມືໃໝ່ທີ່ຈະຮຽນຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບໂຄງການໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຕົວຈິງ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Hotfix**: This MR/issue classifies for being included/resolved as part of "
"a point release of Ubuntu Touch"
msgstr ""
"**Hotfix**: MR/issue ນີ້ຈັດຢູ່ໃນປະເພດທີ່ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ/ແກ້ໄຂ ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການປ່ອຍ point "
"release ຂອງ Ubuntu Touch"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:67
msgid ""
"If a repository tracking issues locally defines it's own labels, they should "
"be documented in the README.md."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ repository ທີ່ຕິດຕາມບັນຫາຢູ່ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນກຳນົດປ້າຍກຳກັບຂອງຕົນເອງ, ພວກມັນຄວນຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ "
"README.md."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:73
msgid "Status"
msgstr ""

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:75
msgid ""
"Status field is used to indicate the progress of the issue. We've defined "
"the following statuses:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:77
msgid ""
"**New**: This is the status for a newly-opened issue. This indicates that "
"this issue is untriaged; Developers and triagers are encouraged to triage "
"issues, assigns kind and other labels, decide whether this issue warrants a "
"milestone, etc. Alternatively, if an issue is a work item, a tracking issue, "
"or something similar filed by developers, this status can be skipped."
msgstr ""

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Ready to be worked on**: Indicates that this issue is triaged and can be "
"worked on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:81
msgid "This status replaces default \"To do\" status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:83
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Status: blocked**: something else has to be solved outside of this "
#| "issue before this issue can progress."
msgid ""
"**Blocked**: Indicates that something else has to be solved outside of this "
"issue before this issue can progress."
msgstr ""
"**Status: blocked**: ຕ້ອງມີການແກ້ໄຂບາງຢ່າງນອກເໜືອຈາກບັນຫານີ້ "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ບັນຫານີ້ຈະສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:84
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Status: in progress**: a developer is actively working on the issue."
msgid ""
"**In progress**: Indicates that a developer is actively working on the "
"issue. The issue should be assigned to that developer."
msgstr "**Status: in progress**: ນັກພັດທະນາກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫານີ້ຢ່າງຫ້າວຫັນ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:85
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "**Status: has MR**: a non-draft MR exists that will fix this issue."
msgid "**Has MR**: A non-draft MR exists that will fix this issue."
msgstr "**Status: has MR**: ມີ MR ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສະບັບຮ່າງ (non-draft) ທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:86
msgid "**Done**: The issue has been fixed in the ``main`` branch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:87
msgid ""
"**Duplicate**: The issue is a duplicate. GitLab sets this status "
"automatically when the issue is marked as a duplicate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Won't do**: The issue is closed for other reason than the issue being "
"fixed. It should have \"Resolution: \\*\" labels to explain the reason (see "
"above)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:91
msgid "Milestones"
msgstr "ຈຸດໝາຍສຳຄັນ (Milestones)"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:93
msgid ""
"Milestones are used to define which release an issue targets. At a given "
"time, up to 3 milestones are open:"
msgstr ""
"Milestones ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າບັນຫາໃດນຶ່ງມີເປົ້າໝາຍຢູ່ທີ່ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນໃດ. ໃນເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ, ຈະມີ "
"milestones ເປີດຢູ່ສູງສຸດ 3 ອັນ:"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:95
msgid ""
"A milestone for the upcoming stable release e.g. 'Ubuntu Touch 24.04-1.1'."
msgstr ""
"Milestone ສຳລັບການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ stable ທີ່ກຳລັງຈະມາເຖິງ ເຊັ່ນ 'Ubuntu Touch 24.04-1.1'."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:96
msgid ""
"A milestone for the in development major release e.g. 'Ubuntu Touch "
"24.04-2.0'."
msgstr ""
"Milestone ສຳລັບການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ major ທີ່ກຳລັງພັດທະນາ ເຊັ່ນ 'Ubuntu Touch 24.04-2.0'."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:97
msgid ""
"Once the in development release enters a stabilization phase, a milestone "
"for the next major release (e.g. 'Ubuntu Touch 24.04-3.0') can be created."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນທີ່ກຳລັງພັດທະນາເຂົ້າສູ່ໄລຍະເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຖຽນ, Milestone ສຳລັບການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ major "
"ຕໍ່ໄປ (ເຊັ່ນ 'Ubuntu Touch 24.04-3.0') ກໍສາມາດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:99
msgid ""
"Developers are encouraged to avoid assigning too many issues to a milestone; "
"an overflowing milestone makes the milestone not as useful as it could be in "
"tracking progress of a release."
msgstr ""
"ນັກພັດທະນາຖືກຊຸກຍູ້ໃຫ້ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການມອບໝາຍບັນຫາຫຼາຍເກີນໄປໃຫ້ກັບ milestone; milestone "
"ທີ່ລົ້ນເກີນໄປຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ milestone ນັ້ນບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດເທົ່າທີ່ຄວນ ໃນການຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:102
msgid "Assignees"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໄດ້ຮັບມອບໝາຍ"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:104
msgid ""
"To make it transparent who's working on an issue, the developer should be "
"assigned. This also allows the use of GitLab's global filtering as a type of "
"TODO list."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສວ່າໃຜກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກກັບບັນຫາໃດໜຶ່ງ, ນັກພັດທະນາຄວນຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການກັ່ນຕອງທົ່ວໂລກຂອງ GitHub ເປັນປະເພດຂອງລາຍການ TODO ໄດ້."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:108
msgid ""
"Developers are encouraged to keep their list short and update the status of "
"their issues."
msgstr ""
"ນັກພັດທະນາຖືກຊຸກຍູ້ໃຫ້ຮັກສາລາຍການຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າໃຫ້ສັ້ນ ແລະ ອັບເດດສະຖານະຂອງບັນຫາຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:111
msgid "GitLab issue board"
msgstr "ກະດານບັນຫາ GitLab"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:113
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "We use GitLab's issue boards to visualize progress of issues in each "
#| "milestone. The boards are kanban boards, where each column corresponds to "
#| "each **Status:** label (in-progress, blocked, has MR), with additional "
#| "columns for opened issues without **Status:** label (which indicate that "
#| "the issue has not been started yet) and closed issues."
msgid ""
"We use GitLab's issue boards to visualize progress of issues in each "
"milestone. The boards are kanban boards, where each column corresponds to "
"each defined status (new, ready to be worked on, blocked, in progress, has "
"MR, done, duplicate, won't do)."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ກະດານບັນຫາຂອງ GitLab ເພື່ອສະແດງພາບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງບັນຫາໃນແຕ່ລະ milestone. "
"ກະດານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນກະດານ kanban, ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຖັນກົງກັບແຕ່ລະປ້າຍກຳກັບ **Status:** (in-progress, "
"blocked, has MR), ພ້ອມດ້ວຍຖັນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບບັນຫາທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ທີ່ບໍ່ມີປ້າຍກຳກັບ **Status:** "
"(ເຊິ່ງຊີ້ບອກວ່າບັນຫາຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ແລະ ບັນຫາທີ່ປິດແລ້ວ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:116
msgid "GitLab epic"
msgstr "GitLab epic"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:118
msgid ""
"We use GitLab's epics to denote a topic which might span single or multiple "
"milestones/releases. This helps organizing some long-term goals which are "
"too large to implement at once."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ epics ຂອງ GitLab ເພື່ອໝາຍເຖິງຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ອາດຈະກວມເອົາ milestones/releases ດຽວ ຫຼື "
"ຫຼາຍອັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຈັດຕັ້ງເປົ້າໝາຍໄລຍະຍາວບາງຢ່າງທີ່ໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດໃນຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:121
msgid "How labels, milestone etc. are being used?"
msgstr "ປ້າຍກຳກັບ, milestone ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແນວໃດ?"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:123
msgid ""
"Think of labels, milestone, and other fields as tools a person can use to "
"efficiently communicate with the reporter, other developers, and interested "
"parties. They could be use in a few ways:"
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ຄິດວ່າປ້າຍກຳກັບ, milestone, ແລະ ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ "
"ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ຄົນເຮົາສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສື່ສານຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບກັບຜູ້ລາຍງານ, ນັກພັດທະນາຄົນອື່ນໆ, ແລະ "
"ຝ່າຍທີ່ສົນໃຈ. ພວກມັນສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນສອງສາມວິທີ:"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:125
msgid ""
"Because those fields show up in the issue list, it can give an at-a-glance "
"info about the issue, helping developers to quickly understand the issue. "
"For example, a developer could look at an issue on the list, notice that the "
"issue has \"needs discussion\" label, and decide to jump in to give their 2 "
"cents."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍການບັນຫາ, ມັນສາມາດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍຫຍໍ້ກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາ, "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ນັກພັດທະນາເຂົ້າໃຈບັນຫາໄດ້ຢ່າງໄວວາ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, ນັກພັດທະນາສາມາດເບິ່ງບັນຫາໃນລາຍການ, "
"ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າບັນຫາມີປ້າຍກຳກັບ \"needs discussion\", ແລະ ຕັດສິນໃຈເຂົ້າໄປໃຫ້ຄຳເຫັນ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:126
msgid ""
"A field could be used to filter only interested issues. For example, a "
"community member wanting to contribute into confirming issues can filter "
"only issues with \"needs confirmation\" label and start jumping in."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອກັ່ນຕອງສະເພາະບັນຫາທີ່ສົນໃຈ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, "
"ສະມາຊິກຊຸມຊົນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປະກອບສ່ວນໃນການຢືນຢັນບັນຫາ ສາມາດກັ່ນຕອງສະເພາະບັນຫາທີ່ມີປ້າຍກຳກັບ \"needs "
"confirmation\" ແລະ ເລີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປຊ່ວຍໄດ້."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:127
msgid ""
"A field could also be used to filter out uninteresting issues. For example, "
"when a developer want to look for an issue to work on, one would want to "
"filter out \"Kind: process\" label (used for e.g. tracking issue for a "
"release)."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຍັງສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອກັ່ນຕອງບັນຫາທີ່ບໍ່ສົນໃຈອອກໄປ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, "
"ເມື່ອນັກພັດທະນາຕ້ອງການຊອກຫາບັນຫາທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກ, ເຂົາເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການກັ່ນຕອງປ້າຍກຳກັບ \"Kind: "
"process\" ອອກ (ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ ເຊັ່ນ: ການຕິດຕາມບັນຫາສຳລັບການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ)."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:129
msgid ""
"Since we don't always have someone to specifically triage issues and set "
"those labels, developers are encouraged to set all those fields as they work "
"on an issue. This will help comminicating what has been done on the issue, "
"and also help summarizing the issue for quicker understanding."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກເຮົາບໍ່ມີຄົນທີ່ຈະມາຄັດແຍກບັນຫາ ແລະ ຕັ້ງປ້າຍກຳກັບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍສະເພາະ, "
"ນັກພັດທະນາຈຶ່ງຖືກຊຸກຍູ້ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພວກເຂົາເຮັດວຽກກັບບັນຫາ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍສື່ສານວ່າໄດ້ເຮັດຫຍັງແດ່ກັບບັນຫານັ້ນ, ແລະ ຍັງຊ່ວຍສະຫຼຸບບັນຫາເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:2
msgid "Release Schedule"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:3
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Touch has four software update channels: Stable, Release Candidate, "
"Devel, and Edge."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Touch ມີຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດຊອບແວສີ່ຊ່ອງທາງ: Stable, Release Candidate, Devel, "
"ແລະ Edge."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:6
msgid "Stable Channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ Stable (ສະຖຽນ)"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:7
msgid ""
"**It is the most reliable release channel.** It is recommended for users who "
"prefer stability rather than the newest features. Generally Stable gets OTA "
"(over the air) updates every several weeks. But there is no firm schedule. "
"Releases are ready when they're ready. Stable releases should not introduce "
"new bugs or ship very incomplete features."
msgstr ""
"**ມັນແມ່ນຊ່ອງທາງການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືທີ່ສຸດ.** "
"ມັນຖືກແນະນຳສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມັກຄວາມສະຖຽນຫຼາຍກວ່າຟີເຈີໃໝ່ລ່າສຸດ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ Stable ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດ "
"OTA (over the air) ທຸກໆສອງສາມອາທິດ. ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີຕາຕະລາງທີ່ແນ່ນອນ. "
"ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນຈະພ້ອມເມື່ອພວກມັນພ້ອມ. ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ Stable ບໍ່ຄວນນຳສະເໜີບັກໃໝ່ ຫຼື "
"ປ່ອຍຟີເຈີທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ສົມບູນຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:15
msgid "Release Candidate (RC) Channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ Release Candidate (RC)"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:16
msgid ""
"**It is relatively stable but may occasionally contain bugs.** This channel "
"is for doing the last tests before releasing features to the Stable channel. "
"If you want features quicker, and you want to help to test, but your life "
"does not depend on your phone, and you can live with some downtime - RC is "
"for you. It does get updates generally every week."
msgstr ""
"**ມັນຂ້ອນຂ້າງສະຖຽນແຕ່ອາດຈະມີບັກບາງຄັ້ງຄາວ.** "
"ຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບການທົດສອບຄັ້ງທຳອິດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ອຍຟີເຈີໄປຍັງຊ່ອງທາງ Stable. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຟີເຈີໄວຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊ່ວຍທົດສອບ, ແຕ່ຊີວິດຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຶ້ນກັບໂທລະສັບຂອງທ່ານ, "
"ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດຍອມຮັບການຢຸດເຮັດວຽກບາງຄັ້ງໄດ້ - RC ແມ່ນສຳລັບທ່ານ. "
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປມັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດທຸກໆອາທິດ."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:22
msgid "Devel Channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ Devel (ພັດທະນາ)"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:23
msgid ""
"**This is where new features land for the first testing.** Although changes "
"have been validated before being released, bugs are to be expected. Don't "
"use Devel if you can't live with the fact that new features might break "
"things. Updates come if something has changed - so frequency can be daily."
msgstr ""
"**ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ຟີເຈີໃໝ່ລົງມາສຳລັບການທົດສອບຄັ້ງທຳອິດ.** "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ຮັບການກວດສອບກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ອຍອອກມາ, ແຕ່ບັກແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຄາດຫວັງວ່າຈະມີ. ຢ່າໃຊ້ "
"Devel ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຍອມຮັບຄວາມຈິງທີ່ວ່າຟີເຈີໃໝ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສິ່ງຕ່າງໆເສຍຫາຍໄດ້. "
"ການອັບເດດຈະມາເມື່ອມີບາງສິ່ງປ່ຽນແປງ - ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວາມຖີ່ອາດຈະເປັນລາຍວັນ."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:29
msgid "Edge Channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ Edge"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:30
msgid ""
"**This is where dragons live.** Here ideas and big new features are melted "
"into code for developers to work on and for the fearless to try them out. "
"Don't set this channel on a phone you use daily. Updates come as ideas "
"happen to developers. Sometimes very frequently, sometimes the channel isn't "
"used at all. Basically, if you need to ask what's in Edge, then it is not "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"**ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ມັງກອນອາໄສຢູ່.** ທີ່ນີ້ແນວຄວາມຄິດ ແລະ "
"ຟີເຈີໃໝ່ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຈະຖືກຫຼໍ່ຫຼອມເປັນໂຄ້ດສຳລັບນັກພັດທະນາເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ບໍ່ຢ້ານກົວເພື່ອທົດລອງໃຊ້. "
"ຢ່າຕັ້ງຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໃນໂທລະສັບທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ປະຈຳວັນ. ການອັບເດດຈະມາເມື່ອມີແນວຄວາມຄິດເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບນັກພັດທະນາ. "
"ບາງຄັ້ງກໍຖີ່ຫຼາຍ, ບາງຄັ້ງຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ກໍບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ. ໂດຍພື້ນຖານແລ້ວ, "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖາມວ່າມີຫຍັງຢູ່ໃນ Edge, ມັນກໍບໍ່ເໝາະສຳລັບທ່ານ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:2
msgid "Security vulnerabilities"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:4
msgid ""
"We take security vulnerabilities seriously. If you've found one, the best "
"way to report it is to create a confidential issue on our `bug tracker "
"<https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/ubuntu-touch>`_. Make sure you "
"select \"This issue is confidential and should only be visible to team "
"members with at least Reporter access\" when creating the issue. After that, "
"we'll get to work with the reported issue. We might contact you via the "
"issue if there is additional information needed. And we'll determine the "
"disclosure."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພຢ່າງຈິງຈັງ. ຖ້າທ່ານພົບເຫັນມັນ, "
"ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນການລາຍງານແມ່ນການສ້າງບັນຫາລັບ (confidential issue) ໃນ `bug tracker "
"<https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/ubuntu-touch>`_ ຂອງພວກເຮົາ. "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເລືອກ \"This issue is confidential and should only be visible to "
"team members with at least Reporter access\" ເມື່ອສ້າງບັນຫາ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, "
"ພວກເຮົາຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກກັບບັນຫາທີ່ລາຍງານມາ. "
"ພວກເຮົາອາດຈະຕິດຕໍ່ຫາທ່ານຜ່ານທາງບັນຫານັ້ນຖ້າມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ແລະ "
"ພວກເຮົາຈະກຳນົດການເປີດເຜີຍຂໍ້ມູນ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:7
msgid "How to handle a security fix"
msgstr "ວິທີຈັດການການແກ້ໄຂຄວາມປອດໄພ"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:9
msgid ""
"For UBports development members, these are recommended steps to handle "
"fixing the issue without disclosing to public before the fix is ready:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບສະມາຊິກການພັດທະນາ UBports, "
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການຈັດການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໂດຍບໍ່ເປີດເຜີຍຕໍ່ສາທາລະນະກ່ອນທີ່ການແກ້ໄຂຈະພ້ອມ:"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:11
msgid ""
"Given a main repo, ensure that the ``<project>.secfix`` repo exists. If not, "
"fork from the main project to the same namespace, but set the visibility to "
"private."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ main repo, ໃຫ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າ ``<project>.secfix`` repo ມີຢູ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ fork "
"ຈາກໂຄງການຫຼັກໄປຍັງ namespace ດຽວກັນ, ແຕ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເບິ່ງເຫັນເປັນ private."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:13
msgid ""
"The ``.secfix`` suffix will prevent CI from touching this repo, preventing "
"the repo from leaking."
msgstr "ຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ ``.secfix`` ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ CI ມາແຕະຕ້ອງ repo ນີ້, ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ repo ຮົ່ວໄຫຼ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:15
msgid ""
"If there isn't an issue for it already, create a confidential issue on the "
"main project."
msgstr "ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ມີບັນຫາສຳລັບມັນເທື່ອ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງບັນຫາລັບໃນໂຄງການຫຼັກ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:16
msgid ""
"On the issue, use \"Create confidential merge request\". Set the branch name "
"and the source branch appropriately. Then, push to this branch from your "
"local Git tree."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ \"Create confidential merge request\". ກຳນົດຊື່ສາຂາ ແລະ "
"ສາຂາຕົ້ນທາງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ. ຈາກນັ້ນ, push ໄປຍັງສາຂານີ້ຈາກ Git tree ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:18
msgid ""
"This MR will target the ``.secfix`` repo, NOT the main repo [1]_. This "
"allows reviewing the patch to happen in private."
msgstr ""
"MR ນີ້ຈະມີເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ ``.secfix`` repo, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ main repo [1]_. ສິ່ງນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ການກວດສອບ "
"patch ເກີດຂຶ້ນແບບລັບໆ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:20
msgid ""
"Another developer then reviews and merges the merge request. If backport is "
"needed, it must also happen in the ``.secfix`` fork."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນນັກພັດທະນາຄົນອື່ນຈະກວດສອບ ແລະ merge merge request. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ backport, "
"ມັນຕ້ອງເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນ ``.secfix`` fork ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:22
msgid ""
"Since we don't have confidential CI yet, it is both the developer and "
"reviewer's responsibility to ensure that the code will compile, pass tests, "
"and is tested locally."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກເຮົາຍັງບໍ່ມີ CI ແບບລັບໆເທື່ອ, ມັນເປັນຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບຂອງທັງນັກພັດທະນາ ແລະ ຜູ້ກວດສອບ "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າໂຄ້ດຈະ compile, ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ, ແລະ ຖືກທົດສອບໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:24
msgid ""
"At ~1 day before the release date of a release candidate, a developer "
"(usually the release manager) merges all branches of ``.secfix`` repo to the "
"main repo. After that, the confidential issue is marked unconfidential. This "
"makes the issue public for the first time."
msgstr ""
"ປະມານ 1 ມື້ກ່ອນວັນປ່ອຍ release candidate, ນັກພັດທະນາ (ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນ release manager) "
"ຈະ merge ສາຂາທັງໝົດຂອງ ``.secfix`` repo ໄປຍັງ main repo. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, "
"ບັນຫາລັບຈະຖືກໝາຍເປັນບໍ່ລັບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ບັນຫາຖືກເປີດເຜີຍຕໍ່ສາທາລະນະເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:26
msgid ""
"At this point, it is this developer's responsibility to ensure that the "
"merge result actually passes CI and that at least the basic functionality of "
"this component is not broken."
msgstr ""
"ມາຮອດຈຸດນີ້, ມັນເປັນຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບຂອງນັກພັດທະນາຜູ້ນີ້ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າຜົນຂອງການ merge ຜ່ານ CI ແທ້ "
"ແລະ ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍການເຮັດວຽກພື້ນຖານຂອງອົງປະກອບນີ້ບໍ່ເສຍຫາຍ."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:28
msgid ""
"The release manager will ensure that the fix actually lands in the daily "
"image before choosing such image as an RC."
msgstr ""
"Release manager ຈະຮັບປະກັນວ່າການແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ເຂົ້າໄປຢູ່ໃນ daily image ແທ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລືອກ image "
"ດັ່ງກ່າວເປັນ RC."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:29
msgid ""
"Before the release date, the fixing developer will prepare the security "
"advisory, containing (the list is inspired by Curl's advisories [2]_):"
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນວັນປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ, ນັກພັດທະນາທີ່ແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຈະກະກຽມຄຳແນະນຳດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍ "
"(ລາຍການແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈຈາກຄຳແນະນຳຂອງ Curl [2]_):"

