"Thirdly, it is possible to develop cross-platform apps that don't depend on "
"Ubuntu specific APIs, although this is not the official way of developing "
"apps for Ubuntu Touch. If running on other operating systems is a "
"requirement for your app, you can refer to these APIs instead:"
msgstr ""
"ທີສາມ, ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະພັດທະນາແອັບຂ້າມແພລັດຟອມທີ່ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບ APIs ສະເພາະຂອງ Ubuntu, "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນວິທີການຢ່າງເປັນທາງການໃນການພັດທະນາແອັບສຳລັບ Ubuntu Touch. "
"ຖ້າການເຮັດວຽກໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນແມ່ນຄວາມຕ້ອງການສຳລັບແອັບຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດອ້າງອີງເຖິງ APIs "
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແທນ:"

#: ../../appdev/external-docs.rst:21
msgid "`Kirigami API <https://api.kde.org/frameworks/kirigami/html/>`__"
msgstr "`Kirigami API <https://api.kde.org/frameworks/kirigami/html/>`__"

#: ../../appdev/external-docs.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Qt Quick Controls 2 API <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtquickcontrols-"
"index.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Qt Quick Controls 2 API <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtquickcontrols-"
"index.html>`__"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:4
msgid "The content hub - tips and tricks"
msgstr "Content Hub - ເຄັດລັບ ແລະ ເຕັກນິກ"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:9
msgid "Content Hub Share Page"
msgstr "ໜ້າແບ່ງປັນ Content Hub"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:11
msgid ""
"On Ubuntu Touch the apps are confined. The way of sharing files between them "
"is through the Content Hub, a part of the system that takes care of file "
"import, export and sharing."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Ubuntu Touch ແອັບຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຂອບເຂດ (confined). "
"ວິທີການແບ່ງປັນໄຟລ໌ລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນແມ່ນຜ່ານ Content Hub, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງລະບົບທີ່ເບິ່ງແຍງການນຳເຂົ້າ, ສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນໄຟລ໌."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:14
msgid "Different ways of sharing the content"
msgstr "ວິທີຕ່າງໆໃນການແບ່ງປັນເນື້ອຫາ"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:16
msgid ""
"As we can see in the `Content Hub documentation <https://api-"
"docs.ubports.com/sdk/apps/qml/Ubuntu.Content/ContentHandler.html#detailed-"
"description>`_, there are several ways of handling the file to be shared:"
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາເຫັນໃນ `ເອກະສານ Content Hub <https://api-docs.ubports.com/sdk/apps/"
"qml/Ubuntu.Content/ContentHandler.html#detailed-description>`_, "
"ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການຈັດການໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະແບ່ງປັນ:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:18
msgid ""
"``ContentHandler.Source`` (The selected app will provide a file to be "
"imported)"
msgstr "``ContentHandler.Source`` (ແອັບທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະໜອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະນຳເຂົ້າ)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:19
msgid ""
"``ContentHandler.Destination`` (The selected app will be the destination for "
"the exported file)"
msgstr "``ContentHandler.Destination`` (ແອັບທີ່ເລືອກຈະເປັນປາຍທາງສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:20
msgid ""
"``ContentHandler.Share`` (The selected app will be the destination for the "
"exported file, which will then be shared externally)"
msgstr ""
"``ContentHandler.Share`` (ແອັບທີ່ເລືອກຈະເປັນປາຍທາງສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈາກນັ້ນຈະຖືກແບ່ງປັນອອກໄປພາຍນອກ)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:28
msgid "Importing"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າ (Importing)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:33
msgid "Webapp Creator on the OpenStore"
msgstr "Webapp Creator ໃນ OpenStore"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:35
msgid ""
"Looking into the code of Webapp Creator, we’ll find the code to import an "
"image to be used as icon. Tapping on the place holder will open the Content "
"Hub that will let us choose from where to import the image (`see the Webapp "
"Creator source code <https://gitlab.com/cibersheep/webapp-creator/blob/"
"master/webapp-creator/app/ImportPage.qml#L38>`_)"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເບິ່ງເຂົ້າໄປໃນໂຄ້ດຂອງ Webapp Creator, "
"ພວກເຮົາຈະພົບເຫັນໂຄ້ດເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນໄອຄອນ. ການແຕະໃສ່ບ່ອນວາງ ຈະເປີດ Content Hub "
"ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາເລືອກບ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບ (`ເບິ່ງຊອດໂຄ້ດ Webapp Creator <https://"
"gitlab.com/cibersheep/webapp-creator/blob/master/webapp-creator/app/"
"ImportPage.qml#L38>`_)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:46
msgid "``ContentPeerPicker`` is the element that shows the apps."
msgstr "``ContentPeerPicker`` ແມ່ນອົງປະກອບທີ່ສະແດງແອັບຕ່າງໆ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:52
msgid ""
"``contentType`` is passed in `Main.qml <https://gitlab.com/cibersheep/webapp-"
"creator/blob/master/webapp-creator/app/Main.qml#L118>`_ as "
"ContentType.Pictures. So, we will only see apps from which we only can "
"import images. ``handler`` is passed in the same line as "
"ContentHandler.Source. As we want to import an image from the app selected "
"in the Content Hub."
msgstr ""
"``contentType`` ຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃນ `Main.qml <https://gitlab.com/cibersheep/webapp-"
"creator/blob/master/webapp-creator/app/Main.qml#L118>`_ ເປັນ "
"ContentType.Pictures. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ພວກເຮົາຈະເຫັນພຽງແຕ່ແອັບທີ່ພວກເຮົາສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ``handler`` "
"ຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃນແຖວດຽວກັນເປັນ ContentHandler.Source. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບຈາກແອັບທີ່ເລືອກໃນ Content Hub."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:55
msgid "Exporting"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງອອກ (Exporting)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:60
msgid "Gelek in the OpenStore"
msgstr "Gelek ໃນ OpenStore"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:62
msgid ""
"In Gelek, we are going to end with some saved games that we want to save in "
"our device or share with ourselves (in Telegram and then save them to our "
"computer)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Gelek, ພວກເຮົາຈະຈົບລົງດ້ວຍເກມທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ "
"ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນອຸປະກອນຂອງພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື ແບ່ງປັນກັບຕົວເຮົາເອງ (ໃນ Telegram ແລະ "
"ຈາກນັ້ນບັນທຶກພວກມັນໄວ້ໃນຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງພວກເຮົາ)."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:66
msgid ""
"Tapping on the download icon we will get a Content Hub to *save* the game "
"file (which is actually an export)."
msgstr ""
"ການແຕະໃສ່ໄອຄອນດາວໂຫຼດ ພວກເຮົາຈະໄດ້ຮັບ Content Hub ເພື່ອ *ບັນທຶກ* ໄຟລ໌ເກມ "
"(ເຊິ່ງຄວາມຈິງແລ້ວແມ່ນການສົ່ງອອກ)."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:68
msgid ""
"The game file is a file of type ``glksave``. We will tell Content Hub that "
"we are sending a file of type ``All`` (`see the Install Page code <https://"
"gitlab.com/cibersheep/gelek/blob/master/app/InstallPage.qml#L38>`_)."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ເກມແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ປະເພດ ``glksave``. ພວກເຮົາຈະບອກ Content Hub "
"ວ່າພວກເຮົາກຳລັງສົ່ງໄຟລ໌ປະເພດ ``All`` (`ເບິ່ງໂຄ້ດ Install Page <https://gitlab.com/"
"cibersheep/gelek/blob/master/app/InstallPage.qml#L38>`_)."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:81
msgid ""
"``contentType`` is ``ContentType.All``, so we will only see apps which are "
"able to receive unmarked file types. ``handler`` is "
"``ContentHandler.Destination``, so the app selected should store the saved "
"game."
msgstr ""
"``contentType`` ແມ່ນ ``ContentType.All``, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ພວກເຮົາຈະເຫັນພຽງແຕ່ແອັບທີ່ສາມາດຮັບປະເພດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍໄວ້. ``handler`` ແມ່ນ "
"``ContentHandler.Destination``, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ແອັບທີ່ເລືອກຄວນຈະເກັບຮັກສາເກມທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:83
msgid ""
"Tapping on the File Manager we will save the saved game in the folder we "
"choose."
msgstr "ການແຕະໃສ່ File Manager ພວກເຮົາຈະບັນທຶກເກມທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ພວກເຮົາເລືອກ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:86
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr "ການແບ່ງປັນ (Sharing)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:88
msgid ""
"Similarly, tapping on the share icon will allow us to send the saved game "
"through Telegram to ourselves (`see the Webapp Creator Import Page source "
"code <https://gitlab.com/cibersheep/webapp-creator/blob/master/webapp-"
"creator/app/ImportPage.qml#L38>`_). Sharing is similar to exporting, except "
"the destination app may share the content externally (for example, over "
"Telegram or text message)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ການແຕະໃສ່ໄອຄອນແບ່ງປັນ ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສົ່ງເກມທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຜ່ານ Telegram "
"ຫາຕົວເຮົາເອງ (`ເບິ່ງຊອດໂຄ້ດ Webapp Creator Import Page <https://gitlab.com/"
"cibersheep/webapp-creator/blob/master/webapp-creator/app/"
"ImportPage.qml#L38>`_). ການແບ່ງປັນແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັບການສົ່ງອອກ, "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນແອັບປາຍທາງອາດຈະແບ່ງປັນເນື້ອຫາອອກໄປພາຍນອກ (ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ຜ່ານ Telegram ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມ)."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:101
msgid ""
"The only difference between this and the previous code is that ``handler`` "
"is ``ContentHandler.Share``."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງພຽງຢ່າງດຽວລະຫວ່າງອັນນີ້ ແລະ ໂຄ້ດກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ແມ່ນ ``handler`` ແມ່ນ "
"``ContentHandler.Share``."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:104
msgid "Wait a minute. Why the different apps?"
msgstr "ດຽວກ່ອນ. ເປັນຫຍັງຈຶ່ງມີແອັບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:109
msgid "Content Hub: Export vs Share"
msgstr "Content Hub: Export ທຽບກັບ Share"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:111
msgid ""
"Each developer can decide the rules each app would follow in relation to the "
"Content Hub. Why the OpenStore is shown as the destination of an export?"
msgstr ""
"ນັກພັດທະນາແຕ່ລະຄົນສາມາດຕັດສິນໃຈກົດລະບຽບທີ່ແຕ່ລະແອັບຈະປະຕິບັດຕາມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ Content Hub. "
"ເປັນຫຍັງ OpenStore ຈຶ່ງສະແດງເປັນປາຍທາງຂອງການສົ່ງອອກ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:113
msgid "Let’s check its manifest.json"
msgstr "ມາເບິ່ງ manifest.json ຂອງມັນກັນ"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:126
msgid ""
"The above code defines that the hooks for the app named ``\"openstore\"`` in "
"relation to the ``\"content-hub\"`` should follow the rules defined in "
"``openstore-contenthub.json``"
msgstr ""
"ໂຄ້ດຂ້າງເທິງກຳນົດວ່າ hooks ສຳລັບແອັບຊື່ ``\"openstore\"`` ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ ``\"content-"
"hub\"`` ຄວນປະຕິບັດຕາມກົດລະບຽບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ ``openstore-contenthub.json``"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:136
msgid ""
"This means, the OpenStore will be the destination for *all* ``ContentTypes``."
msgstr "ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ, OpenStore ຈະເປັນປາຍທາງສຳລັບ ``ContentTypes`` *ທັງໝົດ*."

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:138
msgid "What about uMatriks? Let’s see its ``content-hub.json``"
msgstr "ແລ້ວ uMatriks ເດ? ມາເບິ່ງ ``content-hub.json`` ຂອງມັນກັນ"

#: ../../appdev/guides/contenthub.rst:166
msgid ""
"So, with this example, uMatriks will be able to be the destination, source "
"and share app for all kinds of ``ContentType``. What about the other hooks "
"in the ``manifest.json``? That is discussed in the next guide."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ດ້ວຍຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, uMatriks ຈະສາມາດເປັນປາຍທາງ, ຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ແອັບແບ່ງປັນສຳລັບ "
"``ContentType`` ທຸກປະເພດ. ແລ້ວ hooks ອື່ນໆໃນ ``manifest.json`` ເດ? "
"ນັ້ນຈະຖືກສົນທະນາໃນຄູ່ມືຖັດໄປ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:2
msgid "Handle C++ dependencies with Clickable"
msgstr "ຈັດການການເພິ່ງພາອາໄສ (Dependencies) ຂອງ C++ ດ້ວຍ Clickable"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:4
msgid ""
"If an app depends on a library that is not pre-installed in Ubuntu Touch, "
"the app needs to ship it inside the click package. This guide shows how this "
"can be done with Clickable."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າແອັບຂຶ້ນກັບ library ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງມາກ່ອນໃນ Ubuntu Touch, ແອັບຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃສ່ມັນໄວ້ພາຍໃນແພັກເກດ "
"click. ຄູ່ມືນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ແນວໃດດ້ວຍ Clickable."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:7
#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/index.rst:11
msgid "Building"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ (Building)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:8
msgid ""
"Sometimes libraries are available pre-built, allowing you to skip the build "
"step. Compiling your dependency is recommended though, as it gives you more "
"control over the whole process and may lead to better results (e.g. better "
"performance or smaller package sizes)."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງ libraries ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແບບສ້າງສຳເລັດຮູບ (pre-built), ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນການ build "
"ໄດ້. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ compile dependency ຂອງທ່ານ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນໃຫ້ທ່ານຄວບຄຸມຂະບວນການທັງໝົດໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ແລະ ອາດຈະນຳໄປສູ່ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີກວ່າ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດແພັກເກດທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ)."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:11
msgid "Compilation"
msgstr "ການ Compile"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:12
msgid ""
"Put the library's source code at ``libs/LIBNAME`` (replacing ``LIBNAME`` by "
"the library's name), because this is where clickable will look for it by "
"default. If the dependency source code is available as a git repository, it "
"is a good idea to add it as a `git submodule <https://git-scm.com/book/de/v1/"
"Git-Tools-Submodule>`_. Otherwise add a script to download the sources."
msgstr ""
"ວາງຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ library ໄວ້ທີ່ ``libs/LIBNAME`` (ປ່ຽນ ``LIBNAME`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງ library), "
"ເພາະວ່ານີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ clickable ຈະຊອກຫາມັນໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖ້າຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງ dependency ມີໃຫ້ເປັນ "
"git repository, ມັນເປັນຄວາມຄິດທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມມັນເປັນ `git submodule <https://git-scm.com/"
"book/de/v1/Git-Tools-Submodule>`_. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດຊອດໂຄ້ດ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:14
msgid ""
"Add a `libraries section <https://clickable.bhdouglass.com/en/latest/project-"
"config.html#libraries>`_ to your clickable.yaml, like this:"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ `libraries section <https://clickable.bhdouglass.com/en/latest/project-"
"config.html#libraries>`_ ໃສ່ clickable.yaml ຂອງທ່ານ, ແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:24
msgid ""
"If the library does not contain a CMake configuration, you need to use the "
"`qmake` or `custom` builder instead."
msgstr "ຖ້າ library ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ CMake, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຕົວສ້າງ `qmake` ຫຼື `custom` ແທນ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:26
msgid ""
"Optionally, configure the compilation by adding ``build_args``, which may "
"look like this:"
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກເສີມ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າການ compilation ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ ``build_args``, "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະມີລັກສະນະແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:41
msgid ""
"Most build arguments are project specific. Therefore, study the library's "
"build instructions and also look for ``option`` settings in its "
"``CMakeLists.txt`` ."
msgstr ""
"Build arguments ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນສະເພາະຂອງໂຄງການ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ສຶກສາຄຳແນະນຳການ build ຂອງ "
"library ແລະ ຊອກຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``option`` ໃນ ``CMakeLists.txt`` ຂອງມັນດ້ວຍ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:43
msgid ""
"To actually build the library for all architectures run ``clickable build --"
"libs --arch armhf``, ``clickable build --libs --arch arm64`` and ``clickable "
"build --libs --arch amd64``. Don't forget to mention this step in your "
"README, so that others can reproduce the build process."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອ build library ສຳລັບທຸກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຢ່າງແທ້ຈິງ ໃຫ້ run ``clickable build --libs "
"--arch armhf``, ``clickable build --libs --arch arm64`` ແລະ ``clickable "
"build --libs --arch amd64``. ຢ່າລືມລະບຸຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໃນ README ຂອງທ່ານ, "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄົນອື່ນສາມາດເຮັດຊ້ຳຂະບວນການ build ໄດ້."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:45
msgid ""
"See how `Teleports clickable.yaml <https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/"
"apps/teleports/-/blob/main/clickable.yaml#L26>`_ uses the libraries feature "
"to build its dependency tdlib."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງວິທີທີ່ `clickable.yaml ຂອງ Teleports <https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/"
"apps/teleports/-/blob/main/clickable.yaml#L26>`_ ໃຊ້ຟີເຈີ libraries ເພື່ອ build "
"dependency tdlib ຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:48
msgid "Pre-built"
msgstr "ສ້າງສຳເລັດຮູບ (Pre-built)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:49
msgid "If you compiled your library as described above, skip this step."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານ compile library ຂອງທ່ານຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍຂ້າງເທິງ, ໃຫ້ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:51
msgid ""
"A pre-built library is usually only available as a shared object that needs "
"to be linked dynamically. Furthermore, it may contain components that you "
"don't need, resulting in a bloated app. It may even miss something that you "
"could achieve by compiling it yourself. Sometimes, a library is available in "
"the Ubuntu Repositories, but is not installable for the architecture you "
"need (likely ``armhf`` or ``arm64``). In this case you have to compile the "
"library as described above."
msgstr ""
"library ແບບ pre-built ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມີໃຫ້ເປັນ shared object ທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ link ແບບ "
"dynamically ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຍິ່ງໄປກວ່ານັ້ນ, ມັນອາດຈະມີອົງປະກອບທີ່ທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ, "
"ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ແອັບມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປ. ມັນອາດຈະຂາດບາງຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການ compile "
"ດ້ວຍຕົວທ່ານເອງ. ບາງຄັ້ງ, library ມີຢູ່ໃນ Ubuntu Repositories, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ (ໜ້າຈະເປັນ ``armhf`` ຫຼື ``arm64``). "
"ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ທ່ານຕ້ອງ compile library ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍຂ້າງເທິງ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:53
msgid ""
"If the library is available in the Ubuntu Repositories, you can add it to "
"the dependencies list, like this:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ library ມີຢູ່ໃນ Ubuntu Repositories, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ dependencies "
"ໄດ້, ແບບນີ້:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:62
msgid ""
"Clickable will install the specified package automatically for the target "
"architecture inside the build container. An example can be found in `Guitar "
"Tools' clickable.json <https://github.com/t-mon/guitar-tools/blob/master/"
"clickable.json#L4>`_."
msgstr ""
"Clickable ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳເປົ້າໝາຍພາຍໃນ build "
"container. ຕົວຢ່າງສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ `clickable.json ຂອງ Guitar Tools <https://"
"github.com/t-mon/guitar-tools/blob/master/clickable.json#L4>`_."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:64
msgid ""
"If the library can be found in a PPA, you can add the PPA to the "
"clickable.yaml, too. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ library ສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ PPA, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ PPA ໃສ່ clickable.yaml ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:75
msgid "Otherwise add a script to download the pre-built library."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດ pre-built library."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:78
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:79
msgid ""
"First, you need to specify the include directory where the headers can be "
"found that you include into the app's source code. Second, you need to link "
"the library's binary against your app's binary."
msgstr ""
"ທຳອິດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸ include directory ບ່ອນທີ່ສາມາດຊອກຫາ headers "
"ທີ່ທ່ານລວມເຂົ້າໃນຊອດໂຄ້ດຂອງແອັບໄດ້. ທີສອງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງ link binary ຂອງ library ເຂົ້າກັບ "
"binary ຂອງແອັບທ່ານ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:81
msgid ""
"In case the library contains a CMake configuration file, you can use the "
"`find_package <https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/command/"
"find_package.html>`_ command, which provides you with a target to link "
"against or variables pointing to the library's binary and include "
"directories. The additional lines on your CMakeLists.txt then may look like:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ library ມີໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ CMake, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `find_package <https://"
"cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/command/find_package.html>`_, ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ເປົ້າໝາຍໃນການ "
"link ຫຼື ຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາ binary ຂອງ library ແລະ include directories. ແຖວເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ "
"CMakeLists.txt ຂອງທ່ານອາດຈະມີລັກສະນະຄື:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:90
msgid ""
"The ``find_package`` command usually defines the path to the include "
"directory as ``SOMELIBRARY_INCLUDE_DIRS`` and the library's binaries as "
"``SOMELIBRARY_LIBS`` (check on the library's documentation on what their "
"CMake configuration provides exactly). Use them with the "
"``include_directories`` and ``target_link_libraries`` commands. See the "
"`Camera Scanner ImageProcessing CMakeLists.txt <https://github.com/jonnius/"
"camera-scanner/blob/master/plugins/ImageProcessing/CMakeLists.txt#L23>`_ for "
"a real world example."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງ ``find_package`` ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ include directory ເປັນ "
"``SOMELIBRARY_INCLUDE_DIRS`` ແລະ binaries ຂອງ library ເປັນ "
"``SOMELIBRARY_LIBS`` (ກວດເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ library ວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ CMake "
"ຂອງພວກເຂົາໃຫ້ຫຍັງແດ່). ໃຊ້ພວກມັນກັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``include_directories`` ແລະ "
"``target_link_libraries``. ເບິ່ງ `Camera Scanner ImageProcessing "
"CMakeLists.txt <https://github.com/jonnius/camera-scanner/blob/master/"
"plugins/ImageProcessing/CMakeLists.txt#L23>`_ ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງໃນໂລກຕົວຈິງ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:92
msgid ""
"At this point you should already be able to test with Clickable's desktop "
"mode running ``clickable desktop``."
msgstr ""
"ມາຮອດຈຸດນີ້ ທ່ານຄວນຈະສາມາດທົດສອບກັບໂໝດ desktop ຂອງ Clickable ໄດ້ແລ້ວ ໂດຍການ run "
"``clickable desktop``."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:95
msgid "Deployment"
msgstr "ການນຳໄປໃຊ້ (Deployment)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:96
msgid ""
"If you linked the library statically, you can skip this step, as the "
"library's binary is already inside your app's binary."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານ link library ແບບ statically, ທ່ານສາມາດຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໄດ້, ເນື່ອງຈາກ binary ຂອງ "
"library ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ binary ຂອງແອັບທ່ານແລ້ວ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:98
msgid ""
"Find out which shared object files (``*.so``) you need to ship. You can do "
"so by starting the app on your device via ``clickable && clickable logs``. "
"You should see an error message telling you which shared object file was "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາວ່າໄຟລ໌ shared object (``*.so``) ໃດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃສ່ໄປນຳ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເລີ່ມແອັບໃນອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ ``clickable && clickable logs``. "
"ທ່ານຄວນຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດບອກທ່ານວ່າໄຟລ໌ shared object ໃດຂາດຫາຍໄປ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:100
msgid ""
"Find the path to the shared object files. For libraries built via clickable, "
"they are located somewhere in the library's install dir, which is located "
"inside the library's build dir by default (e.g. ``build/arm-linux-gnueabihf/"
"opencv/install``). For pre-built libraries run ``clickable run \"find / "
"-name 'libSomething.so'\"`` (replacing ``libSomething.so`` by the file your "
"are looking for). This should print the path to the file (along with some "
"error messages you can ignore). In general, ``/usr/lib``  is a good bet when "
"looking for the shared object files."
msgstr ""
"ຊອກຫາເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ shared object. ສຳລັບ libraries ທີ່ build ຜ່ານ clickable, "
"ພວກມັນຈະຕັ້ງຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດບ່ອນໜຶ່ງໃນ install dir ຂອງ library, ເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງຢູ່ພາຍໃນ build dir ຂອງ "
"library ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ``build/arm-linux-gnueabihf/opencv/install``). ສຳລັບ "
"libraries ແບບ pre-built ໃຫ້ run ``clickable run \"find / -name "
"'libSomething.so'\"`` (ປ່ຽນ ``libSomething.so`` ດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງຊອກຫາ). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ອອກມາ (ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດບາງຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດບໍ່ສົນໃຈໄດ້). ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, "
"``/usr/lib`` ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະຊອກຫາໄຟລ໌ shared object."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:102
msgid ""
"To get the files into the click package, add the `install_lib <https://"
"clickable.bhdouglass.com/en/latest/project-config.html#install-lib>`_ key to "
"your clickable.yaml:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເອົາໄຟລ໌ເຂົ້າໄປໃນແພັກເກດ click, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄີ `install_lib <https://"
"clickable.bhdouglass.com/en/latest/project-config.html#install-lib>`_ ໃສ່ "
"clickable.yaml ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:115
