"built with Clickable. The asterisk in ``.so*`` helps to catch symbolic links "
"along with the actual library which are used to point to the current version."
msgstr ""
"ແຖວຂ້າງເທິງມີສອງຕົວຢ່າງ. ອັນທຳອິດຕິດຕັ້ງ library ທີ່ build ດ້ວຍ Clickable. ດາວຈໍາໃນ "
"``.so*`` ຊ່ວຍຈັບ symbolic links ພ້ອມກັບ library ຕົວຈິງເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊີ້ໄປຫາເວີຊັນປະຈຸບັນ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:117
msgid ""
"Depending on the library, you might need to ship some additional data. In "
"that case consult the library's readme or install instructions."
msgstr ""
"ຂຶ້ນກັບ library, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມບາງຢ່າງໄປນຳ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ປຶກສາ readme ຫຼື "
"ຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງ library."

#: ../../appdev/guides/dependencies.rst:119
msgid ""
"You should be set up to build and install your click package on a device "
"connected to your computer now by running ``clickable``."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຄວນຈະພ້ອມທີ່ຈະ build ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ click "
"ຂອງທ່ານໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ ໂດຍການ run ``clickable``."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:2
msgid "Importing from Content Hub and URLdispatcher"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າຈາກ Content Hub ແລະ URLdispatcher"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:15
msgid ""
"In the previous guide we have seen a little bit about how Content Hub works. "
"In this guide we will see how ``URLdispatcher`` works and how to handle "
"imported data from the Content Hub."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຄູ່ມືກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ເຫັນເລັກນ້ອຍກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Content Hub. ໃນຄູ່ມືນີ້ "
"ພວກເຮົາຈະເຫັນວ່າ ``URLdispatcher`` ເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ ແລະ ວິທີຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກ Content "
"Hub."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:18
msgid "Handle data from the Content Hub"
msgstr "ຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ Content Hub"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:23
msgid "OpenStore app from open-store.io"
msgstr "ແອັບ OpenStore ຈາກ open-store.io"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:25
msgid ""
"One of the easiest ways of testing an app, is to send a test click to "
"yourself on Telegram, and opening that click file with the OpenStore through "
"the Content Hub:"
msgstr ""
"ໜຶ່ງໃນວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການທົດສອບແອັບ, ແມ່ນການສົ່ງ test click ໃຫ້ຕົວທ່ານເອງໃນ Telegram, ແລະ "
"ເປີດໄຟລ໌ click ນັ້ນດ້ວຍ OpenStore ຜ່ານ Content Hub:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:30
msgid ""
"If we tap on the OpenStore app, it will be opened and it will ask if we want "
"to install the click file. Let’s take a look into `the Main.qml code of the "
"app <https://github.com/UbuntuOpenStore/openstore-app/blob/master/openstore/"
"Main.qml#L85>`_ to see how it is done:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າພວກເຮົາແຕະໃສ່ແອັບ OpenStore, ມັນຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ມັນຈະຖາມວ່າພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ click "
"ບໍ່. ມາເບິ່ງ `ໂຄ້ດ Main.qml ຂອງແອັບ <https://github.com/UbuntuOpenStore/openstore-"
"app/blob/master/openstore/Main.qml#L85>`_ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າມັນເຮັດແນວໃດ:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:49
msgid ""
"Do you see that Connections element that targets the ContentHub? When it "
"receives the signal onImportRequested, it will take the url of the data sent "
"from the Content Hub (``transfer.items[0].url`` is the url of the first data "
"sent) and open a ``PopUp`` element to let the user install the click."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານເຫັນອົງປະກອບ Connections ທີ່ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ ContentHub ບໍ່? ເມື່ອມັນໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານ "
"onImportRequested, ມັນຈະເອົາ url ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສົ່ງມາຈາກ Content Hub "
"(``transfer.items[0].url`` ແມ່ນ url ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທຳອິດທີ່ສົ່ງມາ) ແລະ ເປີດອົງປະກອບ ``PopUp`` "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ click."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:52
msgid "What about the URLdispatcher?"
msgstr "ແລ້ວ URLdispatcher ເດ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:54
msgid ""
"The URL dispatcher is a piece of software, similar to the Content Hub, that "
"makes our life easier trying to choose the correct app for a certain "
"protocol. For example: We probably want to open the web browser when tapping "
"on an http protocol. If we tap on a map link it is handy to open it with "
"uNav or to open a twitter link in the Twitter app! How does that work?"
msgstr ""
"URL dispatcher ແມ່ນຊອບແວທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ Content Hub, "
"ທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຊີວິດຂອງພວກເຮົາງ່າຍຂຶ້ນໃນການພະຍາຍາມເລືອກແອັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບໂປຣໂຕຄໍໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ພວກເຮົາອາດຈະຕ້ອງການເປີດເວັບບຣາວເຊີເມື່ອແຕະໃສ່ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ http. ຖ້າພວກເຮົາແຕະໃສ່ລິ້ງແຜນທີ່ "
"ມັນຈະສະດວກຖ້າເປີດດ້ວຍ uNav ຫຼື ເປີດລິ້ງ twitter ໃນແອັບ Twitter! ມັນເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:56
msgid ""
"The ``URLdispatcher`` selects which app (according to their "
"``manifest.json``) will open a certain link."
msgstr ""
"``URLdispatcher`` ເລືອກວ່າແອັບໃດ (ອີງຕາມ ``manifest.json`` ຂອງພວກເຂົາ) "
"ຈະເປີດລິ້ງໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:61
msgid ""
"Let’s see how our navigation app looks inside. uNav’s manifest shows special "
"hooks for the ``URLdispatcher`` in its `manifest.json code <https://"
"bazaar.launchpad.net/~unav-devs/unav/trunk/view/head:/manifest.json#L9>`_:"
msgstr ""
"ມາເບິ່ງວ່າແອັບນຳທາງຂອງພວກເຮົາມີລັກສະນະແນວໃດທາງໃນ. manifest ຂອງ uNav ສະແດງ hooks "
"ພິເສດສຳລັບ ``URLdispatcher`` ໃນ `ໂຄ້ດ manifest.json <https://"
"bazaar.launchpad.net/~unav-devs/unav/trunk/view/head:/manifest.json#L9>`_ "
"ຂອງມັນ:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:91
msgid ""
"This means that a link that looks like http://map.unav.me/xxxxx,xxxxx will "
"be opened in uNav. And that’s defined in lines 2 and 3, where it looks for "
"protocol http followed by map.unav.me."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າລິ້ງທີ່ມີລັກສະນະຄື http://map.unav.me/xxxxx,xxxxx ຈະຖືກເປີດໃນ uNav. ແລະ "
"ນັ້ນຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນແຖວ 2 ແລະ 3, ບ່ອນທີ່ມັນຊອກຫາໂປຣໂຕຄໍ http ຕາມດ້ວຍ map.unav.me."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:93
msgid ""
"Also, a URI formatted geo:xxx,xxx should open in uNav, as it’s defined in "
"line 11."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, URI ທີ່ມີຮູບແບບ geo:xxx,xxx ຄວນເປີດໃນ uNav, ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນແຖວ 11."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:96
msgid "And how do we manage the received URL?"
msgstr "ແລະ ພວກເຮົາຈັດການ URL ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແນວໃດ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:98
msgid ""
"After the ``URLdispatcher`` sends the link to the correspondent app, we need "
"to handle that URL or URI in the targeted app. Let’s see how to do that:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກ ``URLdispatcher`` ສົ່ງລິ້ງໄປຍັງແອັບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈັດການ URL ຫຼື URI "
"ນັ້ນໃນແອັບເປົ້າໝາຍ. ມາເບິ່ງວິທີເຮັດ:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:100
msgid ""
"In the main qml file, we need to add some code to know what to do with the "
"dispatched URL. Let's check how Linphone app manages this adding a "
"`connection to the URI Handler <https://gitlab.com/ubports-linphone/linphone-"
"simple/blob/master/qml/Main.qml#L212>`_ with a Connections element setting "
"``UriHandler`` as a target."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ qml ຫຼັກ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເພີ່ມໂຄ້ດບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າຈະເຮັດແນວໃດກັບ dispatched URL. "
"ມາເບິ່ງວິທີທີ່ແອັບ Linphone ຈັດການສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ `ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຍັງ URI Handler <https://"
"gitlab.com/ubports-linphone/linphone-simple/blob/master/qml/Main.qml#L212>`_ "
"ດ້ວຍອົງປະກອບ Connections ໂດຍຕັ້ງ ``UriHandler`` ເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:117
msgid ""
"This code will manage an URI in the form ``linphone://sip:xxx@xxx.xx`` when "
"the app is opened. But what do we need to do to handle this link when the "
"app is closed?"
msgstr ""
"ໂຄ້ດນີ້ຈະຈັດການ URI ໃນຮູບແບບ ``linphone://sip:xxx@xxx.xx`` ເມື່ອແອັບເປີດຢູ່. "
"ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເຮັດແນວໃດເພື່ອຈັດການລິ້ງນີ້ເມື່ອແອັບປິດຢູ່?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:119
msgid ""
"We need to add a little bit `extra code <https://gitlab.com/ubports-linphone/"
"linphone-simple/blob/master/qml/Main.qml#L76>`_ that will cover two cases: "
"1) We receive one URL 2) We receive more than one URL"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ `ໂຄ້ດພິເສດ <https://gitlab.com/ubports-linphone/linphone-"
"simple/blob/master/qml/Main.qml#L76>`_ ເລັກນ້ອຍ ເຊິ່ງຈະກວມເອົາສອງກໍລະນີ: 1) "
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຮັບໜຶ່ງ URL 2) ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຮັບຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງ URL"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:123
msgid ""
"Let's check if ``Qt.application.arguments`` is not empty and if not, if any "
"argument matches our URI format."
msgstr ""
"ມາກວດເບິ່ງວ່າ ``Qt.application.arguments`` ບໍ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ຫຼື ບໍ່ ແລະ ຖ້າບໍ່, ມີ argument "
"ໃດທີ່ກົງກັບຮູບແບບ URI ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:143
msgid ""
"Remember to check that %u (to receive 1 URL) or %U (to receive 1 or more "
"URLs) is present under the ``Exec`` line in the `.desktop <https://"
"gitlab.com/ubports-linphone/linphone-simple/-/blob/master/"
"linphone.desktop.in#L7>`_ file of the app."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມກວດເບິ່ງວ່າ %u (ເພື່ອຮັບ 1 URL) ຫຼື %U (ເພື່ອຮັບ 1 ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ URLs) ມີຢູ່ໃນແຖວ ``Exec`` "
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ `.desktop <https://gitlab.com/ubports-linphone/linphone-simple/-/blob/"
"master/linphone.desktop.in#L7>`_ ຂອງແອັບ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:146
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:148
msgid ""
"From command line, ``lomiri-url-dispatcher-dump`` command will give you the "
"full list of registered protocol schemes and their corresponding app."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກ command line, ຄຳສັ່ງ ``lomiri-url-dispatcher-dump`` ຈະໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ເຕັມຂອງ "
"protocol schemes ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ແອັບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:150
msgid ""
"Another usefull tool, but not installed by default on devices is ``lomiri-"
"url-dispatcher-tools``, it allows you to simulate a call from a third party "
"app. e.g: ``lomiri-url-dispatcher https://youtu.be/CIX-a-i6B1w`` will launch "
"youtube webapp."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດອີກອັນໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນອຸປະກອນແມ່ນ ``lomiri-url-dispatcher-"
"tools``, ມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານຈຳລອງການເອີ້ນຈາກແອັບພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ. ເຊັ່ນ: ``lomiri-url-"
"dispatcher https://youtu.be/CIX-a-i6B1w`` ຈະເປີດ youtube webapp."

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:152
msgid ""
"To install, it make your partition writable (``sudo mount -o rw,remount /``) "
"and install it via ``sudo apt install lomiri-url-dispatcher-tools``"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ partition ຂອງທ່ານຂຽນໄດ້ (``sudo mount -o rw,remount /``) ແລະ "
"ຕິດຕັ້ງມັນຜ່ານ ``sudo apt install lomiri-url-dispatcher-tools``"

#: ../../appdev/guides/importing-CH-urldispatcher.rst:157
msgid "What happens if more than one app has the same URL type defined?"
