#: ../../appdev/guides/port-to-focal.rst:2
msgid "Porting Apps to Focal"
msgstr "ການດັດແປງແອັບໄປຍັງ Focal (Porting Apps to Focal)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/port-to-focal.rst:4
msgid ""
"During the switch to Focal some changes were made to the app environment. In "
"order to ensure that the app will continue working, it is recommended to "
"update your app to Focal."
msgstr ""
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ Focal ໄດ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງບາງຢ່າງຕໍ່ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງແອັບ. "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າແອັບຈະສືບຕໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ອັບເດດແອັບຂອງທ່ານໄປຍັງ Focal."

#: ../../appdev/guides/port-to-focal.rst:7
msgid "QML"
msgstr "QML"

#: ../../appdev/guides/port-to-focal.rst:9
msgid ""
"Most changes will need to be made to any QML files. References to Ubuntu "
"were removed from QML Imports, and most QML classes. While there is a "
"compatability layer, it is recommended to move to the Lomiri Modules."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະຕ້ອງເຮັດກັບໄຟລ໌ QML ຕ່າງໆ. ການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ Ubuntu ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ QML "
"Imports, ແລະ QML classes ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີ compatibility layer "
"(ຊັ້ນຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້), ແຕ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຍ້າຍໄປໃຊ້ Lomiri Modules."

#: ../../appdev/guides/port-to-focal.rst:17
msgid ""
"Other references to Ubuntu were also Changed to Lomiri, such as "
"`UbuntuColors` being renamed `LomiriColors`. These must also be updated. "
"This can be somewhat automated:"
msgstr ""
"ການອ້າງອີງອື່ນໆເຖິງ Ubuntu ກໍຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ Lomiri ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ເຊັ່ນ `UbuntuColors` ຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ "
"`LomiriColors`. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດເຊັ່ນກັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໃນລະດັບໃດໜຶ່ງ:"

