#: ../../appdev/guides/pushnotifications.rst:2
#: ../../appdev/platform/index.rst:11
msgid "Push notifications"
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແບບ Push"

#: ../../appdev/guides/pushnotifications.rst:4
msgid ""
"Let's assume that you have an app created with Clickable and published on "
"the OpenStore. But now you want to be able to send Push Notifications to "
"your users. First of all, you need to understand how this is working:"
msgstr ""
"ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານມີແອັບທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ Clickable ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນ OpenStore. "
"ແຕ່ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແບບ Push ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານ. ກ່ອນອື່ນໝົດ, "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຂົ້າໃຈວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງມັນ:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/pushnotifications.rst:10
msgid ""
"Every app which uses push notifications has got a unique token. This token "
"identifies the user, the device and the app itself. The token is generated "
"by the UBports Push Service."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໆແອັບທີ່ໃຊ້ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແບບ Push ຈະມີໂໂເຄັນ (token) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ. ໂທເຄັນນີ້ລະບຸຜູ້ໃຊ້, ອຸປະກອນ "
"ແລະ ຕົວແອັບເອງ. ໂທເຄັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ UBports Push Service."

#: ../../appdev/guides/pushnotifications.rst:11
msgid ""
"You will need the token to send a push notification. So the app sends its "
"token to the app developer's server."
msgstr ""
