#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:2
msgid "User Metrics"
msgstr "User Metrics"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:5
msgid "What are User Metrics?"
msgstr "User Metrics ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:7
msgid ""
"If you look on the lock screen, you will see a circle. Inside the circle is "
"text. Look closer, and you’ll notice that the text contains data regarding "
"the user’s activity. Double tap on the middle of the circle, and you will "
"see more \"metrics\" about the user."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານເບິ່ງທີ່ໜ້າຈໍລັອກ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວົງມົນ. ທາງໃນວົງມົນແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ເບິ່ງໃກ້ໆ, ແລະ "
"ທ່ານຈະສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບກິດຈະກຳຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ແຕະສອງເທື່ອໃສ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງວົງມົນ, ແລະ "
"ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ \"metrics\" (ຕົວວັດແທກ) ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:11
msgid "This shows \"7 text messages sent today.\" How did it know?"
msgstr ""
"ອັນນີ້ສະແດງ \"7 text messages sent today.\" (ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ 7 ຂໍ້ຄວາມມື້ນີ້). ມັນຮູ້ໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:15
msgid ""
"This is from a 3rd-party application (`nCounter <https://gitlab.com/"
"joboticon/ncounter/>`_) that makes use of the User Metrics feature."
msgstr ""
"ອັນນີ້ແມ່ນມາຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ (`nCounter <https://gitlab.com/joboticon/"
"ncounter/>`_) ທີ່ໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດ User Metrics."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:17
msgid ""
"For the most part, these messages are quite clearly state what they are "
"counting, and which app is related. But where do these metrics come from?"
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ລະບຸຢ່າງຊັດເຈນວ່າພວກມັນກຳລັງນັບຫຍັງ, ແລະ ແອັບໃດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ແຕ່ "
"metrics ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມາຈາກໃສ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:20
msgid "How can I use User Metrics in my application?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍສາມາດໃຊ້ User Metrics ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງຂ້ອຍໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:22
msgid ""
"All of the following information will be based on the code for `nCounter`_."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ທັງໝົດຈະອີງໃສ່ code ສຳລັບ `nCounter`_."

