msgid ""
"Next, you will need to import the module in the QML file that will handle "
"the User Metrics:"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງ import ໂມດູນໃນໄຟລ໌ QML ທີ່ຈະຈັດການ User Metrics:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:41
msgid "(There may be updated versions of this above 0.1)"
msgstr "(ອາດຈະມີເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່ານີ້ ເໜືອກວ່າ 0.1)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:43
