msgstr "(ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ circleMetric ແມ່ນຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ format)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:70
msgid "Metric Id [dot] Variable Name [equals] New variable information"
msgstr "Metric Id [ຈຸດ] ຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນ [ເທົ່າກັບ] ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວປ່ຽນໃໝ່"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:72
msgid "``metric.circleMetric = \"New Metric Message\"``"
msgstr "``metric.circleMetric = \"ຂໍ້ຄວາມ Metric ໃໝ່\"``"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:74
msgid "We then tell the lock screen to update the metric."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາບອກໃຫ້ໜ້າຈໍລັອກອັບເດດ metric."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:76
msgid ""
"Metric ID [dot] update (specific amount to set if included in the format)"
msgstr "Metric ID [ຈຸດ] update (ຈຳນວນສະເພາະທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ ຖ້າລວມຢູ່ໃນ format)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:78
msgid "``metric.update(0)``"
msgstr "``metric.update(0)``"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:80
msgid ""
"(Note: In this example, ``0`` is arbitrary since the metric value doesn't "
"include a counter)"
msgstr "(ໝາຍເຫດ: ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ``0`` ແມ່ນໃສ່ໄວ້ຊື່ໆ ເນື່ອງຈາກຄ່າ metric ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເອົາ counter)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:82
msgid ""
"We have now updated the metric for today. When the time rolls over to "
"tomorrow, the metric will be reset to whatever is in ``emptyFormat``."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ອັບເດດ metric ສຳລັບມື້ນີ້ແລ້ວ. ເມື່ອເວລາປ່ຽນເປັນມື້ອື່ນ, metric ຈະຖືກ reset "
"ເປັນຫຍັງກໍຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ ``emptyFormat``."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:84
msgid "For most apps, this defaults to 0 counts for messages, calls, etc."
msgstr "ສຳລັບແອັບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້ແມ່ນ 0 ການນັບສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ການໂທ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:87
msgid "How do User Metrics work?"
msgstr "User Metrics ເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ?"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:89
msgid "User Metrics are made up of two \"formats\":"
msgstr "User Metrics ປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງ \"formats\":"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:91
msgid "metrics/messages for today (``format``)"
msgstr "metrics/ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ສຳລັບມື້ນີ້ (``format``)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:92
msgid "metrics/messages for tomorrow (``emptyFormat``)"
msgstr "metrics/ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ສຳລັບມື້ອື່ນ (``emptyFormat``)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:94
msgid ""
"The value of ``emptyFormat`` is what displays on the lock screen when no "
"value has been stored in ``format``. In order to display a new value of "
"``format`` the metric must be updated."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຂອງ ``emptyFormat`` ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍລັອກ ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີຄ່າໃດຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ ``format``. "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງຄ່າໃໝ່ຂອງ ``format`` metric ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:96
msgid "There are two options for updating the metric:"
msgstr "ມີສອງທາງເລືອກສຳລັບການອັບເດດ metric:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:98
msgid "Set the metric to a specific amount:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ metric ເປັນຈຳນວນສະເພາະ:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:100
msgid ""
"``metricID.update(x)`` (where x is a number of type `double` to set for a "
"counter value). ``metricID`` is the ``id:`` specified in the Metric item. "
"The counter value can be included in the ``format`` setting by using ``%1``. "
"e.g. ``format: \"%1 buttons pressed today\"``"
msgstr ""
"``metricID.update(x)`` (ເຊິ່ງ x ແມ່ນຕົວເລກປະເພດ `double` ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບຄ່າ counter). "
"``metricID`` ແມ່ນ ``id:`` ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ Metric item. ຄ່າ counter ສາມາດລວມຢູ່ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"``format`` ໂດຍການໃຊ້ ``%1``. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``format: \"%1 buttons pressed today\"``"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:102
msgid "Increment the metric:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ metric ຂຶ້ນ:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:104
msgid ""
"``metricID.increment(x)`` (where x is the amount to add to the current "
"counter)"
msgstr "``metricID.increment(x)`` (ເຊິ່ງ x ແມ່ນຈຳນວນທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມໃສ່ counter ປັດຈຸບັນ)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:106
msgid ""
"The metric will reset back to the value stored in ``emptyFormat`` each day."
msgstr "Metric ຈະ reset ກັບຄືນເປັນຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ ``emptyFormat`` ໃນແຕ່ລະມື້."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:108
msgid ""
"Applications make use of User Metrics by setting and updating the "
"\"formats\" whenever a certain event takes place. e.g. When you press send "
"in Telegram, or when you receive a phone call. The application may store the "
"data for manipulation, but generally the data is stored in the system (`/var/"
"lib/usermetrics <https://github.com/ubports/libusermetrics/tree/xenial/doc/"
"pages>`_)."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກ User Metrics ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ອັບເດດ \"formats\" "
"ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ມີເຫດການສະເພາະເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອທ່ານກົດສົ່ງໃນ Telegram, ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອທ່ານຮັບສາຍໂທລະສັບ. ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອາດຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ເພື່ອຈັດການ, "
"ແຕ່ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນລະບົບ (`/var/lib/usermetrics <https://github.com/"
"ubports/libusermetrics/tree/xenial/doc/pages>`_)."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:111
msgid ""
"(See this `blog post <https://daker.me/2013/11/adding-usermetrics-to-your-"
"app-on-ubuntu-touch.html>`_ for a simple example)"
msgstr ""
"(ເບິ່ງ `blog post <https://daker.me/2013/11/adding-usermetrics-to-your-app-on-"
"ubuntu-touch.html>`_ ນີ້ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງງ່າຍໆ)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:114
msgid "Limitations and wonders"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ ແລະ ສິ່ງທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈ"

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:115
msgid ""
"Once a metric is registered, it remains on the lock screen even after the "
"app has been uninstalled. A database file (db) is stored in `/var/lib/"
"usermetrics`, which can be deleted by root (but not with sudo). Deleting "
"this file and rebooting will remove all stored metrics. Presumably, the db "
"file could be edited instead of deleted."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ metric ຖືກລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍລັອກ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າແອັບຈະຖືກຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງໄປແລ້ວກໍຕາມ. ໄຟລ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (db) ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ `/var/lib/"
"usermetrics`, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດລຶບໄດ້ໂດຍ root (ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນດ້ວຍ sudo). ການລຶບໄຟລ໌ນີ້ ແລະ reboot "
"ຈະລຶບ metrics ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ທັງໝົດ. ສັນນິຖານວ່າ, ໄຟລ໌ db ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ແທນທີ່ຈະລຶບ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:117
msgid ""
"Based on how the \"formats\" are set up, it seems that it is difficult to "
"maintain a running tally beyond one day (though not impossible. See "
"`FluffyChat <https://gitlab.com/ChristianPauly/fluffychat>`_)."
msgstr ""
"ອີງຕາມວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"formats\", ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມັນຍາກທີ່ຈະຮັກສາການນັບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເກີນໜຶ່ງມື້ "
"(ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນວ່າເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ `FluffyChat <https://gitlab.com/"
"ChristianPauly/fluffychat>`_)."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:119
msgid ""
"In the case of the `nCounter`_ app. I wanted to count the number of days, "
"but since the metric \"resets\" each day, that presents a problem. I created "
"a workaround that updates the metric every time the application is opened. "
"Thus, the ``emptyFormat`` (default) tells the user to open the application. "
"This, however, nearly defeats the purpose of the metric entirely, other than "
"having a neat stat reminder for the day."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງແອັບ `nCounter`_. ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງການນັບຈຳນວນມື້, ແຕ່ເນື່ອງຈາກ metric \"resets\" "
"ໃນແຕ່ລະມື້, ນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເປັນບັນຫາ. ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ສ້າງວິທີແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສະເພາະໜ້າ ທີ່ອັບເດດ metric "
"ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຖືກເປີດ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ``emptyFormat`` (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ຈຶ່ງບອກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປີດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. "
"ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ສິ່ງນີ້ເກືອບຈະທຳລາຍຈຸດປະສົງຂອງ metric ໄປເລີຍ, "
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກການມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສະຖິຕິທີ່ສວຍງາມສຳລັບມື້ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/user-metrics.rst:121
msgid ""
"There must be a way for a process to run independently in the background "
"(e.g. cron) to retrieve data from a specific app code. One lead is the "
"Indicator Weather app. This runs a process every X minutes to update the "
"weather indicator automatically without having to open the app."
msgstr ""
"ມັນຕ້ອງມີວິທີໃຫ້ຂະບວນການ (process) ເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງເປັນເອກະລາດໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: cron) "
"ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ code ຂອງແອັບສະເພາະ. ເບາະແສໜຶ່ງແມ່ນແອັບ Indicator Weather. ອັນນີ້ run "
"process ທຸກໆ X ນາທີ ເພື່ອອັບເດດຕົວຊີ້ບອກສະພາບອາກາດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດແອັບ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:2
msgid "Writable directories"
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຂຽນໄດ້"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:4
msgid ""
"App confinement is part of the Ubuntu Touch security concept. Data can be "
"exchanged between apps only according to the AppArmor policies, mainly using "
"the :ref:`ContentHub <contenthub>`. This being said, apps can only read and "
"write files that are located in one of three app specific directories "
"explained in this guide."
msgstr ""
"ການຈຳກັດຂອບເຂດຂອງແອັບ (App confinement) ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແນວຄວາມຄິດຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ "
"Ubuntu Touch. ຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດແລກປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງແອັບໄດ້ຕາມນະໂຍບາຍ AppArmor ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ :ref:`ContentHub <contenthub>`. ທີ່ກ່າວມານີ້, ແອັບສາມາດອ່ານ ແລະ "
"ຂຽນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໜຶ່ງໃນສາມໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສະເພາະຂອງແອັບ ທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນຄູ່ມືນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:7
msgid "Standard Paths"
msgstr "Path ມາດຕະຖານ"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:8
msgid ""
"Besides the write access to the app directories explained below, the app can "
"write debug messages into the app log file located at ``/home/phablet/.cache/"
"upstart/application-click-<fullappname>_<appname>_<version>.log``. To append "
"messages to the log file, use the `Qt debug <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/"
"qdebug.html>`_ functions."
msgstr ""
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກການເຂົ້າເຖິງການຂຽນໃສ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີແອັບທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້, ແອັບສາມາດຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມ debug "
"ໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ log ຂອງແອັບທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ ``/home/phablet/.cache/upstart/application-click-"
"<fullappname>_<appname>_<version>.log``. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ log, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ `Qt "
"debug <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qdebug.html>`_."

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:11
msgid "Config"
msgstr "Config"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:12
msgid "Path: ``/home/phablet/.config/<fullappname>/``"
msgstr "Path: ``/home/phablet/.config/<fullappname>/``"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:14
msgid ""
"This is the place to store configurations files to. The music app for "
"example stores its configuration to ``/home/phablet/.config/com.ubuntu.music/"
"com.ubuntu.music.conf``."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (configurations). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແອັບເພງເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງມັນໄວ້ທີ່ ``/"
"home/phablet/.config/com.ubuntu.music/com.ubuntu.music.conf``."

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:17
msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Cache"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:18
msgid "Path: ``/home/phablet/.cache/<fullappname>/``"
msgstr "Path: ``/home/phablet/.cache/<fullappname>/``"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:20
msgid ""
"This is the place to cache data for later use. The cache is also used by the "
"Content Hub. Files that have been shared with the music app for example can "
"be found in ``/home/phablet/.cache/com.ubuntu.music/HubIncoming/``."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນ cache ຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ໃຊ້ພາຍຫຼັງ. Cache ຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ Content Hub. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກແບ່ງປັນກັບແອັບເພງ ສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ ``/home/phablet/.cache/com.ubuntu.music/"
"HubIncoming/``."

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:23
msgid ""
"Data in the cache directory should be treated as temporary and the app "
"should still function normally if this directory is cleared - clearing cache "
"is commonly done to recover some space on the device. Don't store user "
"account info here :)"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນໃນ cache directory ຄວນຖືວ່າເປັນຂໍ້ມູນຊົ່ວຄາວ ແລະ ແອັບຄວນຍັງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ປົກກະຕິຖ້າ "
"directory ນີ້ຖືກລຶບ - ການລຶບ cache ມັກຈະເຮັດເພື່ອຄືນພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນອຸປະກອນ. "
"ຢ່າເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄວ້ບ່ອນນີ້ :)"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:26
msgid "App data"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນແອັບ"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:27
msgid "Path: ``/home/phablet/.local/share/<fullappname>/``"
msgstr "Path: ``/home/phablet/.local/share/<fullappname>/``"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:29
msgid ""
"This is where your app stores any data. The music app for example stores its "
"data bases to ``/home/phablet/.local/share/com.ubuntu.music/Databases/``."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແອັບເພງເກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງມັນໄວ້ທີ່ ``/home/"
"phablet/.local/share/com.ubuntu.music/Databases/``."

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:33
msgid "Using Standard Paths in C++"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Path ມາດຕະຖານໃນ C++"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:34
msgid ""
"The Qt header ``QStandardPaths`` provides the app's writable locations in C+"
"+:"
msgstr "Qt header ``QStandardPaths`` ໃຫ້ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ແອັບສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້ໃນ C++:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:45
msgid ""
"Since the value of the QStandardPaths strings are decided by the `Qt "
"application name <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/"
"qcoreapplication.html#applicationName-prop>`_, this needs to be the same as "
"the clickable application name."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຄ່າຂອງ QStandardPaths strings ຖືກຕັດສິນໂດຍ `ຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Qt <https://"
"doc.qt.io/qt-5/qcoreapplication.html#applicationName-prop>`_, "
"ອັນນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຄືກັນກັບຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ clickable."

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:48
msgid ""
"Setting the `organizationName <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/"
"qcoreapplication.html#organizationName-prop>`_ will change the paths "
"returned by these functions too - if you need to do this, set it to the "
"clickable application name as well, otherwise the paths won't work on the "
"device."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `organizationName <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/"
"qcoreapplication.html#organizationName-prop>`_ ຈະປ່ຽນ path "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໂດຍຟັງຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ - ຖ້າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງມັນເປັນຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ clickable "
"ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ path ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນອຸປະກອນ."

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:51
msgid "Using Standard Paths in QML"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Path ມາດຕະຖານໃນ QML"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:52
msgid ""
"The Qt module `Qt.labs.platform <https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.10/qml-qt-"
"labs-platform-standardpaths.html>`_ provides the app's writable locations in "
"QML:"
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນ Qt `Qt.labs.platform <https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.10/qml-qt-labs-"
"platform-standardpaths.html>`_ ໃຫ້ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ແອັບສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້ໃນ QML:"

#: ../../appdev/guides/writeable-dirs.rst:72
msgid ""
"Notice that ``QStandardPaths`` returns paths (``'/phablet/home/...'``), and "
"QML ``StandardPaths`` returns urls (``'file:///phablet/home/...'``). This "
"must be considered specially if the app is sharing location strings between "
"QML and C++."
msgstr ""
"ສັງເກດວ່າ ``QStandardPaths`` ສົ່ງຄືນ path (``'/phablet/home/...'``), ແລະ QML "
"``StandardPaths`` ສົ່ງຄືນ urls (``'file:///phablet/home/...'``). "
"ອັນນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການພິຈາລະນາເປັນພິເສດ ຖ້າແອັບກຳລັງແບ່ງປັນ location strings ລະຫວ່າງ QML ແລະ C+"
"+."

