#: ../../appdev/index.rst:25 ../../porting/configure_test_fix/Overlay.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມ"

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Touch supports two kinds of apps: Firstly, *native apps* have their "
"user interface written in QML or HTML and their business logic in "
"JavaScript, C++, Python, Rust, or Go. Secondly, *web apps* are special "
"containers to run websites in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Touch ຮອງຮັບແອັບສອງປະເພດ: ທີໜຶ່ງ, *native apps* ມີ user interface ຂຽນດ້ວຍ "
"QML ຫຼື HTML ແລະ business logic ໃນ JavaScript, C++, Python, Rust, ຫຼື Go. ທີສອງ, "
"*web apps* ແມ່ນ container ພິເສດເພື່ອ run ເວັບໄຊທ໌."

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:36
msgid "The following sections provide guides and API documentation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃຫ້ຄູ່ມື ແລະ ເອກະສານ API."

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"`Clickable <https://clickable-ut.dev>`_ is the main tool to build apps on "
"Ubuntu Touch. It is an easy to use command line tool with a lot of great "
"features. Clickable allows you to compile, build, test, and publish your "
"app. It also provides various templates to get you started with app "
"development."
msgstr ""
"`Clickable <https://clickable-ut.dev>`_ ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືຫຼັກໃນການສ້າງແອັບໃນ Ubuntu "
"Touch. ມັນເປັນເຄື່ອງມື command line ທີ່ໃຊ້ງ່າຍ ພ້ອມດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ດີຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. Clickable "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານ compile, build, test, ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ມັນຍັງສະໜອງແມ່ແບບຕ່າງໆເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກັບການພັດທະນາແອັບ."

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"You can use any code editor or IDE to work on the code. Then you build your "
"app from the command line with Clickable."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ code editor ຫຼື IDE ໃດກໍໄດ້ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບ code. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານ build "
"ແອັບຂອງທ່ານຈາກ command line ດ້ວຍ Clickable."

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:44
msgid ""
"Applications are shipped as a :ref:`click <click>` package and can be "
"published on the official app store `OpenStore <https://open-store.io>`__. "
"Note also that most apps in the OpenStore are open source and can serve as "
"references and inspiration."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຖືກຈັດສົ່ງເປັນແພັກເກັດ :ref:`click <click>` ແລະ "
"ສາມາດເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນຮ້ານແອັບຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ `OpenStore <https://open-store.io>`__. "
"ໝາຍເຫດອີກວ່າແອັບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນ OpenStore ແມ່ນ open source ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນເອກະສານອ້າງອີງ "
"ແລະ ແຮງບັນດານໃຈໄດ້."

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:47
msgid "References and guides"
msgstr "ເອກະສານອ້າງອີງ ແລະ ຄູ່ມື"

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:57
msgid ""
"This is a helpful and welcoming community and everything works better in "
"teamwork! Looking for other developers that might want to collaborate with "
"you on your app? Have questions that aren’t answered in the docs or want to "
"chat with other Ubuntu Touch developers? Join our `UBports UT App Dev "
"Telegram group <https://t.me/UbuntuAppDevEN>`_ or chat with us on the "
"`UBports App Development forum <https://forums.ubports.com/category/35/app-"
"development>`_! You can also check out our list of :ref:`preinstalled apps "
"<preinstalledapps>`. Contributions to those are greatly appreciated and "
"directly reach a larger audience."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຊຸມຊົນທີ່ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ ແລະ ຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບ ແລະ ທຸກຢ່າງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກວ່າໃນການເຮັດວຽກເປັນທີມ! "
"ກຳລັງຊອກຫານັກພັດທະນາຄົນອື່ນທີ່ອາດຈະຢາກຮ່ວມມືກັບທ່ານໃນແອັບຂອງທ່ານບໍ? "
"ມີຄຳຖາມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄຳຕອບໃນເອກະສານ ຫຼື ຢາກລົມກັບນັກພັດທະນາ Ubuntu Touch ຄົນອື່ນບໍ? ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ `ກຸ່ມ "
"UBports UT App Dev Telegram <https://t.me/UbuntuAppDevEN>`_ ຂອງພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື "
"ລົມກັບພວກເຮົາໃນ `UBports App Development forum <https://forums.ubports.com/"
"category/35/app-development>`_! ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຂອງ :ref:`preinstalled "
"apps <preinstalledapps>` (ແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມາພ້ອມເຄື່ອງ). "
"ການປະກອບສ່ວນຕໍ່ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກຍ້ອງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜູ້ຊົມທີ່ກວ້າງຂວາງກວ່າໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:64
msgid "Maintainers wanted"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຜູ້ບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (Maintainers)"

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:66
msgid ""
"All apps love contributions. But some core apps are lacking maintainers. "
"Please check the `list of core apps <https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/"
"ubuntu-touch/-/blob/master/CORE_APPS.md>`_ and see if you want to step up as "
"new maintainer for one of our core apps. The maintainer reviews MR's, "
"triages and investigates issue reports and helps to develop the app."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກແອັບມັກການປະກອບສ່ວນ. ແຕ່ບາງ core apps ຂາດຜູ້ບຳລຸງຮັກສາ. ກະລຸນາກວດເບິ່ງ `ລາຍຊື່ຂອງ core "
"apps <https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/ubuntu-touch/-/blob/master/"
"CORE_APPS.md>`_ ແລະ ເບິ່ງວ່າທ່ານຢາກກ້າວຂຶ້ນມາເປັນຜູ້ບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃໝ່ສຳລັບໜຶ່ງໃນ core apps "
"ຂອງພວກເຮົາຫຼືບໍ່. ຜູ້ບຳລຸງຮັກສາຈະກວດສອບ MR, ຈັດລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ ແລະ ສືບສວນລາຍງານບັນຫາ ແລະ "
"ຊ່ວຍພັດທະນາແອັບ."

#: ../../appdev/index.rst:68
msgid ""
"The best way to start is by making some contributions and let the reviewers "
"know that you are interested. Or join our matrix group at `#ubcd:matrix.org "
"<https://matrix.to/#/#ubcd:matrix.org>`_ and introduce yourself."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການປະກອບສ່ວນບາງຢ່າງ ແລະ ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ຜູ້ກວດສອບຮູ້ວ່າທ່ານສົນໃຈ. ຫຼື ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມກຸ່ມ "
"matrix ຂອງພວກເຮົາທີ່ `#ubcd:matrix.org <https://matrix.to/#/#ubcd:matrix.org>`_ "
"ແລະ ແນະນຳຕົວເອງ."

#: ../../appdev/nativeapp/index.rst:4
msgid "Native apps"
msgstr "Native apps"

#: ../../appdev/nativeapp/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"The recommended way to build a native application on Ubuntu Touch is to use "
"the `Qt <https://doc.qt.io/>`__ framework (current version since Xenial "
"OTA-16 is Qt 5.12.9). You do not have to stick with the traditional C++<-"
">QML Qt model, you can use also Python, Go, Rust or even Javascript for your "
"backend."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການສ້າງ native application ໃນ Ubuntu Touch ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ `Qt <https://"
"doc.qt.io/>`__ framework (ເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຕັ້ງແຕ່ Xenial OTA-16 ແມ່ນ Qt 5.12.9). "
"ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຍຶດຕິດກັບຮູບແບບ C++<->QML Qt ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Python, Go, Rust ຫຼື "
"ແມ່ນແຕ່ Javascript ສຳລັບ backend ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#: ../../appdev/nativeapp/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Touch provides a subset of Qt QML components to ease the development "
"of your app : `QML API <https://api-docs.ubports.com/sdk/apps/qml/"
"index.html>`__ and Icons: `Suru Icons <http://docs.ubports.com/projects/"
"icons/en/latest/>`__, but you can also ship your cross platform app using "
"standard Qt QML QtQuick2 components."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Touch ສະໜອງຊຸດຍ່ອຍຂອງອົງປະກອບ Qt QML "
"ເພື່ອອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກໃນການພັດທະນາແອັບຂອງທ່ານ : `QML API <https://api-"
"docs.ubports.com/sdk/apps/qml/index.html>`__ ແລະ ໄອຄອນ: `Suru Icons <http://"
"docs.ubports.com/projects/icons/en/latest/>`__, "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສົ່ງແອັບຂ້າມແພລັດຟອມຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ອົງປະກອບມາດຕະຖານ Qt QML QtQuick2 ໄດ້."

#: ../../appdev/nativeapp/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"You can use `Clickable <http://clickable.bhdouglass.com/en/latest/>`_ to "
"facilitate Packaging, deploying, publishing and tests ."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ `Clickable <http://clickable.bhdouglass.com/en/latest/>`_ "
"ເພື່ອອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກໃນການເຮັດ Packaging, deploying, publishing ແລະ tests."

#: ../../appdev/nativeapp/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"Check out informations about the platform and confinement model "
"in :ref:`Platform <platform>` section"
msgstr ""
"ກວດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບແພລັດຟອມ ແລະ ຮູບແບບ confinement ໃນພາກ :ref:`Platform <platform>`"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:2
msgid "AppArmor Policy Groups"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍ AppArmor"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:4
msgid ""
"This document contains a full list of Ubuntu Touch's available policy groups "
"and a description of what they give your app permission to access."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານນີ້ມີລາຍຊື່ເຕັມຂອງກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍທີ່ມີໃຫ້ຂອງ Ubuntu Touch ແລະ "
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບສິ່ງທີ່ພວກມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:6
msgid "Each entry follows this format"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະລາຍການປະຕິບັດຕາມຮູບແບບນີ້"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:21
msgid ""
"Policy usage affects whether your app will be accepted by the OpenStore. "
"Apps containing policies with common usage are generally accepted "
"immediately, while reserved usage policies will need to be manually reviewed."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ນະໂຍບາຍມີຜົນຕໍ່ການທີ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບໂດຍ OpenStore ຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ແອັບທີ່ມີນະໂຍບາຍທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ (common usage) ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບທັນທີ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ນະໂຍບາຍການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ສະຫງວນໄວ້ (reserved usage) ຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການກວດສອບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:23
msgid ""
"Coding tip: Everytime you change your apparmor policy file you need to "
"update your app's version for this to be taken into account."
msgstr ""
"Coding tip: ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານປ່ຽນໄຟລ໌ນະໂຍບາຍ apparmor ຂອງທ່ານ ທ່ານຕ້ອງອັບເດດ version "
"ຂອງແອັບທ່ານ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:26
msgid "accounts"
msgstr "ບັນຊີ (accounts)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:28
msgid "Description: Can use Online Accounts."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດໃຊ້ Online Accounts."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:30 ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:40
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:72 ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:82
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:102
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:112
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:157
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:165
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:175
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:203
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:213
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:243
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:251
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:261
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:271
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:299
msgid "Usage: common"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານ: ທົ່ວໄປ (common)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:32
msgid ""
"The accounts policy gives your app the permissions it needs to access the "
"`Online Accounts API`_."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍ accounts ໃຫ້ການອະນຸຍາດແກ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ `Online Accounts "
"API`_."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:36
msgid "audio"
msgstr "ສຽງ (audio)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:38
msgid ""
"Description: Can play audio (allows playing remote content via media-hub)"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດຫຼິ້ນສຽງ (ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຫຼິ້ນເນື້ອຫາທາງໄກຜ່ານ media-hub)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:42
msgid ""
"The audio policy is needed for your app to play audio via pulseaudio or "
"media-hub. The permission also gives it the ability to send album art to the "
"thumbnailer service, which is then shown on the sound indicator."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍ audio ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບແອັບຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນສຽງຜ່ານ pulseaudio ຫຼື media-hub. "
"ການອະນຸຍາດຍັງໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການສົ່ງຮູບໜ້າປົກອາລະບໍາໄປຍັງບໍລິການ thumbnailer, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈາກນັ້ນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນ sound indicator."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:46
msgid "bluetooth"
msgstr "ບລູທູດ (bluetooth)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:48
msgid "Description: Use bluetooth (bluez5) as an administrator."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ໃຊ້ bluetooth (bluez5) ໃນຖານະຜູ້ບໍລິຫານລະບົບ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:50 ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:60
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:92 ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:122
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:130
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:139
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:149
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:183
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:193
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:223
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:233
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:279
#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:289
msgid "Usage: reserved"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານ: ສະຫງວນໄວ້ (reserved)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:52
msgid ""
"This policy grants unrestricted access to Bluetooth devices. It is provided "
"for administration of bluetooth and as a stepping stone towards developing a "
"safe bluetooth API all apps can access."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ໃຫ້ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງອຸປະກອນ Bluetooth ແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ. ມັນຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ສຳລັບການບໍລິຫານຈັດການ "
"bluetooth ແລະ ເປັນບາດກ້າວໄປສູ່ການພັດທະນາ safe bluetooth API ທີ່ທຸກແອັບສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:56
msgid "calendar"
msgstr "ປະຕິທິນ (calendar)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:58
msgid "Description: Can access the calendar."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງປະຕິທິນ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:62
msgid ""
"Calendar grants access to the Evolution dataserver's calendar and alarms "
"APIs. It also grants access to sync-monitor."
msgstr ""
"Calendar ໃຫ້ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ API ປະຕິທິນ ແລະ ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂອງ Evolution dataserver. "
"ມັນຍັງໃຫ້ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ sync-monitor ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:64
msgid ""
"This policy is reserved since it grants free access to all calendars on the "
"device at any time. The legacy bug about this situation is `LP #1227824`_ ."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ຖືກສະຫງວນໄວ້ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນໃຫ້ສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງປະຕິທິນທັງໝົດໃນອຸປະກອນໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ. "
"ບັກເກົ່າກ່ຽວກັບສະຖານະການນີ້ແມ່ນ `LP #1227824`_ ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:68
msgid "camera"
msgstr "ກ້ອງ (camera)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:70
msgid "Description: Can access the camera(s)"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:74
msgid "The camera policy grants access to device cameras."
msgstr "ນະໂຍບາຍ camera ໃຫ້ສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຂອງອຸປະກອນ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:78
msgid "connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (connectivity)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:80
msgid "Description: Can access coarse network connectivity information"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍແບບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:84
msgid ""
"The connectivity policy allows apps to determine rough information about the "
"device's connectivity. This includes whether the device is connected to the "
"Internet and whether it is connected via a Wi-Fi or mobile data connection."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍ connectivity ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນກ່ຽວກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງອຸປະກອນ. "
"ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງການກວດສອບວ່າອຸປະກອນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ Wi-Fi ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນມືຖື."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:88
msgid "contacts"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ (contacts)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:90
msgid "Description: Can access contacts."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:94
msgid ""
"The contacts policy allows apps to access the device user's contacts list. "
"It is marked as reserved because it allows access to sync-monitor and "
"unfettered access to the address book."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍ contacts ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. "
"ມັນຖືກໝາຍວ່າສະຫງວນໄວ້ເພາະມັນໃຫ້ສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ sync-monitor ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງປຶ້ມທີ່ຢູ່ໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:98
msgid "content_exchange"
msgstr "ການແລກປ່ຽນເນື້ອຫາ (content_exchange)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:100
msgid "Description: Can request/import data from other applications"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດຮ້ອງຂໍ ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:104
msgid ""
"Using the content_exchange policy allows your app to be a consumer of "
"content on content-hub."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ນະໂຍບາຍ content_exchange ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບຂອງທ່ານເປັນຜູ້ຮັບເນື້ອຫາໃນ content-hub."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:108
msgid "content_exchange_source"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງແລກປ່ຽນເນື້ອຫາ (content_exchange_source)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:110
msgid "Description: Can provide/export data to other applications"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດສະໜອງ ຫຼື ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:114
msgid ""
"The content_exchange_source policy allows your app to provide content on "
"content-hub."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍ content_exchange_source ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບຂອງທ່ານສະໜອງເນື້ອຫາໃນ content-hub."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:118
msgid "debug"
msgstr "ດີບັກ (debug)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:120
msgid ""
"Description: Use special debugging tools. This should only be used in "
"development and not for production packages. Note: use of this policy group "
"provides significantly different confinement than normal and is not "
"considered secure. You should never run untrusted programs using this policy "
"group."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືດີບັກພິເສດ. ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການພັດທະນາເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບແພັກເກັດທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ການໃຊ້ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ການຈຳກັດສິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກປົກກະຕິ "
"ແລະ ຖືວ່າບໍ່ປອດໄພ. ທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນເປີດໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືໂດຍໃຊ້ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍນີ້."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:126
msgid "document_files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເອກະສານ (document_files)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:128
msgid ""
"Description: Can read and write to document files. This policy group is "
"reserved for certain applications, such as document viewers. Developers "
"should typically use the content_exchange policy group and API to access "
"document files instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນໄຟລ໌ເອກະສານ. ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ສະຫງວນໄວ້ສຳລັບບາງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: ແອັບເບິ່ງເອກະສານ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ ນັກພັດທະນາຄວນໃຊ້ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍ content_exchange ແລະ API "
"ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ເອກະສານແທນ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:132
msgid ""
"This policy allows apps to read and write to the \"Documents\" folders in "
"the user's home directory and external media."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນລົງໃນໂຟນເດີ \"Documents\" ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ "
"ສື່ພາຍນອກ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:135
msgid "document_files_read"
msgstr "ອ່ານໄຟລ໌ເອກະສານ (document_files_read)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:137
msgid ""
"Description: Can read all document files. This policy group is reserved for "
"certain applications, such as document viewers. Developers should typically "
"use the content_exchange policy group and API to access document files "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດອ່ານໄຟລ໌ເອກະສານທັງໝົດ. ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ສະຫງວນໄວ້ສຳລັບບາງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ແອັບເບິ່ງເອກະສານ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ ນັກພັດທະນາຄວນໃຊ້ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍ content_exchange ແລະ API "
"ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ເອກະສານແທນ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:141
msgid ""
"This policy allows apps to read the \"Documents\" folders in the user's home "
"directory and external media."
msgstr ""
"ນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບອ່ານໂຟນເດີ \"Documents\" ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ສື່ພາຍນອກ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:145
msgid "history"
msgstr "ປະຫວັດ (history)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:147
msgid ""
"Description: Can access the history-service. This policy group is reserved "
"for vetted applications only in this version of the policy. A future version "
"of the policy may move this out of reserved status."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງບໍລິການປະຫວັດ (history-service). "
"ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ສະຫງວນໄວ້ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຜ່ານການກວດສອບແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນໃນເວີຊັນນີ້. "
"ເວີຊັນໃນອະນາຄົດອາດຈະຍ້າຍສິ່ງນີ້ອອກຈາກສະຖານະສະຫງວນ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:153
msgid "keep-display-on"
msgstr "ເປີດໜ້າຈໍຄ້າງໄວ້ (keep-display-on)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:155
msgid "Description: Can request keeping the screen on"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າຈໍຄ້າງໄວ້"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:161
msgid "location"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງ (location)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:163
msgid "Description: Can access Location"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງ"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:167
msgid "Allows an app to request access to the device's current location."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງປະຈຸບັນຂອງອຸປະກອນ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:171
msgid "microphone"
msgstr "ໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ (microphone)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:173
msgid "Description: Can access the microphone"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:179
msgid "music_files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເພງ (music_files)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:181
msgid ""
"Description: Can read and write to music files. This policy group is "
"reserved for certain applications, such as music players. Developers should "
"typically use the content_exchange policy group and API to access music "
"files instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນໄຟລ໌ເພງ. ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ສະຫງວນໄວ້ສຳລັບບາງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ແອັບຫຼິ້ນເພງ. ນັກພັດທະນາຄວນໃຊ້ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍ content_exchange ແລະ API ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ເພງແທນ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:185
msgid ""
"The music_files policy group allows an app to read or write to the Music "
"directories in the user's home folder or on external media."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍ music_files ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນລົງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເພງ (Music) "
"ໃນໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ສື່ພາຍນອກ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:189
msgid "music_files_read"
msgstr "ອ່ານໄຟລ໌ເພງ (music_files_read)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:191
msgid ""
"Description: Can read all music files. This policy group is reserved for "
"certain applications, such as music players. Developers should typically use "
"the content_exchange policy group and API to access music files instead."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດອ່ານໄຟລ໌ເພງທັງໝົດ. ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍນີ້ສະຫງວນໄວ້ສຳລັບບາງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ແອັບຫຼິ້ນເພງ. ນັກພັດທະນາຄວນໃຊ້ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍ content_exchange ແລະ API ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ເພງແທນ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:195
msgid ""
"The music_files_read policy group allows an app to read the Music "
"directories in the user's home folder or on external media."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍ music_files_read ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບອ່ານໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເພງ (Music) ໃນໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"ຫຼື ສື່ພາຍນອກ."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:199
msgid "networking"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ (networking)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:201
msgid "Description: Can access the network"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:205
msgid ""
"The networking policy group allows an app to contact network devices and use "
"the `download manager`_."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍ networking ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບຕິດຕໍ່ກັບອຸປະກອນເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ `download manager`_."

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:209
msgid "nfc"
msgstr "ເອັນເອັບຊີ (nfc)"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:211
msgid "Description: Can access the NFC functionality"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ: ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຟັງຊັນ NFC"

#: ../../appdev/platform/apparmor.rst:215
msgid ""
"The nfc policy group allows an app to read and write NFC tags via NDEF data "
"as well as establishing a peer-to-peer connection between two devices."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມນະໂຍບາຍ nfc ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນແທັກ NFC ຜ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ NDEF ແລະ ສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ "
"peer-to-peer ລະຫວ່າງອຸປະກອນ."

