"This simple form works, but almost every webapp uses other features as well, "
"such as URL containment with URL patterns as described below."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບງ່າຍໆນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້, ແຕ່ເກືອບທຸກ webapp ຈະໃຊ້ຟີເຈີອື່ນໆນຳ ເຊັ່ນການຈຳກັດ URL ດ້ວຍຮູບແບບ "
"URL ຕາມທີ່ຈະອະທິບາຍລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:28
msgid "User interface"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (User interface)"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:30
msgid ""
"A webapp generally fills the entire app screen space, without the need of "
"the UI controls generally found on standard browsers."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ Webapp ຈະສະແດງເຕັມໜ້າຈໍແອັບ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຄວບຄຸມ UI "
"ຄືກັບໃນບຣາວເຊີມາດຕະຖານ."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:32
msgid ""
"In some cases some navigation controls are appropriate, such as Back and "
"Forward buttons, or an address bar. These are enabled with command line "
"arguments:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ການມີຕົວຄວບຄຸມການນຳທາງກໍ່ມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນ ເຊັ່ນ ປຸ່ມກັບຄືນ ແລະ ໄປໜ້າ ຫຼື ແຖບທີ່ຢູ່. "
"ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ command line arguments:"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:34
msgid ""
"``--enable-back-forward`` Enable the display of the back and forward buttons "
"in the toolbar (at the bottom of the webapp window)"
msgstr ""
"``--enable-back-forward`` ເປີດການສະແດງປຸ່ມກັບຄືນ ແລະ ໄປໜ້າໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື "
"(ຢູ່ລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ webapp)"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:35
msgid ""
"``--enable-addressbar`` Enable the display of the address bar (at the bottom "
"of the webapp window)"
msgstr "``--enable-addressbar`` ເປີດການສະແດງແຖບທີ່ຢູ່ (ຢູ່ລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ webapp)"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:38
msgid "URL patterns"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ URL"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:40
msgid ""
"Webapp authors often want to contain browsing to the target website. That "
"is, the developer wants to control the URLs that can be opened in the webapp "
"(all other URLs are opened in the browser). This is done with URL patterns "
"as part of the webapp command line."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ສ້າງ Webapp ມັກຈະຕ້ອງການຈຳກັດການທ່ອງເວັບໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນເວັບໄຊທ໌ເປົ້າໝາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ໝາຍຄວາມວ່ານັກພັດທະນາຕ້ອງການຄວບຄຸມ URL ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ເປີດໃນ webapp (URL "
"ອື່ນໆຈະຖືກເປີດໃນບຣາວເຊີແທນ). ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ URL."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:42
msgid ""
"However, many web apps use pages that are hosted over multiple sites or that "
"use external resources and pages."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, web app ຫຼາຍອັນອາດມີໜ້າເວັບທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼາຍໄຊທ໌ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຈາກພາຍນອກ."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:44
msgid ""
"Both containment and access to specified external URLs are implemented with "
"URL patterns provided as arguments at launch time. Let’s take a closer look."
msgstr ""
"ທັງການຈຳກັດ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ພາຍນອກທີ່ລະບຸ ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານຮູບແບບ URL "
"ທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ໃນເວລາເປີດແອັບ."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:47
msgid "Uncontained by default"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:49
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default, there is no URL containment. Suppose you launch a webapp without "
"any patters and only a starting URL like this:::"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດ URL. ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານເປີດ webapp ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດຮູບແບບ ດັ່ງນີ້:::"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:53
msgid ""
"The user can navigate to any URL without limitation. For example, if they "
"click the Developer button at the top, they navigate to "
"developer.ubuntu.com, and it displays in the webapp."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດທ່ອງໄປຫາ URL ໃດກໍ່ໄດ້ຢ່າງບໍ່ຈຳກັດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າພວກເຂົາຄລິກປຸ່ມ Developer ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ, "
"ພວກເຂົາຈະໄປທີ່ developer.ubuntu.com ແລະ ມັນຈະສະແດງຜົນພາຍໃນ webapp ເລີຍ."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:55
msgid ""
"Tip: You can see the URL of the current page by enabling the address bar "
"with ``--enable-addressbar``."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳແນະນຳ: ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງ URL ຂອງໜ້າປະຈຸບັນໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດໃຊ້ແຖບທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ວຍ ``--enable-"
"addressbar``."

