#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:164
msgid "Browser data containment"
msgstr "ການແຍກຂໍ້ມູນບຣາວເຊີ"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:166
msgid ""
"The webapp experience is contained and isolated from the browser data point "
"of view. That is webapps do not access data from any other installed "
"browser, such as history, cookies and so on. Other browsers on the system do "
"not access the webapp’s data."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ webapp ຈະຖືກແຍກອອກຈາກບຣາວເຊີອື່ນ. webapp ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງປະຫວັດ ຫຼື "
"ຄຸກກີ້ຂອງບຣາວເຊີອື່ນ ແລະ ບຣາວເຊີອື່ນກໍ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ webapp ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:169
#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:17
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "ການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/guide.rst:171
msgid ""
"Following storage options are supported: Local/Session Storage, IndexedDB "
"and the deprecated WebSQL. FileSystem API is not supported because apps "
"cannot access the filesystem directly."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບ: Local/Session Storage, IndexedDB ແລະ WebSQL (ທີ່ເລີກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ). "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ FileSystem API ເພາະແອັບບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/index.rst:4
msgid "Web apps"
msgstr "ເວັບແອັບ (Web apps)"

#: ../../appdev/webapp/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Webapps can be a nice way to deliver online web applications into "
"Ubuntu."
msgstr "Ubuntu Webapps ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ດີໃນການນຳເວັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອອນລາຍມາສູ່ Ubuntu."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"The Ubuntu platform provides an advanced web engine container to run online "
"applications on the Ubuntu client devices."
msgstr ""
"ແພລັດຟອມ Ubuntu ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ web engine container "
"ທີ່ທັນສະໄໝເພື່ອລັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອອນລາຍໃນອຸປະກອນ Ubuntu."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"Web applications are hosted online. They can be as simple as a website, like "
"an online news site, or they can distribute content like videos. They can "
"also have a rich user interface or use the WebGL extension to deliver games "
"online."
msgstr ""
"ເວັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຖືກໂຮດໄວ້ໃນອອນລາຍ. ມັນອາດຈະເປັນເວັບໄຊທ໌ຂ່າວທຳມະດາ ຫຼື ແອັບຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອ, ແລະ "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ WebGL ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນເກມອອນລາຍໄດ້."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"Ubuntu webapps and Ubuntu HTML5 apps are similar but not identical. The main "
"difference is that the content of a webapp is provided through a URL, "
"whereas HTML5 apps install their content (and usually provide an Ubuntu "
"HTML5 GUI). Webapps also have restricted access to platform APIs."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu webapps ແລະ HTML5 apps ມີຄວາມຄ້າຍຄືກັນແຕ່ບໍ່ຄືກັນ. ຂໍ້ແຕກຕ່າງຫຼັກຄື webapp "
"ດຶງເນື້ອຫາຜ່ານ URL, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ HTML5 app ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງເນື້ອຫາໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງເລີຍ."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/index.rst:17
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A different approach to webapps published in the open store is to simply "
"create shortcuts directly yourself with `webber app <https://open-store.io/"
"app/webber.timsueberkrueb>`__."
msgstr "ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການສ້າງ webapps ຄືການສ້າງທາງລັດໂດຍກົງດ້ວຍ `webber app`__."

#: ../../appdev/webapp/index.rst:21
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There is also another way to create somewhat more featureful webapps, "
"sometimes referred to as webapp+ or alternative container. This needst to be "
"properly documented. It's a simple qml app that can be easily configured. "
"Creation is almost as simple as 'classic' webapp, but result is more "
"powerfull with the a nice navigation feature. A rather advanced example of "
"this is the `YouTube app <https://open-store.io/app/youtube-web.mateo-"
"salta>`__ from Mateo Salta which has quite some modifications on top of the "
"template."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີອີກວິທີໃນການສ້າງ webapps ທີ່ມີຟີເຈີຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ເຊິ່ງເອີ້ນວ່າ webapp+ ຫຼື container ທາງເລືອກ. "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນແອັບ qml ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງງ່າຍ ແລະ ມີພະລັງກວ່າ webapp ແບບເກົ່າ."

