#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:129
msgid "Warnings"
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:131
msgid ""
"Your edits must not introduce any warnings into the documentation build. If "
"any warnings occur, the build will fail and the merge request will be marked "
"with a red 'X'. Please ensure that your RST is valid and correct before you "
"create a merge request. This is done automatically (via sphinx-build "
"crashing with your error) if you follow :ref:`our build instructions <doc-"
"contribution-workflow>` below."
msgstr ""
"ການແກ້ໄຂຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງບໍ່ນຳສະເໜີຄຳເຕືອນໃດໆເຂົ້າໃນການ build ເອກະສານ. ຖ້າມີຄຳເຕືອນເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການ "
"build ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການລວມຈະຖືກໝາຍດ້ວຍ 'X' ສີແດງ. ກະລຸນາຮັບປະກັນວ່າ RST "
"ຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສ້າງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການລວມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກເຮັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຜ່ານ sphinx-build "
"crashing ກັບຄວາມຜິດພາດຂອງທ່ານ) ຖ້າທ່ານປະຕິບັດຕາມ :ref:`ຄຳແນະນຳການ build ຂອງພວກເຮົາ "
"<doc-contribution-workflow>` ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:135
msgid "Line length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວຂອງແຖວ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:137
msgid ""
"There is no restriction on line length in this repository. Please do not "
"break lines at an arbitrary line length. Instead, turn on word wrap in your "
"text editor."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຍາວຂອງແຖວໃນ repository ນີ້. ກະລຸນາຢ່າຕັດແຖວຕາມຄວາມຍາວທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແນວນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັດຄຳ (word wrap) ໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:142
msgid "Contribution workflow"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການປະກອບສ່ວນ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:144
msgid ""
"The following steps explain how you can make a contribution to this "
"documentation."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດປະກອບສ່ວນເຂົ້າໃນເອກະສານນີ້."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:147
msgid ""
"You will need a GitLab account to complete these steps. If you do not have "
"an account, go to `gitlab.com <https://gitlab.com>`_ to create one."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງການບັນຊີ GitLab ເພື່ອເຮັດສຳເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ມີບັນຊີ, ໄປທີ່ `gitlab.com "
"<https://gitlab.com>`_ ເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີ."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:150
msgid "Forking the repository"
msgstr "ການ Fork repository"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:152
msgid ""
"You can make more advanced edits to the documentation by forking `ubports/"
"docs.ubports.com <https://gitlab.com/ubports/docs/docs.ubports.com>`_ on "
"GitLab."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດການແກ້ໄຂຂັ້ນສູງຕໍ່ເອກະສານໂດຍການ fork `ubports/docs.ubports.com <https://"
"gitlab.com/ubports/docs/docs.ubports.com>`_ ໃນ GitLab."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:155
msgid "Building the documentation"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ (Building) ເອກະສານ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:157
msgid ""
"To build this documentation, follow these instructions on your *local copy* "
"of your fork of the repository."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງເອກະສານນີ້, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນ *local copy* ຂອງ fork repository "
"ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:159
msgid ""
"The documentation can be built by running ``./build.sh`` in the root of this "
"repository. The script will also create a virtual build environment in ``~/"
"ubportsdocsenv`` if none is present."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານສາມາດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍການແລ່ນ ``./build.sh`` ໃນ root ຂອງ repository ນີ້. "
"ສະຄິບຍັງຈະສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການ build ແບບ virtual ໃນ ``~/ubportsdocsenv`` ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:161
msgid ""
"If all went well, you can enter the ``_build/html`` directory and open "
"``index.html`` to view the UBports documentation."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງເປັນໄປດ້ວຍດີ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ``_build/html`` ແລະ ເປີດ "
"``index.html`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເອກະສານ UBports."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:163
msgid ""
"If you have trouble building the docs, the first thing to try is deleting "
"the build environment. Run ``rm -r ~/ubportsdocsenv`` and try the build "
"again."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານມີບັນຫາໃນການສ້າງເອກະສານ, ສິ່ງທຳອິດທີ່ຄວນລອງຄືລຶບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການ build. ແລ່ນ ``rm -r "
"~/ubportsdocsenv`` ແລະ ລອງ build ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:166
msgid "Final check of your contribution"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍຂອງການປະກອບສ່ວນຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:168
msgid ""
"After you have created your Merge Request on GitLab, the Continuous "
"Integration (CI) system will make a test build of your contribution (a "
"\"pipeline\"). Please double check whether this builds successfully and "
"whether the result looks as you intended it to:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງ Merge Request ໃນ GitLab, ລະບົບ Continuous Integration (CI) "
"ຈະເຮັດການ test build ສຳລັບການປະກອບສ່ວນຂອງທ່ານ (\"pipeline\"). "
"ກະລຸນາກວດສອບອີກຄັ້ງວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ build ສຳເລັດຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບເບິ່ງຄືກັບທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງໃຈໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່:"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:171
msgid ""
"at the top of the \"Overview\" tab of your MR on gitlab you will see the "
"status of the pipeline"
msgstr ""
"ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງແຖບ \"Overview\" ຂອງ MR ຂອງທ່ານໃນ gitlab ທ່ານຈະເຫັນສະຖານະຂອງ pipeline"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:172
msgid ""
"if it says \"Checking pipeline status\" or \"Pipeline running\" then please "
"wait another minute."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມັນເວົ້າວ່າ \"Checking pipeline status\" ຫຼື \"Pipeline running\" ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າອີກນາທີ."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:173
msgid ""
"if it says \"Pipeline failed\" with a red X and, then something went wrong, "
"please click on the link to find the details"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມັນເວົ້າວ່າ \"Pipeline failed\" ພ້ອມກັບ X ສີແດງ, ສະແດງວ່າມີບາງຢ່າງຜິດພາດ, "
"ກະລຸນາຄິກທີ່ລິ້ງເພື່ອຊອກຫາລາຍລະອຽດ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:174
msgid ""
"if it says \"Pipeline passed\" with green check mark, it means the MR could "
"be built successfully and you can proceed to look at the results"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມັນເວົ້າວ່າ \"Pipeline passed\" ພ້ອມກັບເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກສີຂຽວ, ມັນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ MR ສາມາດຖືກ "
"build ສຳເລັດ ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການເບິ່ງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:175
msgid "now please click on link of that pipeline"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ກະລຸນາຄິກທີ່ລິ້ງຂອງ pipeline ນັ້ນ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:176
msgid "click on \"build\" job"
msgstr "ຄິກທີ່ job \"build\""

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:177
msgid ""
"this brings you to the end of the build log, where you'll see a message: "
"\"Build succeeded, browse the artifact here\""
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະນຳທ່ານໄປສູ່ຕອນທ້າຍຂອງບັນທຶກ build, ບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ: \"Build succeeded, "
"browse the artifact here\""

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:178
msgid ""
"click the link next to it to see the full version of the UBports "
"documentation site with your changes"
msgstr "ຄິກທີ່ລິ້ງຂ້າງໆມັນເພື່ອເບິ່ງເວັບໄຊທ໌ເອກະສານ UBports ສະບັບເຕັມທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:179
msgid "double check whether your changes look ok"
msgstr "ກວດສອບອີກຄັ້ງວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານເບິ່ງຄືວ່າ ok ຫຼືບໍ່"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:182
msgid "Alternative methods to contribute"
msgstr "ວິທີການທາງເລືອກໃນການປະກອບສ່ວນ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:185 ../../contribute/translations.rst:2
#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/translations.rst:2
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "ການແປພາສາ"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:187
msgid ""
"You may find the components of this document to translate at `its project in "
"UBports Weblate`_."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາອົງປະກອບຂອງເອກະສານນີ້ເພື່ອແປໄດ້ທີ່ `ໂຄງການຂອງມັນໃນ UBports Weblate`_."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:190
msgid "Writing documents not in RST format"
msgstr "ການຂຽນເອກະສານທີ່ບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ RST"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:192
msgid ""
"If you would like to write documents for UBports but are not comfortable "
"writing ReStructuredText, please write it without formatting and post it on "
"the `UBports Forum`_ in the relevant section (likely General). Someone will "
"be able to help you revise your draft and write the required "
"ReStructuredText."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນເອກະສານສຳລັບ UBports ແຕ່ບໍ່ສະດວກໃນການຂຽນ ReStructuredText, "
"ກະລຸນາຂຽນມັນໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຈັດຮູບແບບ ແລະ ໂພສລົງໃນ `UBports Forum`_ ໃນພາກສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ "
"(ໜ້າຈະເປັນ General). ບາງຄົນຈະສາມາດຊ່ວຍທ່ານແກ້ໄຂຮ່າງຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນ ReStructuredText "
"ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:195
msgid "Uncomfortable with Git"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສະດວກກັບ Git"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.rst:197
msgid ""
"If you've written a complete document in ReStructuredText but aren't "
"comfortable using Git or GitLab, please post it on the `UBports Forum`_ in "
"the relevant section (likely General). Someone will be able to help you "
"revise your draft and submit it to this documentation."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ຂຽນເອກະສານທີ່ສົມບູນໃນ ReStructuredText ແຕ່ບໍ່ສະດວກໃນການໃຊ້ Git ຫຼື GitLab, "
"ກະລຸນາໂພສລົງໃນ `UBports Forum`_ ໃນພາກສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (ໜ້າຈະເປັນ General). "
"ບາງຄົນຈະສາມາດຊ່ວຍທ່ານແກ້ໄຂຮ່າງຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ສົ່ງມັນເຂົ້າໃນເອກະສານນີ້."

