msgid "System Settings (`system-settings on GitLab`_)"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ (`system-settings ໃນ GitLab`_)"

#: ../../contribute/preinstalled-apps.rst:56
msgid ""
"Instructions for contributing to these applications can be found in their "
"respective repositories."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບການປະກອບສ່ວນໃຫ້ກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວຂອງແຕ່ລະແອັບ."

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:2
msgid "Quality Assurance"
msgstr "ການຮັບປະກັນຄຸນນະພາບ (QA)"

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:4
msgid ""
"This page explains how to help the UBports QA team, both as an official "
"member or a new contributor. Please also read the :doc:`issue tracking </"
"about/process/issue-tracking>` and :doc:`bugreporting <bugreporting>` guides "
"to better understand the workflow. For real-time communication, you can join "
"our `telegram group <http://t.me/ubports_qa_team>`_."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທີມງານ UBports QA, ທັງໃນຖານະສະມາຊິກຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ ຫຼື "
"ຜູ້ປະກອບສ່ວນໃໝ່. ກະລຸນາອ່ານຄູ່ມື :doc:`ການຕິດຕາມບັນຫາ </about/process/issue-tracking>` "
"ແລະ :doc:`ການລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ <bugreporting>` ເພື່ອເຂົ້າໃຈຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. "
"ສຳລັບການສື່ສານແບບທັນທີ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ `ກຸ່ມ Telegram <http://t.me/"
"ubports_qa_team>`_ ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:7
msgid "Smoke testing"
msgstr "ການທົດສອບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ (Smoke testing)"

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:9
msgid ""
"To test the core functionality of the operating system, we have compiled `a "
"set of standardized tests <https://gitlab.com/ubports/teams/qa/project-"
"management/raw/master/QA-Plan-Template.ots>`_. Run these tests on your "
"device to :doc:`find and report bugs and regressions <bugreporting>`. It's "
"usually run on all devices before a new release to make sure no new issues "
"were introduced."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອທົດສອບການເຮັດວຽກຫຼັກຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ລວບລວມ `ຊຸດການທົດສອບມາດຕະຖານ "
"<https://gitlab.com/ubports/teams/qa/project-management/raw/master/QA-Plan-"
"Template.ots>`_. ໃຫ້ແລ່ນການທົດສອບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອ :doc:`ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ "
"ລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ສິ່ງທີ່ຜິດພ້ຽນ (regressions) <bugreporting>`. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ "
"ມັນຈະຖືກແລ່ນໃນທຸກອຸປະກອນ ກ່ອນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບໍ່ມີບັນຫາໃໝ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:12
msgid "Confirming bug reports"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນບົດລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ"

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:14
msgid ""
"Unconfirmed bugreports are labeled **needs confirmation** to enable `global "
"filtering <https://gitlab.com/groups/ubports/-/issues/?"
"sort=created_date&state=opened&or%5Blabel_name%5D%5B%5D=need%20confirmation&or%5Blabel_name%5D%5B%5D=needs%20confirmation&first_page_size=20>`__. "
"Browse through the list, read the bugreports and try to reproduce the issues "
"that are described. If necessary, add :doc:`missing information or logs, or "
"improve the quality of the report by other means <bugreporting>`. Leave a "
"comment stating your device, channel, build number and whether or not you "
"were able to reproduce the issue."
msgstr ""
"ບົດລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ ຈະຖືກຕິດປ້າຍ **needs confirmation** ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ "
"`ການກອງຂໍ້ມູນທົ່ວໂລກ <https://gitlab.com/groups/ubports/-/issues/?"
"sort=created_date&state=opened&or%5Blabel_name%5D%5B%5D=need%20confirmation&or%5Blabel_name%5D%5B%5D=needs%20confirmation&first_page_size=20>`__. "
"ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຜ່ານລາຍການ, ອ່ານບົດລາຍງານ ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ບັນຫາທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ນັ້ນເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, "
"ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ :doc:`ຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (logs) ທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ, ຫຼື ປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບຂອງບົດລາຍງານ "
"<bugreporting>`. ໃຫ້ຂຽນຄຳເຫັນໂດຍລະບຸອຸປະກອນ, ຊ່ອງທາງ (channel), ໝາຍເລກ build ແລະ "
"ລະບຸວ່າທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບັນຫາເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:16
msgid ""
"If you have write-access to the repository, you can replace the **needs "
"confirmation** label with **bug** (to mark it confirmed) or **invalid** (if "
"the issue is definitely not reproducible). In that case it should be closed."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານມີສິດຂຽນໃນບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນປ້າຍ **needs confirmation** ເປັນ **bug** "
"(ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າມັນໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ) ຫຼື **invalid** "
"(ຖ້າບັນຫານັ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳໄດ້ຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ). ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ຄວນຈະປິດບັນຫາ (close issue) "
"ດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:18
msgid ""
"If you find two issues describing the same problem, leave a comment and try "
"to find their differences. If they are in fact identical, close the newer "
"one and label it **duplicate**."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານພົບສອງບັນຫາທີ່ອະທິບາຍເຖິງບັນຫາດຽວກັນ, ໃຫ້ຂຽນຄຳເຫັນ ແລະ "
"ພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງພວກມັນ. ຖ້າມັນຄືກັນແທ້, ໃຫ້ປິດອັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ ແລະ ຕິດປ້າຍມັນວ່າ "
"**duplicate**."

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:21
msgid "Testing patches"
msgstr "ການທົດສອບ Patches"

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:23
msgid ""
"Pull-requests can be tested using the `QA scripts <https://gitlab.com/"
"ubports/development/core/ubports-qa-scripts>`_. Run ``ubports-qa -h`` for "
"usage information."
msgstr ""
"Pull-requests ສາມາດທົດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ `QA scripts <https://gitlab.com/ubports/"
"development/core/ubports-qa-scripts>`_. ໃຫ້ແລ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ ``ubports-qa -h`` "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນການນຳໃຊ້."

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:25
msgid ""
"Once the pull-request has been merged, the issue it fixes is moved to the "
"completed column of the `Gitlab Milestone <https://gitlab.com/groups/"
"ubports/-/milestones>`__. Please check if the issues in this column are "
"still present in the latest update on the devel channel, then see if "
"anything else has broken in the update. Check if the developer mentioned "
"specific things to look out for when testing and leave a comment detailing "
"your experience. If you have write-access to the repository, you can move "
"the issue back to **In Development** (and reopen it) or forward to **Release "
"Candidate** as specified by the :doc:`issue tracking guidelines </about/"
"process/issue-tracking>`."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ pull-request ຖືກລວມ (merge) ເຂົ້າແລ້ວ, ບັນຫາທີ່ມັນແກ້ໄຂຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ຄໍລຳທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວຂອງ "
"`GitLab Milestone <https://gitlab.com/groups/ubports/-/milestones>`__. "
"ກະລຸນາກວດສອບວ່າບັນຫາໃນຄໍລຳນີ້ ຍັງຄົງມີຢູ່ໃນການອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດໃນຊ່ອງທາງ devel ຫຼືບໍ່, "
"ຈາກນັ້ນເບິ່ງວ່າມີຫຍັງອື່ນເສຍຫາຍໃນການອັບເດດຫຼືບໍ່. ກວດເບິ່ງວ່ານັກພັດທະນາໄດ້ລະບຸສິ່ງສະເພາະ "
"ທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງລະວັງໃນເວລາທົດສອບຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຂຽນຄຳເຫັນລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດປະສົບການຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານມີສິດຂຽນໃນບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍບັນຫາກັບຄືນໄປທີ່ **In Development** (ແລະ "
"ເປີດມັນຄືນໃໝ່) ຫຼື ສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຍັງ **Release Candidate** "
"ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ :doc:`ຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕາມບັນຫາ </about/process/issue-tracking>`."

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:28
msgid "Initial triaging of issues"
msgstr "ການຄັດແຍກບັນຫາເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:30
msgid ""
"Initial triaging of new issues is done by QA-team members with write-access "
"to the repository. If a new issue is filed, read the report and add the "
"correct labels as specified by the :doc:`issue tracking guidelines </about/"
"process/issue-tracking>`. You can also immediately start confirming the "
"bugreport."
msgstr ""
"ການຄັດແຍກເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຂອງບັນຫາໃໝ່ ແມ່ນເຮັດໂດຍສະມາຊິກທີມ QA ທີ່ມີສິດຂຽນໃນບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ. "
"ຖ້າມີການຍື່ນບັນຫາໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ອ່ານບົດລາຍງານ ແລະ "
"ເພີ່ມປ້າຍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ :doc:`ຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕາມບັນຫາ </about/process/issue-"
"tracking>`. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢືນຢັນບົດລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#: ../../contribute/quality-assurance.rst:32
msgid ""
"If the new issue has already been reported elsewhere, label it **duplicate** "
"and close it."
msgstr "ຖ້າບັນຫາໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖືກລາຍງານຢູ່ບ່ອນອື່ນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຕິດປ້າຍມັນວ່າ **duplicate** ແລະ ປິດມັນ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:4
msgid ""
"Although English is the official base language for all UBports projects we "
"believe you have the right to use it in any language you want."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າພາສາອັງກິດ ຈະເປັນພາສາພື້ນຖານຢ່າງເປັນທາງການສຳລັບທຸກໂຄງການ UBports, "
"ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອວ່າທ່ານມີສິດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ມັນໃນພາສາໃດກໍ່ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:6
msgid ""
"We are working hard to meet that goal, and you can help as well. You decide "
"how much time you can put into translation. From minutes to hours, "
"everything counts."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງໜັກເພື່ອໃຫ້ບັນລຸເປົ້າໝາຍນັ້ນ, ແລະ ທ່ານກໍ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕັດສິນໃຈເອງວ່າ ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍປານໃດໃນການແປພາສາ. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ນາທີຈົນເຖິງຊົ່ວໂມງ, "
"ທຸກຢ່າງລ້ວນແຕ່ມີຄ່າ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:9
msgid "How does a text get translated (technical background)"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກແປແນວໃດ (ພື້ນຖານທາງດ້ານເຕັກນິກ)"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:10
msgid ""
"Most apps running on Ubuntu Touch use `GNU gettext <https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/gettext/>`_ for translations. A *.pot* template file holds an apps "
"strings. From this template for every language an individual *.po* file is "
"derived. Those *.po* files do contain the actual translations. To add a new "
"language a new *.po* file needs to be created. To translate a string the "
"*.po* file needs to be edited. Next to the original string (english in most "
"cases) the appropriate translation needs to be entered following the *.po* "
"gettext file syntax. Some apps do use `QtLinguist <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/"
"qtlinguist-index.html>`_ for translation. It does follow the same priciples "
"only using *.ts* files for translations with another syntax. As template one "
"*.ts* file is used."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ແລ່ນໃນ Ubuntu Touch ຈະນຳໃຊ້ `GNU gettext <https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/gettext/>`_ ສຳລັບການແປພາສາ. ໄຟລ໌ແມ່ແບບ *.pot* ຈະບັນຈຸຂໍ້ຄວາມ (strings) "
"ຂອງແອັບ. ຈາກແມ່ແບບນີ້, ໄຟລ໌ *.po* ແຕ່ລະອັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບທຸກພາສາ. ໄຟລ໌ *.po* "
"ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະບັນຈຸການແປຕົວຈິງ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມພາສາໃໝ່, ຕ້ອງໄດ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ *.po* ໃໝ່ຂຶ້ນມາ. ໃນການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມ, "
"ຕ້ອງໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ *.po*. ໂດຍການປ້ອນການແປທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ລົງໄປຖັດຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ "
"(ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນພາສາອັງກິດ) ຕາມຮູບແບບ syntax ຂອງໄຟລ໌ *.po* gettext. ບາງແອັບກໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ "
"`QtLinguist <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtlinguist-index.html>`_ ສຳລັບການແປ. "
"ເຊິ່ງມັນຈະປະຕິບັດຕາມຫຼັກການດຽວກັນ ແຕ່ພຽງນຳໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ *.ts* ສຳລັບການແປທີ່ມີ syntax ອື່ນ. "
"ໂດຍຈະນຳໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ *.ts* ໄຟລ໌ດຽວເປັນແມ່ແບບ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:14
msgid ""
"Within an app strings are marked either this way ``i18n.tr(\"string\")`` "
"when using gettext or like this ``tr(\"string\")`` when using QtLinguist. "
"When the app is built those translatable strings are extracted and written "
"into the *.pot* or *.ts* template files. The *.po* and *.ts* language files "
"then need to be updated from their template."
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃນແອັບ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກໝາຍດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ ``i18n.tr(\"string\")`` ເມື່ອໃຊ້ gettext ຫຼື ແບບນີ້ "
"``tr(\"string\")`` ເມື່ອໃຊ້ QtLinguist. ເມື່ອແອັບຖືກ build, ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ຈະຖືກສະກັດອອກມາ ແລະ ຂຽນລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ແມ່ແບບ *.pot* ຫຼື *.ts*. ຈາກນັ້ນ ໄຟລ໌ພາສາ *.po* ແລະ "
"*.ts* ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຈາກແມ່ແບບຂອງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:16
msgid ""
"Once strings have been translated, they are made available for users with a "
"new release of an app."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້ຖືກແປແລ້ວ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ ໃນການປ່ອຍແອັບເວີຊັນໃໝ່."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:19
msgid "Methods of Translation"
msgstr "ວິທີການແປພາສາ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:21
msgid "There are three commonly used ways to translate an app:"
msgstr "ມີສາມວິທີທີ່ນິຍົມໃຊ້ໃນການແປແອັບ:"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:23
msgid ""
"Weblate: A web based translation tool. UBports apps using Weblate can be "
"translated at the `UBports translation projects dashboard <https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/projects/ubports/>`_ and the `Lomiri translation projects "
"dashboard <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/lomiri/>`_. There is an "
"automatic transfer of new strings from an apps repo to weblate. Translated "
"strings get back as commits to the repo from weblate."
msgstr ""
"Weblate: ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືແປພາສາຜ່ານເວັບ. ແອັບຂອງ UBports ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ Weblate ສາມາດແປໄດ້ທີ່ "
"`ກະດານໂຄງການແປຂອງ UBports <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/ubports/>`_ "
"ແລະ `ກະດານໂຄງການແປຂອງ Lomiri <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/lomiri/"
">`_. ຈະມີການໂອນຍ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວຂອງແອັບໄປຍັງ Weblate. ແລະ "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປແລ້ວຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນມາເປັນ commit ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ ຈາກ Weblate."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:24
msgid ""
"Editor: Translation is done by changing *.po* files with the editor of your "
"choice, and a GitHub/GitLab account. The *.po*/*.ts* files for each project "
"are in their repository on `our GitLab organization <https://gitlab.com/"
"ubports>`_ or on `our GitHub organization <https://github.com/ubports>`_. "
"After translating the translator commits new translations to an apps repo "
"generally by opening a merge request/pull request."
msgstr ""
"Editor: ແມ່ນການແປໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ *.po* ດ້ວຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ, ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ບັນຊີ "
"GitHub/GitLab. ໄຟລ໌ *.po*/*.ts* ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂຄງການ ຈະຢູ່ໃນບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວຂອງພວກເຂົາໃນ "
"`ອົງກອນ GitLab ຂອງພວກເຮົາ <https://gitlab.com/ubports>`_ ຫຼື ໃນ `ອົງກອນ GitHub "
"ຂອງພວກເຮົາ <https://github.com/ubports>`_. ຫຼັງຈາກການແປແລ້ວ, ນັກແປຈະທຳການ commit "
"ການແປໃໝ່ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວຂອງແອັບ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນຜ່ານການເປີດ merge request/pull request."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:25
msgid ""
"Team translation: We also have  a `Translation Forum <https://"
"forums.ubports.com/category/39/translations>`_ to discuss translating Ubuntu "
"Touch and its core apps. Some projects are using Telegram or Matrix groups "
"too, and some teams are still using the Ubuntu Launchpad framework."
msgstr ""
"Team translation: ພວກເຮົາຍັງມີ `ເວທີສົນທະນາການແປ (Translation Forum) <https://"
"forums.ubports.com/category/39/translations>`_ ເພື່ອປຶກສາຫາລືກ່ຽວກັບການແປ Ubuntu "
"Touch ແລະ ແອັບຫຼັກຂອງມັນ. ບາງໂຄງການກໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ກຸ່ມ Telegram ຫຼື Matrix ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ແລະ "
"ບາງທີມກໍ່ຍັງຄົງນຳໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງ Ubuntu Launchpad ຢູ່."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:27
msgid ""
"Core apps and some community apps like dekko or TELEports are generally "
"using weblate for translation. This is the preferred way to translate and it "
"does not need any programming skills. Please have a look at the `UBports "
"translation projects dashboard <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/ubports/"
">`_ and the `Lomiri translation projects dashboard <https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/projects/lomiri/>`_. When using weblate do not edit *.po* "
"files manually. Commiting edited *.po* files can break the automated process "
"of translation."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບຫຼັກ ແລະ ບາງແອັບຊຸມຊົນເຊັ່ນ Dekko ຫຼື TELEports ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນນຳໃຊ້ Weblate ສຳລັບການແປ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການແປ ເພາະມັນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີທັກສະໃນການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງທີ່ "
"`ກະດານໂຄງການແປຂອງ UBports <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/ubports/>`_ "
"ແລະ `ກະດານໂຄງການແປຂອງ Lomiri <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/lomiri/"
">`_. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ Weblate ຫ້າມແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ *.po* ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ການ commit ໄຟລ໌ *.po* "
"ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການແປອັດຕະໂນມັດເສຍຫາຍໄດ້."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:29
msgid ""
"Most apps maintained by individual developers are mainly using *.pot*/*.po* "
"files for translation. Those generally need to be edited manually and "
"commited to the apps repo."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງແຍງໂດຍນັກພັດທະນາແຕ່ລະບຸກຄົນ ແມ່ນຈະນຳໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ *.pot*/*.po* "
"ເປັນຫຼັກສຳລັບການແປ. ເຊິ່ງໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ພວກມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ commit "
"ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວຂອງແອັບ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:32
msgid "How-To"
msgstr "ວິທີການ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:35
msgid "Hosted Weblate"
msgstr "Hosted Weblate"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:37
msgid ""
"You can go to `UBports translation projects dashboard <https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/projects/ubports/>`_ or the `Lomiri translation projects "
"dashboard <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/lomiri/>`_, go to a project, "
"and start making anonymous suggestions without being registered. If you want "
"to save your translations, you must be logged in."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໄປທີ່ `ກະດານໂຄງການແປຂອງ UBports <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/"
"ubports/>`_ ຫຼື `ກະດານໂຄງການແປຂອງ Lomiri <https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/"
"lomiri/>`_, ເລືອກໂຄງການ, ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳແບບບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນ. ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການບັນທຶກການແປຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບກ່ອນ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:39
msgid ""
"For that, go to UBports Weblate and click on the \"Register\" button. Once "
"in the \"Registration\" page, you'll find two options:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ UBports Weblate ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ \"Register\". ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນໜ້າ "
"\"Registration\", ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນສອງທາງເລືອກ:"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:41
msgid ""
"Register using a valid email address, a username, and your full name. You'll "
"need to resolve an easy control question too."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ແລະ ຊື່ເຕັມຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຕອບຄຳຖາມກວດສອບງ່າຍໆອີກດ້ວຍ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:42
msgid ""
"Register using a third party registration. Currently the system supports "
"accounts from openSUSE, GitHub, Fedora, and Ubuntu."
msgstr ""
"ລົງທະບຽນໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ການລົງທະບຽນຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມ. ປັດຈຸບັນ ລະບົບຮອງຮັບບັນຊີຈາກ openSUSE, GitHub, "
"Fedora, ແລະ Ubuntu."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:44
msgid ""
"Once you're logged in, the site is self-explanatory and there you'll find "
"all the options and customization you can do."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແລ້ວ, ເວັບໄຊທ໌ຈະມີຄຳອະທິບາຍໃນຕົວຂອງມັນເອງ ແລະ ຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ "
"ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນທຸກທາງເລືອກ ແລະ ການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:46
msgid ""
"Now, get on with it. The first step is to search if your language already "
"exists in the project of your choice. If your language is not available for "
"a specific project, you can add it yourself."
msgstr ""
"ບາດນີ້, ມາລົງມືເຮັດເລີຍ. ຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດແມ່ນການຄົ້ນຫາວ່າ ພາສາຂອງທ່ານມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນໂຄງການທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກຫຼືບໍ່. "
"ຖ້າພາສາຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ທັນມີສຳລັບໂຄງການສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມມັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:49
msgid ".po/.ts File Editor"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ .po/.ts"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:51
msgid ""
"If you want to work with *.po*/*.ts* files directly you need to know what "
"you're doing for sure. The first thing you should always remember is:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກກັບໄຟລ໌ *.po*/*.ts* ໂດຍກົງ ທ່ານຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານຮູ້ໃນສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດຢູ່. "
"ສິ່ງທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານຄວນຈື່ໄວ້ສະເໝີຄື:"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:54
msgid ""
"Do **never** commit *.po* files to projects that are translated using "
"weblate. This could break the whole translation exchange process with "
"weblate."
msgstr ""
"**ຫ້າມ** commit ໄຟລ໌ *.po* ໄປຍັງໂຄງການທີ່ຖືກແປໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ Weblate ຢ່າງເດັດຂາດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການແລກປ່ຽນການແປທັງໝົດກັບ Weblate ເສຍຫາຍໄດ້."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:56
msgid ""
"As was said up above, you need a file editor of your choice and a GitHub/"
"GitLab account to translate *.po*/*.ts* files directly. Idealy you do have "
"`clickable <http://clickable.bhdouglass.com/en/latest/>`_ set up and know "
"how to build an app."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ ແລະ ບັນຊີ GitHub/GitLab ເພື່ອແປໄຟລ໌ "
"*.po*/*.ts* ໂດຍກົງ. ທາງທີ່ດີ ທ່ານຄວນຈະມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `clickable <http://"
"clickable.bhdouglass.com/en/latest/>`_ ໄວ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຮູ້ວິທີການ build ແອັບ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:58
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are online gettext .po editors and those you can install on your "
"computer. You can choose whatever editor you want, but we prefer to work "
"with free software only. There are too many plain text editors and tools to "
"help you translate *.po*/*.ts* files to list here."
msgstr ""
"ມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂ gettext .po ແບບອອນລາຍ ແລະ ແບບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃດກໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາສະດວກໃຈທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບຊອບແວເສລີເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ມີຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືຫຼາຍເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະນຳມາໄລ່ຊື່ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:61
msgid ""
"For high quality translations it is recommended to go through all of the "
"steps given below. Although if you are not familiar with building apps using "
"clickable, skip the steps 4. to 6. Although, you may not be able to "
"translate the latest strings and you will not know if the strings fit into "
"the apps layout."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອການແປທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ໃຫ້ໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້. ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບການ "
"build ແອັບໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ clickable, ໃຫ້ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 4 ຫາ 6 ໄປກ່ອນ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, "
"ທ່ານອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແປຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼ້າສຸດໄດ້ ແລະ ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນພໍດີກັບໂຄງຮ່າງ (layout) ຂອງແອັບຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:63
msgid "How to proceed:"
msgstr "ວິທີການດຳເນີນການ:"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:65
msgid "Fork the apps repo into your GitHub or GitLab account"
msgstr "Fork ບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວຂອງແອັບ ເຂົ້າໃນບັນຊີ GitHub ຫຼື GitLab ຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:66
msgid "Clone the repo locally or use GitLab's online editor"
msgstr "Clone ບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວມາມາໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ນຳໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂອອນລາຍຂອງ GitLab"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:67
msgid "(optional) Create a new branch for the translation"
msgstr "(ທາງເລືອກ) ສ້າງ branch ໃໝ່ສຳລັບການແປ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:68
msgid ""
"Build the app using clickable to get up-to-date *.pot*/*.ts* template files"
msgstr "Build ແອັບໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ clickable ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ໄຟລ໌ແມ່ແບບ *.pot*/*.ts* ທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:69
msgid "Update the desired *.po*/*.ts* language file(s) from the template"
msgstr "ອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ພາສາ *.po*/*.ts* ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ຈາກໄຟລ໌ແມ່ແບບ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:70
msgid "Translate all strings"
msgstr "ແປຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:71
msgid "Build and install the app on your device and test the translations"
msgstr "Build ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບໃສ່ໃນອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວທົດສອບການແປ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:72
msgid ""
"(optional) Repeat steps 6. and 7. until you are satisfied with your work"
msgstr "(ທາງເລືອກ) ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 6 ແລະ 7 ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະພໍໃຈກັບຜົນງານຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:73
msgid ""
"Push the translated *.po*/*.ts* file(s) to your forked repo [do NOT commit "
"*.pot*/*.ts* template files]"
msgstr ""
"Push ໄຟລ໌ *.po*/*.ts* ທີ່ແປແລ້ວໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານ fork ມາ [ຫ້າມ commit ໄຟລ໌ແມ່ແບບ "
"*.pot*/*.ts*]"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:74
msgid "Open a merge/pull request from your fork to the apps repo"
msgstr "ເປີດ merge/pull request ຈາກ fork ຂອງທ່ານ ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວຂອງແອັບ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:78
msgid "Translation Team Communication"
msgstr "ການສື່ສານຂອງທີມງານແປ"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:80
msgid ""
"You may talk to others regarding translations by using `the forum category "
"<https://forums.ubports.com/category/39/translations>`_ that UBports "
"provides for this task. To use it you need to register, or login if you're "
"registered already."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສົນທະນາກັບຄົນອື່ນກ່ຽວກັບການແປ ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ `ໝວດໝູ່ເວທີສົນທະນາ <https://"
"forums.ubports.com/category/39/translations>`_ ທີ່ UBports "
"ຈັດກຽມໄວ້ໃຫ້ສຳລັບວຽກງານນີ້. ໃນການນຳໃຊ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນກ່ອນ, ຫຼື ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຖ້າທ່ານມີບັນຊີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:82
msgid ""
"The only requirement is to start your post putting down your language in "
"brackets in the \"Enter your topic title here\" field. For example, "
"``[Spanish] How to translate whatever?``"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ກຳນົດພຽງຢ່າງດຽວແມ່ນໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂພສຂອງທ່ານ ໂດຍການລະບຸພາສາຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ໃນວົງເລັບ ໃນຊ່ອງ \"Enter "
"your topic title here\". ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``[Lao] ວິທີການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ແມ່ນແນວໃດ?``"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:84
msgid ""
"In your interactions with your team you'll find the best way to coordinate "
"your translations."
msgstr "ໃນການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມກັບທີມງານຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນການປະສານງານການແປຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:87
msgid "License"
msgstr "ໃບອະນຸຍາດ (License)"

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:89
msgid ""
"All the translation projects, and all your contributions to this project, "
"are under a `Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC "
"BY-SA 4.0) <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>`_ license that "
"you explicitly accept by contributing to the project."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງການແປທັງໝົດ, ແລະ ທຸກໆການປະກອບສ່ວນຂອງທ່ານຕໍ່ໂຄງການນີ້, ແມ່ນຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ໃບອະນຸຍາດ `Creative "
"Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0) <https://"
"creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>`_ "
"ເຊິ່ງທ່ານຍອມຮັບຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງໂດຍການປະກອບສ່ວນເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ."

#: ../../contribute/translations.rst:91
msgid "Go to that link to learn what this exactly means."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ລິ້ງນັ້ນ ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ວ່າມັນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແນວໃດແທ້."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:2
msgid "App main view"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງຫຼັກຂອງແອັບ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:4
msgid ""
"When an app starts, shows a generic splash screen (as in the image) or a "
"custom one, then the main view."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອແອັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຈໍໂລໂກ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Splash screen) ແບບທົ່ວໄປ (ດັ່ງໃນຮູບ) ຫຼື "
"ແບບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສະແດງມຸມມອງຫຼັກ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:8
msgid "The standard parts of a main view or any other page may be:"
msgstr "ສ່ວນມາດຕະຖານຂອງມຸມມອງຫຼັກ ຫຼື ໜ້າອື່ນໆ ອາດຈະປະກອບມີ:"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:11
msgid "Header"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຫົວ (Header)"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:13
msgid "Display app name, leading area and trailing area icons."
msgstr "ສະແດງຊື່ແອັບ, ໄອຄອນໃນສ່ວນພື້ນທີ່ນຳໜ້າ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:17
msgid "In this case, showing title and trailing actions."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ຈະສະແດງຫົວຂໍ້ ແລະ ການກະທຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:20
msgid "Tabbed content"
msgstr "ເນື້ອຫາແບບແຖບ (Tabbed content)"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:22
msgid "To organize information under tabs."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດລະບຽບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃຕ້ແຖບຕ່າງໆ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:27
msgid "Bottom edge menu"
msgstr "ເມນູຂອບລຸ່ມ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/app-main-view.rst:29
msgid "For quick actions. See `Quick actions`_."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການກະທຳດ່ວນ. ເບິ່ງ `ການກະທຳດ່ວນ`_."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:2
msgid "Dialogs"
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ (Dialogs)"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:4
msgid ""
"A dialog is a way of informing the user about important notices or letting "
"them complete a single action."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ ແມ່ນວິທີການແຈ້ງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຊາບກ່ຽວກັບປະກາດທີ່ສຳຄັນ ຫຼື "
"ໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາເຮັດການກະທຳຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:6
msgid ""
"Dialogs should be unambiguous and concise in their wording. Only the most "
"common, or main, action should be highlighted with color. The main action "
"should be placed topmost in vertical dialogs or rightmost in horizontal "
"dialogs."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ ຄວນມີການໃຊ້ຄຳເວົ້າທີ່ບໍ່ກຳກວມ ແລະ ກະທັດຮັດ. ຄວນເນັ້ນສີສະເພາະການກະທຳທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ ຫຼື "
"ການກະທຳຫຼັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການກະທຳຫຼັກຄວນວາງໄວ້ທາງເທິງສຸດໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບແນວຕັ້ງ ຫຼື "
"ຂວາສຸດໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບແນວນອນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:8
msgid ""
"Main actions may be positive, negative, or neutral. Positive actions add "
"something to their subjects. Negative actions remove, delete, or otherwise "
"make changes that can't be easily undone. Neutral actions do not add or "
"remove from the subject, but still make a change."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳຫຼັກອາດຈະເປັນທາງບວກ, ທາງລົບ, ຫຼື ເປັນກາງ. ການກະທຳທາງບວກແມ່ນການເພີ່ມບາງຢ່າງເຂົ້າໄປ. "
"ການກະທຳທາງລົບແມ່ນການເອົາອອກ, ລຶບ, ຫຼື ເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດກັບຄືນໄດ້ງ່າຍ. "
"ການກະທຳທີ່ເປັນກາງແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ເອົາອອກ, ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງມີການປ່ຽນແປງເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:10
msgid ""
"The main action should be highlighted using "
"``theme.palette.normal.negative`` if it is destructive, "
"``theme.palette.normal.positive`` if it is positive, or "
"``theme.palette.normal.focus`` if it is neutral. The remaining options "
"should be gray, without defining a color theme property."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳຫຼັກຄວນຖືກເນັ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ ``theme.palette.normal.negative`` ຖ້າມັນເປັນການລຶບ ຫຼື "
"ທຳລາຍ, ``theme.palette.normal.positive`` ຖ້າເປັນທາງບວກ, ຫຼື "
"``theme.palette.normal.focus`` ຖ້າເປັນກາງ. ສ່ວນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເຫຼືອຄວນເປັນສີເທົາ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດສີຮູບແບບສີສັນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:14
msgid ""
"Dialogs should resume actions, not ask a yes or no question. For example, "
"the user has selected an option to delete a contact. Your dialog should ask, "
"\"Are you sure you would like to delete this contact?\" The options should "
"then be \"Delete\", a negative action colored in red, and \"Cancel\", "
"colored in gray."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ ຄວນສະຫຼຸບການກະທຳ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຖາມຄຳຖາມວ່າ ແມ່ນ ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຈະລຶບຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່. ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຂອງທ່ານຄວນຖາມວ່າ \"ເຈົ້າແນ່ໃຈບໍ່ວ່າຕ້ອງການລຶບຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ນີ້?"
"\" ຈາກນັ້ນຕົວເລືອກຄວນຈະເປັນ \"ລຶບ\", ເຊິ່ງເປັນການກະທຳທາງລົບທີ່ມີສີແດງ, ແລະ \"ຍົກເລີກ\" "
"ທີ່ມີສີເທົາ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:16
msgid ""
"The title should contain useful information. Continuing the contact deletion "
"example, using the contact's name as the title makes it clear and easy to "
"see what is being deleted. A good rule of thumb is to look at your dialog "
"with and without the title - the latter should clearly be missing some data "
"about what is happening."
msgstr ""

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:19
msgid "Examples of designs to avoid"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການອອກແບບທີ່ຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:23
msgid ""
"Left: Download button uses old focus color, Cancel button (secondary action) "
"uses old grey color."
msgstr "ຊ້າຍ: ປຸ່ມດາວໂຫຼດໃຊ້ສີໂຟກັສແບບເກົ່າ, ປຸ່ມຍົກເລີກ (ການກະທຳຮອງ) ໃຊ້ສີເທົາແບບເກົ່າ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/dialogs.rst:25
msgid ""
"Right: Dialog uses generic answers, both buttons colored as main actions "
"with confusing color meaning: \"Will 'No' cause an irreversible action, and "
"'Yes' cause an additive action?\""
msgstr ""
"ຂວາ: ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບໃຊ້ຄຳຕອບແບບທົ່ວໄປ, ທັງສອງປຸ່ມມີສີເປັນການກະທຳຫຼັກ ເຊິ່ງມີຄວາມໝາຍສີທີ່ສັບສົນ: \"ຄຳວ່າ "
"'ບໍ່' ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະທຳທີ່ແກ້ໄຂບໍ່ໄດ້, ແລະ 'ແມ່ນ' ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການກະທຳເພີ່ມເຕີມຫຼືບໍ່?\""

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/header-uses.rst:2
msgid "Header uses"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ສ່ວນຫົວ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/header-uses.rst:4
msgid ""
"App headers can be used to show app name, app section or page, search box, "
"or other globally accessible functions."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງແອັບ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຊື່ແອັບ, ພາກສ່ວນ ຫຼື ໜ້າຂອງແອັບ, ກ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາ, ຫຼື "
"ຟັງຊັນອື່ນໆທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ທົ່ວໄປ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/header-uses.rst:12
msgid ""
"Some special apps doesn't show any header, like the Camera app or some games."
msgstr "ແອັບພິເສດບາງຢ່າງຈະບໍ່ສະແດງສ່ວນຫົວເລີຍ ເຊັ່ນ: ແອັບກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ ຫຼື ເກມບາງຢ່າງ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/header-uses.rst:14
msgid ""
"The header takes care of showing the back button when a `page stack <https://"
"api-docs.ubports.com/sdk/apps/qml/Ubuntu.Components/PageStack.html>`__ is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຫົວຈະຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການສະແດງປຸ່ມກັບຄືນ ເມື່ອມີການນຳໃຊ້ `ລຳດັບໜ້າ (page stack) <https://api-"
"docs.ubports.com/sdk/apps/qml/Ubuntu.Components/PageStack.html>`__."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/importing-data.rst:2
msgid "Importing Data"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/importing-data.rst:4
msgid ""
"Interchange of data between apps is done through Content Hub. This improves "
"isolation between apps."
msgstr ""
"ການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງແອັບ ແມ່ນເຮັດຜ່ານ Content Hub. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງການແຍກສ່ວນລະຫວ່າງແອັບ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/importing-data.rst:8
msgid ""
"Apps with the appropriate apparmor permissions can import, export or share "
"data between them."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບທີ່ມີການອະນຸຍາດ AppArmor ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າ, ສົ່ງອອກ ຫຼື ແບ່ງປັນຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງກັນໄດ້."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/importing-data.rst:10
msgid ""
"For more information see `Importing from Content Hub and URLdispatcher`_."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງ `ການນຳເຂົ້າຈາກ Content Hub ແລະ URLdispatcher`_."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/index.rst:2
msgid "App layout"
msgstr "ໂຄງຮ່າງແອັບ (App layout)"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:2
msgid "Main actions"
msgstr "ການກະທຳຫຼັກ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:4
msgid ""
"Main actions are displayed in the corresponding header of the Page. The "
"header should show only relevant actions to the current page."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳຫຼັກ ຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນຫົວທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງໜ້າ. "
"ສ່ວນຫົວຄວນສະແດງສະເພາະການກະທຳທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໜ້າປັດຈຸບັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:6
msgid "Main page of Contacts app shows:"
msgstr "ໜ້າຫຼັກຂອງແອັບຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ສະແດງ:"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:10
msgid "When viewing a single contact, only relevant actions are shown:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເບິ່ງຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ດຽວ, ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະການກະທຳທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ:"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:15
msgid "Slots"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ (Slots)"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:17
msgid ""
"The header contains a number of slots that can hold actions or navigational "
"options. Depending on the surface or window size, additional slots can be "
"added to show the actions otherwise hidden in drawers."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຫົວປະກອບມີຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທີ່ສາມາດບັນຈຸການກະທຳ ຫຼື ຕົວເລືອກການນຳທາງ. ຂຶ້ນກັບພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ ຫຼື "
"ຂະໜາດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ, ສາມາດເພີ່ມຊ່ອງເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອສະແດງການກະທຳ ທີ່ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໃນລິ້ນຊັກ "
"(drawers)."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:22
msgid "Action Drawer"
msgstr "ລິ້ນຊັກການກະທຳ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:24
msgid ""
"Actions will be placed into an action drawer when there are no available "
"slots to house them. However, when your app is on a larger surface, like on "
"a desktop, then actions will appear in the slots."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳຕ່າງໆ ຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນລິ້ນຊັກການກະທຳ ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງຫວ່າງພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະບັນຈຸພວກມັນ. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, "
"ເມື່ອແອັບຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ: ເທິງເດັສທັອບ, ການກະທຳເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນຊ່ອງແທນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:29
msgid "Responsive layout"
msgstr "ໂຄງຮ່າງແບບປັບຂະໜາດຕາມໜ້າຈໍ (Responsive layout)"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:31
msgid ""
"As the header gains width across screen sizes, additional slots become "
"visible and actions in the drawer will appear automatically."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ່ວນຫົວມີຄວາມກວ້າງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຕາມຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ, ຊ່ອງເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ ແລະ "
"ການກະທຳໃນລິ້ນຊັກຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:34
msgid "3 slot layout"
msgstr "ໂຄງຮ່າງແບບ 3 ຊ່ອງ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:41
msgid "4 slot layout"
msgstr "ໂຄງຮ່າງແບບ 4 ຊ່ອງ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:48
msgid "5 slot layout"
msgstr "ໂຄງຮ່າງແບບ 5 ຊ່ອງ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:55
msgid "6 slot layout"
msgstr "ໂຄງຮ່າງແບບ 6 ຊ່ອງ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:62
msgid "Medium to large screens"
msgstr "ໜ້າຈໍຂະໜາດກາງ ຫາ ໃຫຍ່"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:64
msgid ""
"The maximum number of visible action slots in a convergent environment is 6. "
"If this is exceeded then additional actions will migrate to the action "
"drawer."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງການກະທຳທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ສູງສຸດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບ convergent ແມ່ນ 6 ຊ່ອງ. "
"ຖ້າເກີນຈຳນວນນີ້, ການກະທຳເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະຍ້າຍໄປຢູ່ໃນລິ້ນຊັກການກະທຳ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:67
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "ລຽບງ່າຍ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/main-actions.rst:69
msgid "Keep in mind to keep a clean design. The simpler, the better."
msgstr "ຄວນຮັກສາການອອກແບບໃຫ້ສະອາດຕາ. ຍິ່ງລຽບງ່າຍເທົ່າໃດ ກໍ່ຍິ່ງດີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:2
msgid "Presenting data"
msgstr "ການນຳສະເໜີຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:5
msgid "List Items"
msgstr "ລາຍການໃນລາຍຊື່ (List Items)"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:7
msgid ""
"List items can be used to make up a list of ordered scrollable items that "
"are related to each other."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການໃນລາຍຊື່ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍຊື່ຂອງສິ່ງຕ່າງໆທີ່ຈັດລຽງກັນ ແລະ ສາມາດເລື່ອນໄດ້ "
"ເຊິ່ງມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:11
msgid ""
"When images or icons are presented without text or actions, it would make "
"more sense to show them inside a grid rather than a list; like in a photo "
"gallery."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການສະແດງຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ໄອຄອນໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ການກະທຳ, "
"ມັນຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າທີ່ຈະສະແດງພວກມັນໃນຮູບແບບຕາຕະລາງ (grid) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນລາຍຊື່ (list) ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ໃນຄັງຮູບພາບ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:15
msgid ""
"Items in a list can have actions that can be placed in a context menu. The "
"context menu can be accessed in two ways: by swiping or right-clicking the "
"list item."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການໃນລາຍຊື່ ສາມາດມີການກະທຳທີ່ວາງໄວ້ໃນເມນູຄຳສັ່ງ (context menu). "
"ເມນູຄຳສັ່ງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສອງວິທີ: ໂດຍການປັດ (swiping) ຫຼື ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ລາຍການນັ້ນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:17
msgid ""
"The actions are placed within two categories: leading for negative actions "
"and trailing for positive actions."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳຈະຖືກຈັດຢູ່ໃນສອງປະເພດ: ດ້ານໜ້າ (leading) ສຳລັບການກະທຳທາງລົບ ແລະ ດ້ານຫຼັງ "
"(trailing) ສຳລັບການກະທຳທາງບວກ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:20
msgid "Touch swiping"
msgstr "ການປັດໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:27
msgid "Mouse right click"
msgstr "ການຄລິກຂວາດ້ວຍເມົ້າ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:32
msgid "Keyboard navigation"
msgstr "ການນຳທາງດ້ວຍແປ້ນພິມ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:37
msgid "Lists in edit mode"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ໃນໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:39
msgid ""
"Edit mode allows users to modify a particular item or multiple items at once."
msgstr "ໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແກ້ໄຂລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍລາຍການພ້ອມກັນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:41
msgid ""
"You can use edit mode to allow users to multi-select, rearrange or delete "
"items inside a list. When edit mode is entered the whole screen becomes an "
"edit state and the header will show associated editing actions for the "
"content. Alternatively, if the user long presses an item a context menu will "
"show the associated editing actions too."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລືອກຫຼາຍລາຍການ, ຈັດລຽງໃໝ່ ຫຼື ລຶບລາຍການພາຍໃນລາຍຊື່ໄດ້. "
"ເມື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ, ໜ້າຈໍທັງໝົດຈະກາຍເປັນສະຖານະແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ "
"ສ່ວນຫົວຈະສະແດງການກະທຳການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ກົດຄ້າງໄວ້ທີ່ລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງ, "
"ເມນູຄຳສັ່ງກໍ່ຈະສະແດງການກະທຳການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:48
msgid "Layout of detailed list items"
msgstr "ໂຄງຮ່າງຂອງລາຍການແບບລະອຽດ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:52
msgid "1 line – Title"
msgstr "1 ແຖວ – ຫົວຂໍ້"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:54
msgid "1 line – Subtitle"
msgstr "1 ແຖວ – ຫົວຂໍ້ຍ່ອຍ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/presenting-data.rst:56
msgid "2 lines – Summary"
msgstr "2 ແຖວ – ບົດສະຫຼຸບ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/quick-actions.rst:2
msgid "Quick actions"
msgstr "ການກະທຳດ່ວນ"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/quick-actions.rst:4
msgid ""
"The most common action for an app, the one that needs to be accessed quickly "
"might be added as a `bottom edge <https://api-docs.ubports.com/sdk/apps/qml/"
"Ubuntu.Components/BottomEdge.html>`__ action, accessed with a swipe from "
"outside of the screen upwards."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບແອັບ, ອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງຢ່າງໄວວາ ອາດຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນການກະທຳ `ຂອບລຸ່ມ "
"(bottom edge) <https://api-docs.ubports.com/sdk/apps/qml/Ubuntu.Components/"
"BottomEdge.html>`__, ເຊິ່ງເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍການປັດຈາກນອກໜ້າຈໍຂຶ້ນເທິງ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/quick-actions.rst:6
msgid "You can add a new contact in the Contacts app swiping up:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ໃໝ່ໃນແອັບຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ ໄດ້ໂດຍການປັດຂຶ້ນ:"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/quick-actions.rst:11
msgid "Hint"
msgstr "ຄຳໃບ້ (Hint)"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/quick-actions.rst:13
msgid ""
"The hint is used to let the user know that there is something worth trying "
"at the bottom of the screen."
msgstr "ຄຳໃບ້ ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮູ້ວ່າມີບາງສິ່ງທີ່ໜ້າລອງຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/quick-actions.rst:15
msgid "After opening an app, a hint with a text and/or an icon is shown:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດແອັບ, ຄຳໃບ້ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ/ຫຼື ໄອຄອນ ຈະຖືກສະແດງ:"

#: ../../humanguide/app-layout/quick-actions.rst:19
msgid "After after a few seconds it hides and a floating icon is shown"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຜ່ານໄປສອງສາມວິນາທີ ມັນຈະເຊື່ອງໄປ ແລະ ໄອຄອນລອຍຕົວຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:2
msgid "App icon design"
msgstr "ການອອກແບບໄອຄອນແອັບ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:4
msgid ""
"The whole system and apps follow the `Suru design principles <http://"
"web.archive.org/web/20191223082720/https://docs.ubuntu.com/phone/en/apps/"
"design/get-started/design-philosophy>`__ started by Canonical and `Samuel "
"Hewitt <https://samuelhewitt.com>`__."
msgstr ""
"ທັງລະບົບ ແລະ ແອັບແມ່ນປະຕິບັດຕາມ `ຫຼັກການອອກແບບ Suru <http://web.archive.org/web/"
"20191223082720/https://docs.ubuntu.com/phone/en/apps/design/get-started/"
"design-philosophy>`__ ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍ Canonical ແລະ `Samuel Hewitt <https://"
"samuelhewitt.com>`__."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:7
msgid "Design Philosophy and Suru Meaning"
msgstr "ປັດຊະຍາການອອກແບບ ແລະ ຄວາມໝາຍຂອງ Suru"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:9
msgid "Suru alludes to Japanese culture."
msgstr "Suru ໝາຍເຖິງວັດທະນະທຳຍີ່ປຸ່ນ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:10
msgid "The design of Suru is inspired by origami."
msgstr "ການອອກແບບຂອງ Suru ໄດ້ຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈຈາກໂອຣິກາມິ (ສິລະປະການພັບເຈ້ຍ)."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:11
msgid ""
"Paper can be used in two and three dimensional forms, because it is "
"transferable and diverse."
msgstr "ເຈ້ຍສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຮູບແບບສອງ ແລະ ສາມມິຕິໄດ້ ເພາະມັນມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນ ແລະ ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:14
msgid ""
"Suru brings a precise yet organic structure to the Ubuntu Touch interface. "
"The sharp lines and varying levels of transparency evoke the edges and "
"texture of paper."
msgstr ""
"Suru ນຳເອົາໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ຊັດເຈນແຕ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດ ມາສູ່ອິນເຕີເຟດຂອງ Ubuntu Touch. ເສັ້ນທີ່ຄົມຊັດ ແລະ "
"ລະດັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງຂອບ ແລະ ພື້ນຜິວຂອງເຈ້ຍ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:17
msgid "Design Tips for an App Icon"
msgstr "ເຄັດລັບການອອກແບບສຳລັບໄອຄອນແອັບ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:20
msgid "Descriptive design"
msgstr "ການອອກແບບທີ່ສື່ຄວາມໝາຍ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:22
msgid ""
"The icon you choose for your app should describe what your app is about, "
"what it does, or what service it is there for in a recognizable way."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກສຳລັບແອັບ ຄວນອະທິບາຍວ່າແອັບຂອງທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບຫຍັງ, ມັນເຮັດຫຍັງ, ຫຼື ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຫຍັງ "
"ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ສາມາດຈົດຈຳໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:27
msgid "Distinctive shapes"
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:29
msgid ""
"Depending on the object you choose to show in the icon, on the perspective, "
"lighting and other factors, it might be hard to recognize what you are "
"trying to depict. A TV might look like a box, or a computer screen, a remote "
"control like a phone, etc."
msgstr ""
"ຂຶ້ນກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກສະແດງໃນໄອຄອນ, ມຸມມອງ, ແສງ ແລະ ປັດໄຈອື່ນໆ, "
"ມັນອາດຈະຍາກທີ່ຈະຮັບຮູ້ວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງສື່ເຖິງຫຍັງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂທລະພາບອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືກັບກ່ອງ ຫຼື ໜ້າຈໍຄອມພິວເຕີ, "
"ຣີໂໝດອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືກັບໂທລະສັບ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:34
msgid "Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:36
msgid ""
"A detailed icon is very nice to look at as it shows quality and your eye for "
"the small things. It might add confusion though, especially in smaller sizes "
"or for people who have impaired eyesight. Show what's necessary, pay "
"attention to detail, but don't overload the icon."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດຈະສວຍງາມໜ້າເບິ່ງ ເພາະມັນສະແດງເຖິງຄຸນນະພາບ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມໃສ່ໃຈຂອງທ່ານຕໍ່ສິ່ງເລັກນ້ອຍ. ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມສັບສົນໄດ້ ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ຫຼື "
"ສຳລັບຄົນທີ່ມີບັນຫາທາງສາຍຕາ. ສະນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ສະແດງສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ໃສ່ໃຈໃນລາຍລະອຽດ, "
"ແຕ່ຢ່າໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນໄອຄອນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:41
msgid "Colours"
msgstr "ສີ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:43
msgid ""
"Use distinctive colours, make your icon stand out a bit and give the shapes "
"enough contrast to be visible."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສີທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄອຄອນເດັ່ນຂຶ້ນເລັກນ້ອຍ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຮູບຮ່າງມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast) "
"ພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:48
msgid "Gradients"
msgstr "ການໄລ່ສີ (Gradients)"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:50
msgid ""
"If you were to add a gradient to your icon, only use colours that are "
"slightly different from each other so that the change is not too dramatic. "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມການໄລ່ສີໃຫ້ກັບໄອຄອນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ສີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເລັກນ້ອຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງນັ້ນເບິ່ງຮຸນແຮງເກີນໄປ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:55
msgid "Composition"
msgstr "ອົງປະກອບ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:57
msgid ""
"Suru icons are composed of simple geometric shapes. The background is "
"usually a coloured surface with the pictogram, also composed of flat shapes, "
"“floating” above it."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນ Suru ແມ່ນປະກອບດ້ວຍຮູບຮ່າງເລຂາຄະນິດທີ່ງ່າຍດາຍ. ພື້ນຫຼັງມັກຈະເປັນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີສີ ພ້ອມກັບຮູບສັນຍາລັກ "
"(pictogram) ເຊິ່ງກໍ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຮູບຮ່າງແປ, “ລອຍ” ຢູ່ເໜືອມັນ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:64
msgid "The Fold Effect"
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກຮອຍພັບ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:66
msgid ""
"In keeping with the origami motif, some Suru icons have an implied fold. In "
"many icons this is a single horizontal or vertical line but sometimes the "
"fold line(s) correspond or align with elements of the pictogram."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮັກສາຮູບແບບໂອຣິກາມິ, ໄອຄອນ Suru ບາງອັນຈະມີຮອຍພັບແຝງຢູ່. ໃນຫຼາຍໄອຄອນ "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນເສັ້ນດຽວທາງນອນ ຫຼື ທາງຕັ້ງ ແຕ່ບາງຄັ້ງເສັ້ນພັບກໍ່ຈະສອດຄ່ອງ ຫຼື ຈັດລຽງກັບອົງປະກອບຂອງຮູບສັນຍາລັກ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:68
msgid ""
"The fold is drawn by creating an overlay of a white or black polygon of very "
"low opacity (usually between 1%~10%)."
msgstr ""
"ຮອຍພັບຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍການສ້າງຮູບຫຼາຍແຈສີຂາວ ຫຼື ສີດຳ ທີ່ມີຄວາມທຶບແສງ (opacity) ຕໍ່າຫຼາຍ "
"(ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນລະຫວ່າງ 1%~10%) ມາທັບຊ້ອນກັນ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:75
msgid "Grids"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງ (Grids)"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:77
msgid ""
"Using a grid layout ensures consistency across all icons and will force you "
"to reserve area for the icon background for even padding around the "
"pictogram."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳໃຊ້ໂຄງຮ່າງແບບຕາຕະລາງ ຈະຊ່ວຍຮັບປະກັນຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງໃນທຸກໄອຄອນ ແລະ "
"ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ທ່ານຕ້ອງຈອງພື້ນທີ່ ສຳລັບພື້ນຫຼັງໄອຄອນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີໄລຍະຫ່າງ (padding) "
"ທີ່ສະເໝີກັນອ້ອມຮອບຮູບສັນຍາລັກ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:81
msgid ""
"Note that the circular elements are slightly larger than rectangular "
"elements of the grid, this overshoot is needed to compensate for the optical "
"illusion where circular objects appear smaller than rectangular objects of "
"the same dimensions."
msgstr ""
"ຈົ່ງສັງເກດວ່າ ອົງປະກອບວົງມົນຈະໃຫຍ່ກວ່າອົງປະກອບສີ່ແຈສາກຂອງຕາຕະລາງເລັກນ້ອຍ, ສ່ວນເກີນນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ "
"ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍພາບລວງຕາ ທີ່ວັດຖຸວົງມົນຈະປະກົດວ່ານ້ອຍກວ່າວັດຖຸສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ມີຂະໜາດດຽວກັນ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:84
msgid "Unit Grid"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງໜ່ວຍ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:86
msgid ""
"Designing with an overall pixel grid in mind is crucial to having crisp, "
"clean icons. Since most desktop icons have dimensions that are a factor of "
"four (16x16, 24x24, 32x32, 48x48, 256x256) using a pixel grid with lines "
"every 4 pixels and drawing to that grid is the best practice."
msgstr ""
"ການອອກແບບໂດຍຄຳນຶງເຖິງຕາຕະລາງພິກເຊວໂດຍລວມ ແມ່ນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ໄອຄອນທີ່ຄົມຊັດ ແລະ ສະອາດ. "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກໄອຄອນເດັສທັອບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີຂະໜາດທີ່ເປັນຕົວຄູນຂອງສີ່ (16x16, 24x24, 32x32, 48x48, "
"256x256) ການນຳໃຊ້ຕາຕະລາງພິກເຊວທີ່ມີເສັ້ນທຸກໆ 4 ພິກເຊວ ແລະ "
"ແຕ້ມຕາມຕາຕະລາງນັ້ນແມ່ນວິທີການທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:89
msgid "Shadows"
msgstr "ເງົາ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:91
msgid ""
"Often a Suru icon is drawn with two distinct sets of shadows, one for the "
"pictogram to create a drop shadow effect, and a second below the overall "
"icon shape."
msgstr ""
"ເລື້ອຍໆທີ່ໄອຄອນ Suru ຈະຖືກແຕ້ມດ້ວຍເງົາສອງຊຸດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, "
"ຊຸດໜຶ່ງສຳລັບຮູບສັນຍາລັກເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກເງົາຕົກກະທົບ, ແລະ ຊຸດທີສອງຢູ່ລຸ່ມຮູບຮ່າງໄອຄອນໂດຍລວມ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:93
msgid ""
"The drop shadow effect on the central pictogram is a combination of two "
"shadow that are identical in shape to the pictogram:"
msgstr "ເອັບເຟັກເງົາຕົກກະທົບໃສ່ຮູບສັນຍາລັກກາງ ແມ່ນການລວມກັນຂອງສອງເງົາທີ່ມີຮູບຮ່າງຄືກັນກັບຮູບສັນຍາລັກ:"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:95
msgid ""
"a shape that is rgba(0,0,0,0.1) with vertical offset of 2 pixels and a blur "
"of 1%"
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ເປັນ rgba(0,0,0,0.1) ທີ່ມີໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ 2 ພິກເຊວ ແລະ ຄວາມມົວ 1%"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:96
msgid ""
"a shape that is rgba(0,0,0,0.4) with vertical offset of 4 pixels and a blur "
"of 10%"
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ເປັນ rgba(0,0,0,0.4) ທີ່ມີໄລຍະຫ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ 4 ພິກເຊວ ແລະ ຄວາມມົວ 10%"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:100
msgid ""
"If the fold effect is present, the second shadow is drawn using a linear "
"gradient with three stops whose positions correspond to the location of the "
"background fold."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີເອັບເຟັກຮອຍພັບ, ເງົາທີສອງຈະຖືກແຕ້ມໂດຍໃຊ້ການໄລ່ສີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear gradient) ທີ່ມີສາມຈຸດຢຸດ "
"ເຊິ່ງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນຈະກົງກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮອຍພັບພື້ນຫຼັງ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:103
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "ໄຮໄລ້ (Highlights)"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:105
msgid ""
"Pictograms have an ever~so~slight (1 pixel) white highlight along the top "
"edge of them. To do this, make 2 solid white copies of the main pictogram "
"shape and move one copy 1 pixel down and 'difference' the two so what's left "
"is an 'edge' that you can align to the top of the pictogram. Repeat as "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບສັນຍາລັກຈະມີໄຮໄລ້ສີຂາວບາງໆ (1 ພິກເຊວ) ຕາມຂອບດ້ານເທິງຂອງພວກມັນ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, "
"ໃຫ້ສ້າງສຳເນົາສີຂາວທຶບ 2 ອັນ ຂອງຮູບຮ່າງສັນຍາລັກຫຼັກ ແລະ ຍ້າຍສຳເນົາໜຶ່ງລົງລຸ່ມ 1 ພິກເຊວ ແລ້ວທຳການ "
"'difference' ທັງສອງ ສິ່ງທີ່ເຫຼືອແມ່ນ 'ຂອບ' ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດລຽງໃສ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງຮູບສັນຍາລັກໄດ້. "
"ໃຫ້ເຮັດຊ້ຳຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:109
msgid ""
"Depending on the colour of your pictogram element, you can vary the opacity "
"of your highlight. For instance, if it is using bright, primary colours, "
"there isn't any need for a highlight."
msgstr ""
"ຂຶ້ນກັບສີຂອງອົງປະກອບຮູບສັນຍາລັກຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງໄຮໄລ້ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຖ້າມັນໃຊ້ສີທີ່ແຈ້ງ ຫຼື ສີພື້ນຖານ, ກໍ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໄຮໄລ້."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/app-icon-design.rst:111
msgid ""
"Grids and other resources can be found in this `gitlab repository <https://"
"gitlab.com/cibersheep/ubuntu-icon-resource-kit>`__."
msgstr ""
"ຕາຕະລາງ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນອື່ນໆ ສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ `ບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ GitLab ນີ້ <https://"
"gitlab.com/cibersheep/ubuntu-icon-resource-kit>`__."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:2
msgid "In-app icons design"
msgstr "ການອອກແບບໄອຄອນພາຍໃນແອັບ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:5
msgid "Interface Icons"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Interface Icons)"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:7
msgid ""
"Interface icons communicate either status or action displays, such as "
"battery level or an alarm, whilst also enabling the user to perform actions "
"like opening a menu, sharing content or print a document. The interface "
"icons are located in the top bar or in-app icons, such as in the Header or "
"the menus."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ໃຊ້ສື່ສານສະຖານະ ຫຼື ການສະແດງຜົນການກະທຳ ເຊັ່ນ: ລະດັບແບັດເຕີຣີ ຫຼື ໂມງປຸກ, "
"ໃນຂະນະດຽວກັນກໍ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕ່າງໆໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ: ການເປີດເມນູ, ແບ່ງປັນເນື້ອຫາ ຫຼື "
"ພິມເອກະສານ. ໄອຄອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນແຖບດ້ານເທິງ ຫຼື ເປັນໄອຄອນພາຍໃນແອັບ ເຊັ່ນ: ໃນສ່ວນຫົວ ຫຼື ເມນູ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:9
msgid ""
"|stock_message.svg| |share.svg| |stock_alarm-clock.svg| |security-alert.svg| "
"|settings.svg|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:82
msgid "stock_message.svg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:83
msgid "share.svg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:84
msgid "stock_alarm-clock.svg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:85
msgid "security-alert.svg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:86
msgid "settings.svg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:12
msgid ""
"See a `list of the icons <http://docs.ubports.com/projects/icons/>`__. "
"available in the system."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ `ລາຍຊື່ໄອຄອນ <http://docs.ubports.com/projects/icons/>`__. ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:15
msgid "Color"
msgstr "ສີ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:17
msgid ""
"Interface icons can be colourized in qml therefore are designed in #808080 "
"color."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ສາມາດກຳນົດສີໄດ້ໃນ QML ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຖືກອອກແບບໂດຍໃຊ້ສີ #808080."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:20
msgid "Font"
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນ (Font)"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:22
msgid ""
"To provide a consistent look to the UI and to make the Suru icons "
"distinctive, the design is based on the same patterns as the Ubuntu font. "
"The font patterns can applied to the symbol to define its contours."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ UI ມີລັກສະນະທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄອຄອນ Suru ມີຄວາມໂດດເດັ່ນ, "
"ການອອກແບບຈຶ່ງອີງໃສ່ຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບຕົວອັກສອນ Ubuntu. "
"ຮູບແບບຂອງຕົວອັກສອນສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ກັບສັນຍາລັກເພື່ອກຳນົດເສັ້ນຂອບຂອງມັນ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:29
msgid "Strokes"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນຂີດ (Strokes)"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:31
msgid ""
"Stroke ends are squared but the upper end of vertical strokes is slightly "
"oblique with a +10º angle."
msgstr "ປາຍເສັ້ນຂີດຈະເປັນຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ ແຕ່ປາຍດ້ານເທິງຂອງເສັ້ນຂີດຕັ້ງຈະອຽງເລັກນ້ອຍດ້ວຍມຸມ +10 ອົງສາ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:38
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "ການໝຸນ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:40
msgid ""
"When they are not horizontal or vertical, objects are oriented along a +45º "
"axis."
msgstr "ເມື່ອວັດຖຸບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນແນວນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຈັດວາງຕາມແກນ +45 ອົງສາ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:47
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "ມຸມ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:49
msgid ""
"Curved corners are preferred if possible. The following picture shows a zoom "
"on the default outer and inner curvatures, with nodes and Bezier handle. The "
"default curvature can be scaled down when the shape is smaller."
msgstr ""
"ມັກນຳໃຊ້ລ່ຽມມົນຫຼາຍກວ່າຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້. ຮູບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງການຊູມຄວາມໂຄ້ງພາຍນອກ ແລະ ພາຍໃນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ພ້ອມກັບຈຸດ (nodes) ແລະ Bezier handle. "
"ຄວາມໂຄ້ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດລົງໄດ້ເມື່ອຮູບຮ່າງນັ້ນນ້ອຍລົງ."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:56
msgid "Arrows"
msgstr "ລູກສອນ"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:58
msgid ""
"A chevron symbol is used for navigation arrows. The arrowhead is an "
"isosceles triangle where the two equal sides are slightly curved (following "
"the pattern of the Y character)."
msgstr ""
"ສັນຍາລັກ Chevron ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບລູກສອນນຳທາງ. ຫົວລູກສອນແມ່ນຮູບສາມແຈທ່ຽງ "
"ເຊິ່ງສອງດ້ານທີ່ເທົ່າກັນນັ້ນຈະມີຄວາມໂຄ້ງເລັກນ້ອຍ (ຕາມຮູບແບບຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ Y)."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:65
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "ຄວາມທຶບແສງ (Opacity)"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:67
msgid ""
"50% opacity is used to reflect the status of an indicator. In case of a "
"double space (enabled and disabled, for example), the opacity of the whole "
"icon changes. When the status allows a range of values, the opacity of a "
"single portion of icon can be altered."
msgstr ""
