msgid ""
"Apps should be accessible using any combination of mouse, touch, and "
"keyboard."
msgstr "ແອັບຄວນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ການປະສົມປະສານໃດໆຂອງເມົ້າ, ການສຳຜັດ, ແລະ ແປ້ນພິມ."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/convergence.rst:2
msgid "Convergence"
msgstr "Convergence"

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/convergence.rst:6
msgid ""
"Convergence is one of the milestones Ubuntu Touch wants to achieve. One app "
"available across all screen sizes and input methods, such as mobile "
"handsets, tablets, and laptops."
msgstr ""
"Convergence ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນຈຸດໝາຍທີ່ Ubuntu Touch ຕ້ອງການບັນລຸ. ແອັບດຽວທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນທຸກຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ "
"ວິທີການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ, ເຊັ່ນ: ໂທລະສັບມືຖື, ແທັບເລັດ, ແລະ ແລັບທັອບ."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/convergence.rst:8
msgid ""
"Convergence refers to the ability to use the same code base across multiple "
"hardware form factors. Multiple devices using the same code base allows for "
"features to be developed once, then shipped on multiple device types. This "
"reducing development time and cost. The goal is for Ubuntu Touch to provide "
"a consistent experience, whether you are using it on a big screen with mouse "
"and keyboard or on a small touchscreen."
msgstr ""
"Convergence ໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໃຊ້ພື້ນຖານໂຄ້ດດຽວກັນໃນຫຼາຍຮູບແບບຮາດແວ. "
"ອຸປະກອນຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງທີ່ໃຊ້ພື້ນຖານໂຄ້ດດຽວກັນ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດພັດທະນາຟີເຈີຄັ້ງດຽວ, "
"ແລ້ວສົ່ງໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນຫຼາຍປະເພດໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນເວລາ ແລະ ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການພັດທະນາ. "
"ເປົ້າໝາຍແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ Ubuntu Touch ມອບປະສົບການທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ, ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ມັນໃນໜ້າຈໍໃຫຍ່ດ້ວຍເມົ້າ "
"ແລະ ແປ້ນພິມ ຫຼື ໃນໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/convergence.rst:11
msgid "Screen size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ"

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/convergence.rst:15
msgid "Ubuntu Touch Tweak Tool app"
msgstr "ແອັບເຄື່ອງມືປັບແຕ່ງ Ubuntu Touch"

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/convergence.rst:17
msgid ""
"Main page stays as the main page on phones or on the left on bigger screen "
"devices. Additional pages on the phone, can be displayed at variable sizes "
"on the right on bigger screens."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຫຼັກຍັງຄົງເປັນໜ້າຫຼັກໃນໂທລະສັບ ຫຼື ຢູ່ທາງຊ້າຍໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີໜ້າຈໍໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ. ໜ້າເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນໂທລະສັບ, "
"ສາມາດສະແດງໃນຂະໜາດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຢູ່ທາງຂວາໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/convergence.rst:20
msgid "Input method"
msgstr "ວິທີການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/convergence.rst:22
msgid ""
"Using touch, a user can swipe or long-press on a list item to reveal a "
"contextual menu. Using a pointer (mouse or trackpad) a user can right-click "
"the item to reveal the contextual menu. Using a keyboard a user can focus "
"the desired item and press the MENU key to open the context menu."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ການສຳຜັດ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປັດ ຫຼື ກົດຄ້າງໄວ້ທີ່ລາຍການເພື່ອເປີດເມນູຄຳສັ່ງ. ການໃຊ້ຕົວຊີ້ (ເມົ້າ ຫຼື "
"trackpad) ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ລາຍການເພື່ອເປີດເມນູຄຳສັ່ງ. ການໃຊ້ແປ້ນພິມ "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດໂຟກັສໃສ່ລາຍການທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ MENU ເພື່ອເປີດເມນູຄຳສັ່ງ."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/index.rst:2
msgid "Other design considerations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ພິຈາລະນາການອອກແບບອື່ນໆ"

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/index.rst:13
msgid "`Suru Icons <http://docs.ubports.com/projects/icons/en/latest/>`__"
msgstr "`ໄອຄອນ Suru <http://docs.ubports.com/projects/icons/en/latest/>`__"

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/scaling-images.rst:2
msgid "Scaling images"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດຮູບພາບ"

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/scaling-images.rst:4
msgid ""
"Scaling images is important in a convergent app. App icons and images can be "
"created in scalable formats to improve their ability to scale."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບຂະໜາດຮູບພາບແມ່ນສຳຄັນໃນແອັບແບບ convergent. ໄອຄອນແອັບ ແລະ "
"ຮູບພາບສາມາດສ້າງໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຂະຫຍາຍຂອງພວກມັນ."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/scaling-images.rst:9
msgid ""
"One of the most popular scalable formats is `SVG <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Scalable_Vector_Graphics>`__. SVG files can be created using software "
"like `Inkscape <https://inkscape.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"ໜຶ່ງໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ທີ່ນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ `SVG <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Scalable_Vector_Graphics>`__. ໄຟລ໌ SVG ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊອບແວເຊັ່ນ `Inkscape "
"<https://inkscape.org/>`__."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/scaling-images.rst:11
msgid ""
"One particularity of qml, though, is that SVGs are rendered to use less "
"memory, losing the advantages of scalability. When using a SVG file in an "
"``Image`` element we can use the property called ``sourceSize``. This will "
"define the rendered size of the SVG image. A SVG image with a ``sourceSize`` "
"width and height of 252 pixels, will be rendered as if the scalable image "
"would be a png of 252 per 252 pixels."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຈຸດພິເສດໜຶ່ງຂອງ qml ແມ່ນວ່າ SVGs ຖືກສະແດງຜົນ (render) "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໜ້ອຍລົງ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເສຍປະໂຫຍດຂອງການປັບຂະໜາດ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ SVG ໃນອົງປະກອບ "
"``Image`` ພວກເຮົາສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ ``sourceSize``. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກຳນົດຂະໜາດການສະແດງຜົນຂອງຮູບພາບ SVG. ຮູບພາບ SVG ທີ່ມີຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງ "
"``sourceSize`` 252 ພິກເຊວ, ຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນຄືກັບວ່າຮູບພາບທີ່ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ນັ້ນເປັນ png ຂະໜາດ 252 "
"ຕໍ່ 252 ພິກເຊວ."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/scaling-images.rst:16
msgid "Different rendered sizes of the same svg image"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຂອງຮູບພາບ svg ດຽວກັນ"

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/scaling-images.rst:18
msgid ""
"It is not advisable to define ``sourceSize`` as a relative size to avoid "
"performance issues. A good practice is defining ``sourceSize`` based on a "
"set list of thresholds. In the example below the image.svg will be rendered "
"60 per 60 grid units if the main view is bigger that 70 grid units but as an "
"image of 40 per 40 grid units in the other cases. By defining these "
"thresholds, we get scalable images without a huge performance cost."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ກຳນົດ ``sourceSize`` ເປັນຂະໜາດສຳພັດ (relative size) "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາປະສິດທິພາບ. ວິທີປະຕິບັດທີ່ດີແມ່ນການກຳນົດ ``sourceSize`` "
"ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ລາຍການເກນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ image.svg ຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນ 60 ຕໍ່ 60 grid "
"units ຖ້າໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 70 grid units ແຕ່ຈະເປັນຮູບພາບຂະໜາດ 40 ຕໍ່ 40 grid units "
"ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນໆ. ໂດຍການກຳນົດເກນເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະໄດ້ຮູບພາບທີ່ປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເສຍປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍ."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/scaling-images.rst:28
msgid ""
"Read more about image performance in the `Qt wiki <https://wiki.qt.io/"
"Performance_tip_Images>`__."
msgstr ""
"ອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽັບປະສິດທິພາບຂອງຮູບພາບໃນ `Qt wiki <https://wiki.qt.io/"
"Performance_tip_Images>`__."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/translations.rst:4
msgid ""
"Adding translations to your app makes it more accessible to international "
"users. `Clickable <http://clickable.bhdouglass.com/>`__ will handle this "
"process automatically, extracting new translatable strings into a pot file "
"(the source strings of your app, to be translated)."
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມການແປພາສາໃສ່ແອັບຂອງທ່ານເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາກົນເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. `Clickable <http://"
"clickable.bhdouglass.com/>`__ ຈະຈັດການຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍການດຶງສະຕຣິງ "
"(strings) ທີ່ແປໄດ້ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄຟລ໌ pot (ສະຕຣິງຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງແອັບຂອງທ່ານ, ທີ່ຈະຖືກແປ)."

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/translations.rst:6
msgid ""
"Marking a string to be translatable can be achieved like this "
"i18n.tr(string). For example:"
msgstr "ການໝາຍສະຕຣິງໃຫ້ເປັນອັນທີ່ແປໄດ້ ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້ i18n.tr(string). ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../humanguide/other-design-considerations/translations.rst:14
msgid ""
"More information and options can be found in this a bit outdated `tutorial "
"on localization <http://web.archive.org/web/https://docs.ubuntu.com/phone/en/"
"apps/qml/tutorials-internationalizing-your-app>`__ an app."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ `ບົດສອນກ່ຽວກັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (localization) "
"<http://web.archive.org/web/https://docs.ubuntu.com/phone/en/apps/qml/"
"tutorials-internationalizing-your-app>`__ ຂອງແອັບ."

