#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/index.rst:28
msgid "Full system image method"
msgstr "ວິທີ Full system image"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/index.rst:29
msgid "Halium boot method"
msgstr "ວິທີ Halium boot"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/index.rst:30
msgid "Standalone kernel method"
msgstr "ວິທີ Standalone kernel"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/index.rst:32
msgid ""
"For modern devices, this is much simplified. Full system was only really "
"applicable on Halium 7.1 and 9.0 and Halium-boot worked on Halium 9.0. "
"Nowadays there is just The One method that's described in this porting guide "
"and what used to be called \"Standalone method\". If you are interested in "
"the historic details feel free to read about the good ol' ways `in the git "
"history. <https://gitlab.com/ubports/docs/docs.ubports.com/-/tree/porting-in-"
"three-methods>`_"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສະໄໝໃໝ່, ນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ. Full system ໃຊ້ໄດ້ແທ້ໆກັບ Halium 7.1 ແລະ "
"9.0 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ Halium-boot ເຮັດວຽກໃນ Halium 9.0. ປັດຈຸບັນນີ້ມີພຽງແຕ່ ວິທີດຽວ "
"ທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນຄູ່ມືການພອດນີ້ ແລະ ສິ່ງທີ່ເຄີຍເອີ້ນວ່າ \"Standalone method\". "
"ຖ້າທ່ານສົນໃຈລາຍລະອຽດທາງປະຫວັດສາດ ສາມາດອ່ານກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເກົ່າແກ່ `ໃນປະຫວັດ git. <https://"
"gitlab.com/ubports/docs/docs.ubports.com/-/tree/porting-in-three-methods>`_"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:4
#: ../../systemdev/kernel-pinephone.rst:40
msgid "Building the kernel"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ kernel"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:6
msgid ""
"This section explains how to set up the device source, configure the "
"deviceinfo and kernel, and build it. This guide expects you to have some "
"mandatory git knowledge, like cloning and pushing, and creating repos."
msgstr ""
"ພາກນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ device source, ກຳນົດຄ່າ deviceinfo ແລະ kernel, ແລະ ສ້າງມັນ. "
"ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຄາດຫວັງວ່າທ່ານຈະມີຄວາມຮູ້ git ທີ່ຈຳເປັນບາງຢ່າງ, ເຊັ່ນ: cloning ແລະ pushing, ແລະ "
"ການສ້າງ repos."

