#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:27
msgid ""
"Some older kernels may require Python 2 to build. If your distribution has "
"deprecated Python 2, you may need to install it manually."
msgstr ""
"Kernel ເກົ່າບາງອັນອາດຈະຕ້ອງການ Python 2 ໃນການສ້າງ. ຖ້າ distribution ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ເລີກໃຊ້ "
"Python 2 ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:30
msgid "Setting up and configuring a device source"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ device source"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:33
msgid "Creating the device source"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ device source"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:35
msgid ""
"Clone an existing device repository from https://gitlab.com/ubports/porting. "
"Ideally choose a device with similar SoC/Android version as base."
msgstr ""
"Clone repository ອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈາກ https://gitlab.com/ubports/porting. "
"ທາງທີ່ດີຄວນເລືອກອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີ SoC/Android version ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນເປັນພື້ນຖານ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:37
msgid ""
"Make sure to get the device repository, not the kernel repository (you will "
"get that in the next step). For example, for the Fairphone 3, the "
"repositories are called ``fairphone-fp3`` and "
"``android_kernel_fairphone_sdm632.`` The first one is the one you want."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ repository ຂອງອຸປະກອນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນ repository ຂອງ kernel "
"(ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບມັນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ). ຕົວຢ່າງ, ສຳລັບ Fairphone 3, repository ເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"``fairphone-fp3`` ແລະ ``android_kernel_fairphone_sdm632.`` "
"ອັນທຳອິດຄືອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:39
msgid ""
"deviceinfo contains the configuration used during device build process "
"(kernel, boot, dtb/dtbo if needed + recovery on later porting stages). To "
"craft your own deviceinfo, follow the guide further."
msgstr ""
"deviceinfo ບັນຈຸການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການສ້າງອຸປະກອນ (kernel, boot, dtb/dtbo "
"ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ + recovery ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການພອດພາຍຫຼັງ). ເພື່ອສ້າງ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານເອງ, "
"ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄູ່ມືຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:42
msgid "Getting device kernel source code"
msgstr "ການເອົາ source code ຂອງ device kernel"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:44
msgid ""
"First thing to check is if  your device has an official or unofficial "
"LineageOS port, as the porter may have already done the cleaning up bits "
"needed for the device vendor kernel sources or incorporated out-of-tree "
"kernel modules back into kernel tree, which makes life easier for us."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງທຳອິດທີ່ຕ້ອງກວດສອບຄືອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານມີການພອດ LineageOS ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ ຫຼື ບໍ່ເປັນທາງການຫຼືບໍ່, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກນັກພອດອາດຈະໄດ້ທຳຄວາມສະອາດສ່ວນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ kernel sources ຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດອຸປະກອນ ຫຼື "
"ລວມ module kernel ແບບ out-of-tree ກັບຄືນເຂົ້າໃນ kernel tree ແລ້ວ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຊີວິດງ່າຍຂຶ້ນສຳລັບພວກເຮົາ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:46
msgid ""
"If not, check if device manufacturer provides kernel source at all: ASUS, "
"Lenovo, Samsung, ZTE usually provide kernel source code tarballs at their "
"website. Motorola, Realme, OnePlus, Xiaomi usually upload kernel source to "
"their official GitHub account."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າຜູ້ຜະລິດອຸປະກອນໃຫ້ kernel source ມາຫຼືບໍ່: ASUS, Lenovo, Samsung, ZTE "
"ມັກຈະໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ tarball ຂອງ kernel source ໃນເວັບໄຊທ໌ຂອງພວກເຂົາ. Motorola, Realme, "
"OnePlus, Xiaomi ມັກຈະອັບໂຫລດ kernel source ໄປທີ່ບັນຊີ GitHub ທາງການຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:50
msgid ""
"After you have acquired the kernel source, you need to upload it somewhere "
"else for making modifications and commits for Ubuntu Touch. GitLab is "
"preferred since when you'll get the port pulled into the UBports org, it can "
"be easily copied from there."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ kernel source ມາແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງອັບໂຫລດມັນໄປບ່ອນອື່ນເພື່ອທຳການດັດແກ້ ແລະ "
"commits ສຳລັບ Ubuntu Touch. GitLab ເປັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກເມື່ອການພອດຂອງທ່ານຖືກດຶງເຂົ້າໄປໃນອົງກອນ UBports, "
"ມັນສາມາດຖືກສຳເນົາຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:52
msgid ""
"You should now be working with two repositories: a cloned device repo, which "
"holds deviceinfo, and a kernel repo, which holds/will hold your defconfig "
"(see below)."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຄວນຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບສອງ repositories: device repo ທີ່ clone ມາ, ເຊິ່ງເກັບ "
"deviceinfo, ແລະ kernel repo, ເຊິ່ງເກັບ/ຈະເກັບ defconfig ຂອງທ່ານ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ)."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:55
msgid "Finding your correct kernel config"
msgstr "ການຊອກຫາ kernel config ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:57
msgid ""
"There are two ways to find your correct kernel config, naming some below: 1. "
"Getting your config on device from /proc/config.gz 2. Getting your defconfig "
"in kernel source"
msgstr ""
"ມີສອງວິທີໃນການຊອກຫາ kernel config ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງທ່ານ, ດັ່ງນີ້: 1. ເອົາ config "
"ຂອງທ່ານຈາກອຸປະກອນ ຈາກ /proc/config.gz 2. ເອົາ defconfig ຂອງທ່ານໃນ kernel source"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:62
msgid "Getting your config from device"
msgstr "ການເອົາ config ຂອງທ່ານຈາກອຸປະກອນ"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:64
msgid ""
"It is possible to pull your current kernel config from device, if the "
"configuration is present as ``/proc/config.gz`` on device. To pull this "
"config, copy the ``/proc/config.gz`` file from your device to your computer. "
"Then, run ``zcat`` on the file to get its output. Save this as ``.config`` "
"in your kernel source. After this, run ``ARCH=<your device's architecture> "
"make savedefconfig``, which will convert your fully fledged config into a "
"defconfig. Copy ``defconfig`` to ``arch/<your device's architecture>/configs/"
"<your device's codename_defconfig``."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະດຶງ kernel config ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານຈາກອຸປະກອນ, ຖ້າການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນມີຢູ່ເປັນ ``/proc/"
"config.gz`` ໃນອຸປະກອນ. ເພື່ອດຶງ config ນີ້, ໃຫ້ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ ``/proc/config.gz`` "
"ຈາກອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານໄປທີ່ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ. ຈາກນັ້ນ, run ``zcat`` ໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເອົາຜົນລັພຂອງມັນ. "
"ບັນທຶກອັນນີ້ເປັນ ``.config`` ໃນ kernel source ຂອງທ່ານ. ຫຼັງຈາກນີ້, run "
"``ARCH=<ສັດຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງອຸປະກອນທ່ານ> make savedefconfig``, ເຊິ່ງຈະປ່ຽນ config "
"ເຕັມຮູບແບບຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນ defconfig. ສຳເນົາ ``defconfig`` ໄປທີ່ ``arch/"
"<ສັດຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງອຸປະກອນທ່ານ>/configs/<codename ຂອງອຸປະກອນທ່ານ>_defconfig``."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:69
msgid "Proceed with the guide to patch your config."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ກັບຄູ່ມືເພື່ອ patch config ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:72
msgid "Getting your defconfig in kernel source"
msgstr "ການເອົາ defconfig ຂອງທ່ານໃນ kernel source"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:74
msgid ""
"In order to find your defconfig from kernel source, you will have to search "
"for it in the ``arch/<your device's architecture/configs`` directory. This "
"defconfig can be named in numerous ways, like ``<your device's "
"codename>_defconfig``, or something weird like ``k61v64_debug_defconfig``. "
"If you got your kernel source from an OEM, sometimes it includes a "
"``build.sh`` script which references the defconfig required. Otherwise if "
"you got your kernel source from somewhere like LineageOS, their device "
"tree's reference the defconfig too."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຊອກຫາ defconfig ຂອງທ່ານຈາກ kernel source, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຊອກຫາມັນໃນໄດເລກະທໍລີ ``arch/"
"<ສັດຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງອຸປະກອນທ່ານ/configs``. defconfig ນີ້ສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ໄດ້ຫຼາຍແບບ, ເຊັ່ນ "
"``<codename ຂອງອຸປະກອນທ່ານ>_defconfig``, ຫຼື ຊື່ແປກໆ ເຊັ່ນ "
"``k61v64_debug_defconfig``. ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ kernel source ມາຈາກ OEM, "
"ບາງຄັ້ງມັນຈະລວມມີສະຄຣິບ ``build.sh`` ເຊິ່ງອ້າງອີງເຖິງ defconfig ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ kernel source ມາຈາກບ່ອນອື່ນ ເຊັ່ນ LineageOS, device tree "
"ຂອງພວກເຂົາກໍ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ defconfig ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:79
msgid "After finding your defconfig, proceed with the guide to patch it."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຊອກຫາ defconfig ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ກັບຄູ່ມືເພື່ອ patch ມັນ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:83
msgid "Applying minimal patches to your defconfig"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ patch ຂັ້ນຕ່ຳໃສ່ defconfig ຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:85
msgid ""
"In order for Ubuntu Touch to successfully boot, we need to enable some "
"configs required by the OS. Start by browsing into your kernel directory, "
"and into the ``arch/<your device's architecture>/configs``, where you will "
"have to add a new file called ``halium.config``. In this file, add the "
"following content:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Ubuntu Touch ສາມາດບູດໄດ້ສຳເລັດ, ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ configs ບາງອັນທີ່ OS "
"ຕ້ອງການ. ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄດເລກະທໍລີ kernel ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ ``arch/"
"<ສັດຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງອຸປະກອນທ່ານ>/configs``, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ "
"``halium.config``. ໃນໄຟລ໌ນີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເນື້ອຫາຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:0
msgid "CONFIG_DEVTMPFS=y"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:0
msgid "CONFIG_FHANDLE=y"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:0
msgid "CONFIG_SYSVIPC=y"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:0
msgid "CONFIG_IPC_NS=y"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:0
msgid "CONFIG_NET_NS=y"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:0
msgid "CONFIG_PID_NS=y"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:0
msgid "CONFIG_USER_NS=y"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:0
msgid "CONFIG_UTS_NS=y"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:0
msgid "CONFIG_VT=y"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:99
msgid ""
"After this, save and close this file. Commit it into your kernel repo if you "
"wish, because this config name will be added in deviceinfo."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກນີ້, ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ປິດໄຟລ໌ນີ້. Commit ມັນເຂົ້າໃນ kernel repo ຂອງທ່ານຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, "
"ເພາະວ່າຊື່ config ນີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃນ deviceinfo."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:101
msgid ""
"At this point you've almost completed the initial setup for the kernel, move "
"on to configuring ``deviceinfo`` and building."
msgstr ""
"ມາຮອດຈຸດນີ້ ທ່ານເກືອບຈະສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳລັບ kernel ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປຕໍ່ທີ່ການກຳນົດຄ່າ "
"``deviceinfo`` ແລະ ການສ້າງ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:103
msgid ""
"After you have booted the OS successfully, you can move on to patching the "
"defconfig fully in later stages."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ບູດ OS ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໄປຕໍ່ທີ່ການ patch defconfig ຢ່າງສົມບູນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:105
msgid ""
"Note: you may be confused why we are editing a seperate file, halium.config, "
"instead of <codename>_defconfig. These files will be selected together in "
"the deviceinfo, \"merging\" them together. This way, we keep the changes "
"clean and readable."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ທ່ານອາດຈະສັບສົນວ່າເປັນຫຍັງພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, halium.config, "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ <codename>_defconfig. ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເລືອກຮ່ວມກັນໃນ deviceinfo, \"ລວມ\" "
"ພວກມັນເຂົ້າກັນ. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະຮັກສາການປ່ຽນແປງໃຫ້ສະອາດ ແລະ ອ່ານງ່າຍ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:108
msgid "Filling in your deviceinfo"
msgstr "ການຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:110
msgid ""
"Full device name, like Redmi 9C or Redmi Note 10S. Replace as necessary."
msgstr "ຊື່ອຸປະກອນເຕັມ, ເຊັ່ນ Redmi 9C ຫຼື Redmi Note 10S. ປ່ຽນແທນຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:112
msgid "``deviceinfo_name=\"Redmi 9C\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:115
msgid "The name of the device's manufacturer. Change as needed."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດອຸປະກອນ. ປ່ຽນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:117
msgid "``deviceinfo_manufacturer=\"Xiaomi\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:120
msgid ""
"The codename of the phone. This can be obtained by googling for it like: "
"\"<device name> codename\". Replace device name with your phone's full name. "
"Replace the codename below with your own too."
msgstr ""
"Codename ຂອງໂທລະສັບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໄດ້ຮັບໂດຍການຊອກຫາໃນ google ເຊັ່ນ: \"<ຊື່ອຸປະກອນ> "
"codename\". ປ່ຽນແທນຊື່ອຸປະກອນດ້ວຍຊື່ເຕັມຂອງໂທລະສັບຂອງທ່ານ. ປ່ຽນແທນ codename "
"ດ້ານລຸ່ມດ້ວຍຂອງທ່ານເອງເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:122
msgid "``deviceinfo_codename=\"angelica\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:125
msgid ""
"The architecture of your kernel. Most devices released after 2015 have an "
"ARM64 CPU, but some oddities in between can still be armhf. For ARM64 "
"devices, set the config to \"aarch64\". For armhf devices, set the config to "
"\"armv7\"."
msgstr ""
"ສັດຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (Architecture) ຂອງ kernel ຂອງທ່ານ. ອຸປະກອນສ່ວນຫຼາຍທີ່ປ່ອຍຫຼັງປີ 2015 ມີ "
"CPU ARM64, ແຕ່ບາງອັນກໍ່ຍັງເປັນ armhf. ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນ ARM64, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ \"aarch64\". "
"ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນ armhf, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ \"armv7\"."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:127
msgid "``deviceinfo_arch=\"aarch64\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:130
msgid ""
"This defines the git repo where your kernel is located. You already should "
"have this link at hand if you followed section 1, if not go through it "
"again. Replace below link with your own."
msgstr ""
"ອັນນີ້ກຳນົດ git repo ທີ່ kernel ຂອງທ່ານຕັ້ງຢູ່. ທ່ານຄວນຈະມີລິ້ງນີ້ຢູ່ໃນມືແລ້ວຖ້າທ່ານປະຕິບັດຕາມພາກທີ 1, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ກັບໄປເບິ່ງມັນອີກຄັ້ງ. ປ່ຽນແທນລິ້ງດ້ານລຸ່ມດ້ວຍຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:132
msgid ""
"``deviceinfo_kernel_source=\"https://github.com/muhammad23012009/"
"android_kernel_xiaomi_dandelion\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:135
msgid ""
"The branch of the kernel comes next. This can be easily obtained by looking "
"at the tab under the Code tab on GitHub or the tab on the top left side in "
"GitLab. Replace as necessary."
msgstr ""
"Branch ຂອງ kernel ມາຕໍ່ໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໄດ້ຮັບຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍໂດຍການເບິ່ງແຖບພາຍໃຕ້ Code tab ໃນ "
"GitHub ຫຼື ແຖບຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍດ້ານເທິງໃນ GitLab. ປ່ຽນແທນຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:137
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_source_branch=\"halium10-new\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:140
msgid ""
"Defconfig is a vital part of the kernel compilation process. Most of the "
"times you can find this defconfig in your kernel source, the path to which "
"is \"arch/<your architecture>/configs\". The defconfig's name is often built "
"up like \"<your codename>_defconfig\". After finding your defconfig, replace "
"it as necessary. You also need to add ``halium.config`` in this field, due "
"to adding the kernel config patches above. (If you still can't find the "
"defconfig refer to section \"Finding your defconfig\")"
msgstr ""
"Defconfig ເປັນສ່ວນສຳຄັນຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການ compile kernel. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແລ້ວທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາ "
"defconfig ນີ້ໃນ kernel source ຂອງທ່ານ, ເຊິ່ງ path ຄື \"arch/<architecture ຂອງທ່ານ>/"
"configs\". ຊື່ຂອງ defconfig ມັກຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເຊັ່ນ \"<codename ຂອງທ່ານ>_defconfig\". "
"ຫຼັງຈາກຊອກຫາ defconfig ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນແທນມັນຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ. ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ "
"``halium.config`` ໃນຊ່ອງນີ້, ເນື່ອງຈາກການເພີ່ມ kernel config patches ຂ້າງເທິງ. "
"(ຖ້າທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດຊອກຫາ defconfig ໄດ້ ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງພາກ \"Finding your defconfig\")"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:144
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_defconfig=\"angelica_defconfig halium.config\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:147
msgid ""
"The kernel cmdline is one of the key things that is required to make the "
"kernel boot. It has special parameters that allow the kernel to determine "
"which features/things need to be enabled, and which need to be disabled. The "
"Ubuntu Touch rootfs also relies on some key cmdlines which is required to "
"boot, most specifically \"console=tty0\". To adapt this to your device, try "
"unpacking your boot image (section 8.3) and copying the cmdline from there, "
"or take the help of a LineageOS device tree if it is available. "
"\"console=tty0\" is a must for cmdline and should not be removed no matter "
"what. Rest of the things can be removed and you can adjust these to your "
"device. ``console=tty0`` is a requirement for the rootfs to properly boot. "
"``systempart`` is added if you want to boot your rootfs from your system "
"partition. It is supposed to point to your system partition."
msgstr ""
"The kernel cmdline ແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ kernel ບູດ. "
"ມັນມີພາລາມິເຕີພິເສດທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ kernel ກຳນົດວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດ/ສິ່ງໃດທີ່ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້, ແລະ ອັນໃດທີ່ຕ້ອງປິດໃຊ້ງານ. "
"Ubuntu Touch rootfs ຍັງອາໄສ cmdlines ທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງອັນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕໍ່ການບູດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະແມ່ນ "
"\"console=tty0\". ເພື່ອປັບສິ່ງນີ້ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ລອງ unpack boot image ຂອງທ່ານ "
"(ພາກ 8.3) ແລະ ສຳເນົາ cmdline ຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ, ຫຼື ຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກ LineageOS device tree "
"ຖ້າມີ. \"console=tty0\" ເປັນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ cmdline ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກລຶບອອກບໍ່ວ່າກໍລະນີໃດ. "
"ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້ ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດປັບສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ. "
"``console=tty0`` ແມ່ນຂໍ້ກຳນົດສຳລັບ rootfs ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບູດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ``systempart`` "
"ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການບູດ rootfs ຂອງທ່ານຈາກ system partition. ມັນຄວນຈະຊີ້ໄປທີ່ system "
"partition ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:150
msgid ""
"``deviceinfo_kernel_cmdline=\"console=tty0 bootopt=64S3,32N2,64N2 "
"systempart=/dev/mapper/system\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:153
msgid ""
"Add this to your deviceinfo if you wish to compile your kernel with clang. "
"Most devices released with and after Android 10 build their kernels with "
"clang. If you don't want to build with clang, omit this entry entirely."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມສິ່ງນີ້ໃສ່ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການ compile kernel ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ clang. "
"ອຸປະກອນສ່ວນຫຼາຍທີ່ປ່ອຍມາກັບ Android 10 ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ ສ້າງ kernel ຂອງພວກເຂົາດ້ວຍ clang. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການສ້າງດ້ວຍ clang, ໃຫ້ຂ້າມລາຍການນີ້ໄປເລີຍ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:155
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_clang_compile=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:158
msgid ""
"Only required if you wish to use LLD as your linker and enable LTO. For most "
"old kernels LTO is broken. If you do want to use it add this entry to your "
"deviceinfo, else omit it."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ LLD ເປັນ linker ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ LTO. ສຳລັບ kernel "
"ເກົ່າສ່ວນຫຼາຍ LTO ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ມັນ ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມລາຍການນີ້ໃສ່ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ຂ້າມມັນໄປ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:161
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_use_lld=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:164
msgid ""
"This config allows you to compile your kernel with LLVM and LTO, granted "
"that it's supported by it. This is a neat way of specifying ``clang`` and "
"``ld.lld`` together. Usually needed by GKI devices. (Once enabled, you do "
"not needed to specify ``deviceinfo_kernel_use_lld``)"
msgstr ""
"Config ນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານ compile kernel ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ LLVM ແລະ LTO, ຖ້າມັນຮອງຮັບ. "
"ນີ້ເປັນວິທີທີ່ດີໃນການລະບຸ ``clang`` ແລະ ``ld.lld`` ຮ່ວມກັນ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຕ້ອງການໂດຍອຸປະກອນ "
"GKI. (ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸ ``deviceinfo_kernel_use_lld``)"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:169
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_llvm_compile=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:172
msgid ""
"Use this to enable 'dtc_ext' for compiling your dtb/dtbo's. Use only if you "
"know what you're doing. The default compiler works most of the times."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ 'dtc_ext' ສຳລັບການ compile dtb/dtbo ຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານຮູ້ວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງຢູ່. compiler ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ເກືອບທຸກຄັ້ງ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:174
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_use_dtc_ext=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:177
msgid ""
"Use this option to specify the kernel image name after kernel compiles. More "
"than often this option is simply not required, so you can drop it from your "
"deviceinfo. If you do need it, adjust image name as necessary."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຊື່ image ຂອງ kernel ຫຼັງຈາກ kernel compile ແລ້ວ. "
"ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແລ້ວຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເອົາມັນອອກຈາກ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການມັນ, ໃຫ້ປັບຊື່ image ຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:179
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_image_name=\"Image.gz\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:182
msgid ""
"In order to specify your ramdisk compression algorithm, use the below "
"option. It is set to gzip by default. Mostly useful for GKI devices."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລະບຸ algorithm ການບີບອັດ ramdisk ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກດ້ານລຸ່ມ. ມັນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ gzip "
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບອຸປະກອນ GKI."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:185
msgid "``deviceinfo_ramdisk_compression=\"lz4\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:188
msgid ""
"Add this option to specify your Halium version. Up to Halium 13 is supported "
"at this moment."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸເວີຊັນ Halium ຂອງທ່ານ. ຮອງຮັບເຖິງ Halium 13 ໃນຂະນະນີ້."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:190
msgid "``deviceinfo_halium_version=\"11\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:193
msgid ""
"This option defines the boot image header version. It is important you get "
"this right, else your device may not boot. Devices launching with Android "
"versions below 8 (Oreo) use header 0, Android 9 (Pie) uses version 1, "
"Android 10 uses version 2, and GKI devices use version 3/4 (depending on "
"Android version which they were released, Android 12 with GKI uses version "
"4)."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ກຳນົດເວີຊັນ header ຂອງ boot image. ມັນສຳຄັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານອາດຈະບໍ່ບູດ. ອຸປະກອນທີ່ເປີດຕົວກັບ Android ເວີຊັນຕ່ຳກວ່າ 8 (Oreo) ໃຊ້ "
"header 0, Android 9 (Pie) ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ 1, Android 10 ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ 2, ແລະ ອຸປະກອນ GKI "
"ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ 3/4 (ຂຶ້ນກັບເວີຊັນ Android ທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ, Android 12 ກັບ GKI ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ 4)."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:195
msgid "``deviceinfo_bootimg_header_version=\"2\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:198
msgid ""
"Use this option to define a prebuilt dtb that you have sourced. Path is "
"relative to your directory where you are editing the deviceinfo file. Edit "
"the dtb name according to what you have. If your header version is greater "
"than or equal to 3 (GKI device), this will include dtb in your vendor_boot."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸ dtb ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (prebuilt) ທີ່ທ່ານຫາໄດ້. Path "
"ແມ່ນທຽບກັບໄດເລກະທໍລີທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ deviceinfo. ແກ້ໄຂຊື່ dtb ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານມີ. ຖ້າເວີຊັນ "
"header ຂອງທ່ານໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ຫຼື ເເທົ່າກັບ 3 (ອຸປະກອນ GKI), ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະລວມ dtb ໃນ vendor_boot "
"ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:201
msgid "``deviceinfo_bootimg_prebuilt_dtb=\"mt6765.dtb\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:204
msgid ""
"This option uses the dtb's created by your kernel while compiling, multiple "
"dtb's can be specified here like: \"mediatek/mt6765.dtb mediatek/"
"angelica.dtb\" The path in which the scripts look for the dtb's with this "
"option enabled is \"KERNEL_OBJ/arch/<architecture>/boot/dts\" where "
"<architecture> will either be arm64 or arm depending on what you set in "
"deviceinfo_arch (aarch64 is arm64 in kernel speak) If your header version is "
"greater than or equal to 3 (GKI device), this will include dtb in your "
"vendor_boot."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ dtb ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ kernel ຂອງທ່ານໃນຂະນະ compile, ຫຼາຍ dtb ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້ "
"ເຊັ່ນ: \"mediatek/mt6765.dtb mediatek/angelica.dtb\" path ທີ່ສະຄຣິບຊອກຫາ dtb "
"ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກນີ້ແມ່ນ \"KERNEL_OBJ/arch/<architecture>/boot/dts\" ເຊິ່ງ <architecture> "
"ຈະເປັນ arm64 ຫຼື arm ຂຶ້ນກັບສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງໃນ deviceinfo_arch (aarch64 ແມ່ນ arm64 "
"ໃນພາສາຂອງ kernel) ຖ້າເວີຊັນ header ຂອງທ່ານໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ 3 (ອຸປະກອນ GKI), "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະລວມ dtb ໃນ vendor_boot ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:209
msgid "``deviceinfo_dtb=\"mediatek/mt6765.dtb\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:212
msgid ""
"Selecting this will build a DT image that you selected into the boot image. "
"Path is relative to your current directory in which you're editing "
"deviceinfo. (Note: This is only really required in Samsung/Exynos devices.)"
msgstr ""
"ການເລືອກອັນນີ້ຈະສ້າງຮູບພາບ DT (DT image) ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກເຂົ້າໄປໃນ boot image. Path "
"ແມ່ນທຽບກັບໄດເລກະທໍລີປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂ deviceinfo. (ໝາຍເຫດ: ອັນນີ້ຕ້ອງການແທ້ໆໃນອຸປະກອນ "
"Samsung/Exynos ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.)"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:214
msgid "``deviceinfo_bootimg_prebuilt_dt=\"exynos8890-dt.img\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:217
msgid ""
"Use this to ship a prebuilt dtbo in your OTAs and to build your recovery "
"with this dtbo if it isn't already being compiled. Path is once again "
"relative to your build directory. Edit as desired."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງ prebuilt dtbo ໃນ OTAs ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເພື່ອສ້າງ recovery ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ dtbo ນີ້ "
"ຖ້າມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກ compile ແລ້ວ. Path ແມ່ນທຽບກັບໄດເລກະທໍລີ build ຂອງທ່ານ. ແກ້ໄຂຕາມຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:219
msgid "``deviceinfo_prebuilt_dtbo=\"angelica-dtbo.img\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:222
msgid ""
"In case you do not want to ship the DTBO image in an OTA, selecting this "
"will only remove the dtbo from the OTA package but recovery will still be "
"compiled with this dtbo, if dtbo isn't already being compiled."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການສົ່ງ DTBO image ໃນ OTA, ການເລືອກອັນນີ້ຈະພຽງແຕ່ເອົາ dtbo "
"ອອກຈາກແພັກເກັດ OTA ແຕ່ recovery ຈະຍັງຄົງຖືກ compile ກັບ dtbo ນີ້, ຖ້າ dtbo ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກ "
"compile ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:224
msgid "``deviceinfo_skip_dtbo_partition=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:227
msgid ""
"If you want to compile your DTBO from kernel, use this option to select the "
"dtbo files compiled in kernel out directory. The path in which this option "
"will search is KERNEL_OBJ/arch/<architecture>/boot/dts. Multiple dtbo's can "
"be supplied like shown in the example. Adapt the names as per your "
"requirements. The resulting dtbo image will be shipped in the OTA if the "
"skip_dtbo_partition option isn't selected, and in any case recovery will "
"also be built with this dtbo. This option is incompatible with the prebuilt "
"dtbo option."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການ compile DTBO ຂອງທ່ານຈາກ kernel, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອເລືອກໄຟລ໌ dtbo ທີ່ຖືກ "
"compile ໃນ kernel out directory. Path ທີ່ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຊອກຫາແມ່ນ KERNEL_OBJ/arch/"
"<architecture>/boot/dts. ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍ dtb ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງໃນຕົວຢ່າງ. "
"ປັບຊື່ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ. dtbo image ທີ່ໄດ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໃນ OTA ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກ "
"skip_dtbo_partition ບໍ່ຖືກເລືອກ, ແລະ ໃນກໍລະນີໃດກໍ່ຕາມ recovery ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ dtbo "
"ນີ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບຕົວເລືອກ prebuilt dtbo."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:230
msgid "``deviceinfo_dtbo=\"mediatek/galahad.dtbo mediatek/lancelot.dtbo\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:233
msgid ""
"Using this will define the board name in your boot image, which some "
"bootloaders require to boot the image successfully. Only use this option if "
"your stock boot image has this flag set in its header. Edit as you wish if "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ຈະກຳນົດຊື່ board ໃນ boot image ຂອງທ່ານ, ເຊິ່ງ bootloader ບາງອັນຕ້ອງການເພື່ອບູດ "
"image ໄດ້ສຳເລັດ. ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ສະເພາະກໍລະນີທີ່ stock boot image ຂອງທ່ານມີ flag ນີ້ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ "
"header ຂອງມັນ. ແກ້ໄຂຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:235
msgid "``deviceinfo_bootimg_board=\"EXYNOS4412\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:238
msgid ""
"Use this option to pad your boot image to a specific size. Also required if "
"you want to append a vbmeta image or append a hash footer to your image. "
"Change the size to your stock boot image size. (Note: The size is declared "
"in bytes)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອ pad (ຕື່ມຂະໜາດ) boot image ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນຂະໜາດສະເພາະ. "
"ຍັງຈຳເປັນຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການແນບ vbmeta image ຫຼື ແນບ hash footer ໃສ່ image ຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດເປັນຂະໜາດ stock boot image ຂອງທ່ານ. (ໝາຍເຫດ: ຂະໜາດຖືກປະກາດເປັນ bytes)."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:240
msgid "``deviceinfo_bootimg_partition_size=\"67713847\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:243
msgid ""
"Pretty self-explanatory. Set it to true if your device requires a vbmeta "
"image appended (Not the case for most devices with a dedicated vbmeta "
"partition.)"
msgstr ""
"ຂ້ອນຂ້າງຈະແຈ້ງໃນຕົວມັນເອງ. ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ true ຖ້າອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ vbmeta image "
"ແນບມາດ້ວຍ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນກໍລະນີສຳລັບອຸປະກອນສ່ວນຫຼາຍທີ່ມີ vbmeta partition ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ)."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:245
msgid "``deviceinfo_bootimg_append_vbmeta=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:248
msgid ""
"Use this option when you want to create a recovery.img for booting UBports "
"recovery (Only really required when you're finalizing the port). In most "
"cases you'll want to omit this in the start of your port and add it as you "
"try to get it in installer. Setting to true builds the recovery and setting "
"to false or omitting the entry entirely will cause it to not build at all."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ recovery.img ສຳລັບການບູດ UBports recovery "
"(ຕ້ອງການແທ້ໆເມື່ອທ່ານກຳລັງສະຫຼຸບການພອດ). "
"ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນຫຼາຍທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງການຂ້າມອັນນີ້ໄປໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການພອດ ແລະ "
"ເພີ່ມມັນເມື່ອທ່ານພະຍາຍາມເອົາມັນເຂົ້າໃນ installer. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ true ຈະສ້າງ recovery ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ false ຫຼື ຂ້າມລາຍການທັງໝົດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:250
msgid "``deviceinfo_has_recovery_partition=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:253
msgid ""
"Use this to pad your recovery image to a specific size. Also a requirement "
"if you want to add a hash footer to your image. Replace the size from your "
"stock recovery image. (Will only work if you're building recovery!)"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ເພື່ອ pad (ຕື່ມຂະໜາດ) recovery image ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນຂະໜາດສະເພາະ. "
"ຍັງເປັນຂໍ້ກຳນົດຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ hash footer ໃສ່ image ຂອງທ່ານ. ປ່ຽນແທນຂະໜາດຈາກ stock "
"recovery image ຂອງທ່ານ. (ຈະເຮັດວຽກພຽງແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງ recovery!)"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:255
msgid "``deviceinfo_recovery_partition_size=\"67713847\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:258
msgid ""
"This is only really required for some old/new Samsung that check for an "
"\"SEAndroid\" footer on their boot images to check whether or not the boot "
"images are official. If the bootloader doesn't find it it results in an ugly "
"looking red line on the top of the screen. Adding this to your deviceinfo "
"will append this string to the boot image. (Beware! Using this on other "
"devices may cause it to not boot the image!)"
msgstr ""
"ອັນນີ້ຕ້ອງການແທ້ໆສຳລັບ Samsung ເກົ່າ/ໃໝ່ ບາງລຸ້ນທີ່ກວດສອບ \"SEAndroid\" footer ໃນ boot "
"images ຂອງພວກເຂົາ ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າ boot images ເປັນທາງການຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າ bootloader ບໍ່ພົບມັນ "
"ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີເສັ້ນສີແດງທີ່ບໍ່ງາມຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. ການເພີ່ມສິ່ງນີ້ໃສ່ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານຈະແນບ "
"string ນີ້ໃສ່ boot image. (ລະວັງ! ການໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ກັບອຸປະກອນອື່ນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນບໍ່ບູດ image!)"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:260
msgid "``deviceinfo_bootimg_tailtype=\"SEAndroid\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:263
msgid ""
"This config determines whether modules should be compiled and installed into "
"rootfs or not. Omitting this config results in the default behaviour, i.e., "
"modules get compiled and installed into rootfs. Adding this option to your "
"deviceinfo and setting it to true (like shown) will disable modules "
"compilation. Only really needed in case you're doing something advanced."
msgstr ""
"Config ນີ້ກຳນົດວ່າ modules ຄວນຖືກ compile ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນ rootfs ຫຼືບໍ່. ການຂ້າມ config "
"ນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ນັ້ນຄື modules ຖືກ compile ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນ rootfs. "
"ການເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃສ່ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ true (ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງ) ຈະປິດການ "
"compile modules. ຕ້ອງການແທ້ໆໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດສິ່ງທີ່ແອດວານຊ໌."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:265
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_disable_modules=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:268
msgid ""
"This option installs all overlay files (in overlay/ directory) into /system/"
"opt/halium-overlay, therefore overlaying the files onto the files present in "
"rootfs instead of completely replacing them. This is necessary for 20.04 and "
"onwards, but not applicable for 16.04."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ overlay ທັງໝົດ (ໃນໄດເລກະທໍລີ overlay/) ລົງໃນ /system/opt/halium-"
"overlay, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງ overlay ໄຟລ໌ທັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ rootfs ແທນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແທນພວກມັນທັງໝົດ. "
"ນີ້ເປັນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ 20.04 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ 16.04."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:270
msgid "``deviceinfo_use_overlaystore=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:273
msgid ""
"This option is mostly used on some Qualcomm devices. Adding this to your "
"deviceinfo will combine all your dtbo's with your dtbs. Only use if you are "
"sure you need this."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ສ່ວນຫຼາຍຖືກໃຊ້ໃນອຸປະກອນ Qualcomm ບາງລຸ້ນ. ການເພີ່ມສິ່ງນີ້ໃສ່ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານຈະລວມ "
"dtbo ທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານກັບ dtbs. ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສິ່ງນີ້."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:275
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_apply_overlay=\"true\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:278
msgid ""
"Add this configuration to your deviceinfo when you need to specify a fixed "
"size for your rootfs being flashed to system image. Default is 3000M when "
"option is not set. Only use if you need it."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃສ່ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການລະບຸຂະໜາດຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບ rootfs "
"ຂອງທ່ານທີ່ຈະຖືກແຟລດໃສ່ system image. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 3000M ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຕົວເລືອກ. "
"ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:280
msgid "``deviceinfo_system_partition_size=\"4000M\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:283
msgid ""
"This config is only relevant for newer devices launched with UFS storage"
msgstr "Config ນີ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບອຸປະກອນໃໝ່ທີ່ເປີດຕົວກັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ UFS ເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:285
msgid "``deviceinfo_rootfs_image_sector_size=\"4096\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:288
msgid ""
"Next up are flash offsets. You can ignore these if you're building only "
"boot.img for a GKI device, but are required if you want to build "
"vendor_boot.img. These offsets will automatically apply for vendor_boot if "
"your header version is greater than or equal to 3. A guide to extract them "
"is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ຕໍ່ໄປແມ່ນ flash offsets. ທ່ານສາມາດບໍ່ສົນໃຈສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງພຽງແຕ່ boot.img "
"ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນ GKI, ແຕ່ຈຳເປັນຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ vendor_boot.img. offsets "
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບ vendor_boot ຖ້າເວີຊັນ header ຂອງທ່ານໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ "
"3. ຄູ່ມືການແຍກພວກມັນອອກມາມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:292
msgid "Extracting values from stock boot.img/vendor_boot.img"
msgstr "ການແຍກເອົາຄ່າຈາກ stock boot.img/vendor_boot.img"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:294
msgid ""
"For any port to boot, some values must be pulled from the stock boot.img. "
"First and foremost, try to get your stock firmware. Some manufacturers like "
"Samsung like to encrypt their firmwares, but still some tools are available "
"to get them. Others like Xiaomi provide the firmware, but you need to use "
"Google to search it. And then there's the good guy Google, who provide full "
"firmware binaries easily accessible. Long story short, you need to at least "
"find your stock firmware, and then get the boot.img. Once you have the "
"boot.img acquired, follow the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການພອດໃດໆທີ່ຈະບູດ, ບາງຄ່າຕ້ອງຖືກດຶງມາຈາກ stock boot.img. ກ່ອນອື່ນໝົດ, ພະຍາຍາມເອົາ "
"stock firmware ຂອງທ່ານ. ຜູ້ຜະລິດບາງລາຍ ເຊັ່ນ Samsung ມັກຈະເຂົ້າລະຫັດ firmware "
"ຂອງພວກເຂົາ, ແຕ່ກໍ່ຍັງມີເຄື່ອງມືບາງຢ່າງທີ່ສາມາດເອົາພວກມັນໄດ້. ລາຍອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ Xiaomi ໃຫ້ firmware, "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Google ເພື່ອຊອກຫາມັນ. ແລະ ຍັງມີ Google ຜູ້ໃຈດີທີ່ໃຫ້ firmware binaries "
"ເຕັມຮູບແບບທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ງ່າຍ. ສະຫຼຸບສັ້ນໆ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຊອກຫາ stock firmware ຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນເອົາ boot.img. ເມື່ອທ່ານໄດ້ boot.img ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:297
msgid ""
"Make a directory in which you'll store all your unpacked data. It can be "
"anywhere, and can have any name. For now, we'll call it `temp`."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໄດເລກະທໍລີທີ່ທ່ານຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ unpack ທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ. ມັນສາມາດຢູ່ໃສກໍ່ໄດ້, ແລະ "
"ສາມາດມີຊື່ຫຍັງກໍ່ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຕອນນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະເອີ້ນມັນວ່າ `temp`."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:299
msgid ""
"Run \"mkdir ~/temp\" to create the directory and \"cd ~/temp\" to go to it."
msgstr "Run \"mkdir ~/temp\" ເພື່ອສ້າງໄດເລກະທໍລີ ແລະ \"cd ~/temp\" ເພື່ອເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ນັ້ນ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:301
msgid ""
"Now to unpack the boot image there are several utilities to do so. One of "
"them is the python script provided by Android. For now we'll use this. To "
"download it into your current working directory run \"wget https://"
"raw.githubusercontent.com/LineageOS/android_system_tools_mkbootimg/"
"lineage-19.1/unpack_bootimg.py\" This will download the unpack_bootimg.py "
"script, which you'll now use to pull your kernel offsets and other values "
"alike"
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ເພື່ອ unpack boot image ມີຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ໃຊ້ເຮັດໄດ້. ໜຶ່ງໃນນັ້ນແມ່ນ python script ທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ "
"Android. ສຳລັບຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ອັນນີ້. ເພື່ອດາວໂຫລດມັນເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄດເລກະທໍລີເຮັດວຽກປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ "
"ໃຫ້ run \"wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LineageOS/"
"android_system_tools_mkbootimg/lineage-19.1/unpack_bootimg.py\" "
"ນີ້ຈະດາວໂຫລດສະຄຣິບ unpack_bootimg.py, ເຊິ່ງຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອດຶງ kernel offsets ແລະ "
"ຄ່າອື່ນໆທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:303
msgid "Bring your boot.img into the temp directory."
msgstr "ເອົາ boot.img ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄດເລກະທໍລີ temp."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:305
msgid ""
"Now run the script. The usual syntax is \"python3 unpack_bootimg.py --"
"boot_img <boot.img or vendor_boot.img> --out out\" This will unpack the boot "
"image, store the output files in the out directory, and it will also print "
"the offsets on screen."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ run ສະຄຣິບ. syntax ປົກກະຕິຄື \"python3 unpack_bootimg.py --boot_img "
"<boot.img ຫຼື vendor_boot.img> --out out\" ນີ້ຈະ unpack boot image, "
"ເກັບໄຟລ໌ຜົນລັພໃນໄດເລກະທໍລີ out, ແລະ ມັນຈະສະແດງ offsets ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:308
msgid "A sample output for boot.img will look like this:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຜົນລັພສຳລັບ boot.img ຈະມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:310
msgid "boot magic: ANDROID!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:312
msgid "kernel_size: 11399060"
msgstr "kernel_size: 11399060"

