#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:382
msgid "Here's where this will get interesting."
msgstr "ນີ້ຄືຈຸດທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:384
msgid ""
"\"kernel load address\" is the kernel offset. The value after the colon is "
"what you need, for example,   0x40080000. This will be different in your "
"case."
msgstr ""
"\"kernel load address\" ແມ່ນ kernel offset. ຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງຈຸດສອງເມັດຄືສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: 0x40080000. ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງທ່ານ ຄ່ານີ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າງອອກໄປ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:386
msgid ""
"\"ramdisk load address\" will be your ramdisk offset. Take the value next to "
"it. For example, 0x51b00000."
msgstr ""
"\"ramdisk load address\" ຈະເປັນ ramdisk offset ຂອງທ່ານ. ໃຫ້ເອົາຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ຖັດຈາກມັນ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: 0x51b00000."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:388
msgid ""
"\"second bootloader load address\" is mostly unnecessary by today's "
"standards. But if your boot image does spit this value, make sure to take "
"it. For example, 0xc0ff0000."
msgstr ""
"\"second bootloader load address\" ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນໃນມາດຕະຖານປັດຈຸບັນ. "
"ແຕ່ຖ້າບູດອິມເມດ (boot image) ຂອງທ່ານສະແດງຄ່ານີ້ອອກມາ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເອົາມັນມາ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"0xc0ff0000."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:390
msgid ""
"\"kernel tags load address\" is a special one. It's used for both kernel "
"tags and dtb, but in some cases these values can be different. Take the "
"value as well. For example, 0x47880000."
msgstr ""
"\"kernel tags load address\" ແມ່ນຄ່າພິເສດ. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບທັງ kernel tags ແລະ dtb, "
"ແຕ່ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ໃຫ້ເອົາຄ່ານີ້ມາຄືກັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: 0x47880000."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:392
msgid ""
"\"dtb address\" is sometimes the same as \"kernel tags load address\". But "
"if it's different, you should use this for dtb and tags for tags."
msgstr ""
"\"dtb address\" ບາງຄັ້ງຈະເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ \"kernel tags load address\". "
"ແຕ່ຫາກມັນແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ອັນນີ້ສຳລັບ dtb ແລະ ໃຊ້ tags ສຳລັບ tags."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:394
msgid ""
"\"page size\" is required for the ramdisk to know what your flash chip uses "
"for page sizes. Value after colon is what you need. For example, 2048."
msgstr ""
"\"page size\" ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ ramdisk ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າ flash chip ຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ຂະໜາດໜ້າ (page "
"size) ເທົ່າໃດ. ຄ່າຫຼັງຈຸດສອງເມັດຄືສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: 2048."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:396
msgid ""
"\"os version\" is the value which determines which Android version this "
"boot.img has. Some bootloaders enforce this. For example, 10.0."
msgstr ""
"\"os version\" ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດວ່າ boot.img ນີ້ແມ່ນ Android ເວີຊັນໃດ. bootloader "
"ບາງອັນຈະບັງຄັບໃຊ້ອັນນີ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: 10.0."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:398
msgid ""
"\"os patch level\" is a similar story. You'll also want to grab this value, "
"for example, 2021-11."
msgstr "\"os patch level\" ກໍເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນ. ທ່ານຄວນຈະເອົາຄ່ານີ້ມາຄືກັນ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: 2021-11."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:400
msgid ""
"\"command line args\" go straight into deviceinfo_kernel_cmdline. Make sure "
"to keep \"console=tty0\" in there. No examples here :("
msgstr ""
"\"command line args\" ຈະຖືກໃສ່ລົງໃນ deviceinfo_kernel_cmdline ໂດຍກົງ. "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເກັບ \"console=tty0\" ໄວ້ໃນນັ້ນ. ບໍ່ມີຕົວຢ່າງຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ :("

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:402
msgid ""
"If you're building vendor_boot, this command will also output a "
"``bootconfig`` file in your output directory. Move this to your source "
"tree's root."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງ vendor_boot, ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ ``bootconfig`` ໃນ output "
"directory ຂອງທ່ານນຳ. ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ນີ້ໄປທີ່ root ຂອງ source tree ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:404
msgid "Apart from these mentioned values, you'll want to skip everything else."
msgstr "ນອກເໜືອຈາກຄ່າທີ່ກ່າວມານີ້ ທ່ານຄວນຂ້າມສ່ວນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:407
msgid "Now according to said guide, fill in your offsets:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ offsets ຂອງທ່ານຕາມຄູ່ມືດັ່ງກ່າວ:"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:410
msgid "Put the value from \"page size\" into this config."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຄ່າຈາກ \"page size\" ລົງໃນ config ນີ້."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:412
msgid "``deviceinfo_flash_pagesize=\"2048\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_flash_pagesize=\"2048\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:415
msgid "Base offset will always remain 0x00000000."
msgstr "Base offset ຈະຍັງຄົງເປັນ 0x00000000 ສະເໝີ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:417
msgid "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_base=\"0x00000000\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_base=\"0x00000000\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:420
msgid "Fill this in from \"kernel load address\"."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມ \"kernel load address\"."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:422
msgid "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_kernel=\"0x40080000\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_kernel=\"0x40080000\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:425
msgid "This gets its value from \"ramdisk load address\"."
msgstr "ຄ່ານີ້ໄດ້ມາຈາກ \"ramdisk load address\"."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:427
msgid "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_ramdisk=\"0x51b00000\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_ramdisk=\"0x51b00000\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:430
msgid ""
"Although not mission critical, if you did get its value, fill it in from "
"\"second bootloader load address\"."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ຫາກທ່ານມີຄ່າຂອງມັນ ກໍໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ \"second bootloader load "
"address\"."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:432
msgid "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_second=\"0xc0ff0000\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_second=\"0xc0ff0000\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:435
msgid "Tags should be filled in from \"kernel tags load address\"."
msgstr "Tags ຄວນຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ \"kernel tags load address\"."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:437
msgid "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_tags=\"0x47880000\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_tags=\"0x47880000\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:440
msgid "DTB offset comes from \"dtb load address\"."
msgstr "DTB offset ແມ່ນມາຈາກ \"dtb load address\"."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:442
msgid "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_dtb=\"0x47880000\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_flash_offset_dtb=\"0x47880000\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:445
msgid ""
"This comes from \"os version\". Not exactly required but some OEMs enforce "
"it."
msgstr "ຄ່ານີ້ມາຈາກ \"os version\". ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳເປັນທຸກກໍລະນີ ແຕ່ OEM ບາງລາຍອາດຈະບັງຄັບໃຊ້."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:447
msgid "``deviceinfo_bootimg_os_version=\"10.0\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_bootimg_os_version=\"10.0\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:450
msgid "You'll want to put the \"os patch level\" value here."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນໃສ່ຄ່າ \"os patch level\" ທີ່ນີ້."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:452
msgid "``deviceinfo_bootimg_os_patch_level=\"2021-11\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_bootimg_os_patch_level=\"2021-11\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:455
msgid ""
"If you're building a vendor_boot and you have moved the ``bootconfig`` file "
"to your tree's root, add the following:"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງສ້າງ vendor_boot ແລະ ໄດ້ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ ``bootconfig`` ໄປທີ່ root ຂອງ tree "
"ຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:457
msgid "``deviceinfo_vendor_bootconfig_path=\"bootconfig\"``"
msgstr "``deviceinfo_vendor_bootconfig_path=\"bootconfig\"``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:460
msgid ""
"And just like that, you've filled in your deviceinfo properly and can now "
"get on with the port!"
msgstr ""
"ພຽງເທົ່ານີ້ ທ່ານກໍໄດ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ສາມາດດຳເນີນການພອດ (port) "
"ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້!"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:464
msgid "Building, installing and running"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຣັນ"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:466
msgid ""
"After you've completed your deviceinfo and filled in all needed stuff, its "
"time you get to the main part, the build. For this just run: ``./build.sh -b "
"workdir``"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ deviceinfo ແລະ ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດແລ້ວ ກໍຮອດເວລາເຂົ້າສູ່ສ່ວນຫຼັກ "
"ນັ້ນຄືການ build. ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ: ``./build.sh -b workdir``"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:469
msgid ""
"That should download all the needed toolchains and then the kernel, and "
"finally build everything. This process may take about 5 to 50 minutes to "
"build the kernel."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນຈະດາວໂຫຼດ toolchains ທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ ຕາມດ້ວຍເຄີເນີນ ແລະ ເລີ່ມ build ທຸກຢ່າງ. "
"ຂັ້ນຕອນການ build ເຄີເນີນນີ້ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາປະມານ 5 ຫາ 50 ນາທີ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:471
msgid ""
"After your kernel is done building, you can proceed to install and boot it "
"in the next step."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ build ເຄີເນີນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ບູດ (boot) ມັນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:2
msgid "Installing the kernel"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຄີເນີນ"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:4
msgid ""
"After your kernel is done building, you will have to build the rootfs. For "
"this, just execute this:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ build ເຄີເນີນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງ build rootfs ຕໍ່. ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:6
msgid ""
"``./build/prepare-fake-ota.sh out/device_<your device's "
"codename>_usrmerge.tar.xz ota`` This will download the rootfs, extract it "
"and pack it into tarballs for our final script to create flashable images."
msgstr ""
"``./build/prepare-fake-ota.sh out/"
"device_<codename_ຂອງອຸປະກອນທ່ານ>_usrmerge.tar.xz ota`` ນີ້ຈະດາວໂຫຼດ rootfs, "
"ແຍກໄຟລ໌ (extract) ແລະ ບີບອັດເປັນ tarballs "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບສຸດທ້າຍຂອງພວກເຮົາສ້າງເປັນແຟລດອິມເມດ (flashable images)."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:9
msgid "Next up, run:"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປໃຫ້ຣັນ:"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:11
msgid ""
"``./build/system-image-from-ota.sh ota/ubuntu_command images`` This will "
"convert the tarballs into flashable images, and your images will be stored "
"in the `images/` directory. There will be a number of files depending on how "
"you configured your deviceinfo. But the basic file structure will be as "
"given:"
msgstr ""
"``./build/system-image-from-ota.sh ota/ubuntu_command images`` ນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນ "
"tarballs ໃຫ້ເປັນແຟລດອິມເມດ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ອິມເມດຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `images/`. "
"ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ deviceinfo ຂອງທ່ານ ແຕ່ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານຈະເປັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:15
msgid "images/"
msgstr "images/"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:16
msgid "├── boot.img"
msgstr "├── boot.img"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:17
msgid "├── rootfs.img"
msgstr "├── rootfs.img"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:18
msgid "└── system.img"
msgstr "└── system.img"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:21
msgid ""
"The ``boot.img`` will be flashed onto the boot partition of the phone. The "
"``system.img`` and ``rootfs.img`` are interchangable. ``rootfs.img`` is "
"pushed to the data partition as ``ubuntu.img`` if you didn't include "
"``systempart`` in deviceinfo's cmdline. Otherwise, ``system.img`` is flashed "
"to your system partition."
msgstr ""
"``boot.img`` ຈະຖືກແຟລດລົງໃນ boot partition ຂອງໂທລະສັບ. ``system.img`` ແລະ "
"``rootfs.img`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ແທນກັນໄດ້. ``rootfs.img`` ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປທີ່ data partition ເປັນ "
"``ubuntu.img`` ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມ ``systempart`` ໄວ້ໃນ cmdline ຂອງ deviceinfo. "
"ແຕ່ຫາກລວມໄວ້ ``system.img`` ຈະຖືກແຟລດລົງໃນ system partition ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:25
#, fuzzy
msgid "info::"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ::"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_install.rst:33
msgid ""
"For a lot of kernel-related commands, you'll need the ARCH variable's value, "
"this is either arm or arm64 depending on where you found your defconfig. A "
"thing to keep in mind for kernel patches."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບເຄີເນີນຫຼາຍຄຳສັ່ງ ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງມີຄ່າຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນ ARCH ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນ arm ຫຼື arm64 "
"ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າທ່ານພົບ defconfig ຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃສ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນຈື່ໄວ້ສຳລັບການແພັດເຄີເນີນ (kernel "
"patches)."

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/Apparmor.rst:5
msgid "AppArmor"
msgstr "AppArmor"

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/Apparmor.rst:7
msgid ""
"Without AppArmor a number of device features will not function properly and "
"most apps will crash when launched. For more information on AppArmor, refer "
"to the `Ubuntu Wiki. <https://wiki.ubuntu.com/AppArmor>`_"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍ່ມີ AppArmor ຟີເຈີຫຼາຍຢ່າງຂອງອຸປະກອນຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ແອັບສ່ວນຫຼາຍຈະຄ້າງ (crash) "
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ AppArmor ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງເຖິງ `Ubuntu Wiki. <https://"
"wiki.ubuntu.com/AppArmor>`_"

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/Apparmor.rst:9
msgid ""
"AppArmor is added through a combination of integrating the necessary code "
"into the kernel source tree and setting necessary kernel configuration."
msgstr ""
"AppArmor ຖືກເພີ່ມໂດຍການລວມໂຄ້ດທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າໃນ kernel source tree ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄີເນີນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/Apparmor.rst:11
