#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/USBModed.rst:74
msgid ""
"This config controls the launching flag of the usb-moded daemon itself. Most "
"of the time, usb-moded should work without any flag. However, the rootfs "
"ships a default with ``-r`` which enables the rescue mode upon boot (see "
"below). The behavior of the rescue mode can be confusing for end users, so "
"it's recommended that porters config this value to the blank value to "
"disable the rescue mode."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມ flag ໃນການເປີດໃຊ້ usb-moded daemon. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍ usb-moded "
"ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ flag ໃດໆ. ແຕ່ໃນ rootfs ຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ ``-r`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນການເປີດ "
"rescue mode ຕອນບູດ (ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດດ້ານລຸ່ມ). ເນື່ອງຈາກ rescue mode "
"ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປສັບສົນ ຜູ້ພອດຈຶ່ງຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງເພື່ອປິດ rescue mode."

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/USBModed.rst:76
msgid "USB_MODED_ARGS"
msgstr "USB_MODED_ARGS"

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/USBModed.rst:79
msgid "About usb-moded's rescue mode"
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບ rescue mode ຂອງ usb-moded"

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/USBModed.rst:81
msgid ""
"usb-moded's rescue mode is similar to hybris-usb's usb-tethering mode. It "
"enables the phone's USB to function as a network interface, and starts a "
"DHCP server. The phone will be available at 10.15.19.82, and an emergency "
"SSH server will be available on port 8022. This is intended for porters to "
"debug issues during the development, and thus it will stay in that mode "
"until the cable is re-plugged."
msgstr ""
"rescue mode ຂອງ usb-moded ຈະຄ້າຍກັບ usb-tethering ຂອງ hybris-usb. ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ "
"USB ຂອງໂທລະສັບເຮັດວຽກເປັນ network interface ແລະ ເລີ່ມ DHCP server. "
"ໂທລະສັບຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ທີ່ IP 10.15.19.82 ແລະ ມີ SSH server ສຸກເສີນທີ່ພອດ 8022. "
"ໂໝດນີ້ມີໄວ້ໃຫ້ຜູ້ພອດໃຊ້ debug ບັນຫາໃນລະຫວ່າງການພັດທະນາ ແລະ ຈະຢູ່ໃນໂໝດນີ້ຈົນກວ່າຈະຖອດແລ້ວສຽບສາຍ "
"USB ໃໝ່."

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/USBModed.rst:83
msgid ""
"This behavior is helpful for the porters. However, this can be confusing to "
"end-users when the port is shipped. So I recommended disabling this mode "
"before making the port available to users by overriding ``USB_MODED_ARGS`` "
"as discussed above."
msgstr ""
"ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ເປັນປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຜູ້ພອດ ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປສັບສົນເມື່ອປ່ອຍພອດອອກໄປແລ້ວ. "
"ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດໂໝດນີ້ກ່ອນເຜີຍແຜ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ໂດຍການ override ``USB_MODED_ARGS`` "
"ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວໄວ້."

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/USBModed.rst:85
msgid ""
"Another rescue feature available is the ability to force usb-moded to go to "
"\"rescue mode\" or to enable ADB on every boot. This can be done by placing "
"an empty file at ``/userdata/.force-ssh`` or ``/userdata/.force-adb`` (which "
"translate to ``/data/.force-ssh`` or ``/data/.force-adb`` in the recovery), "
"and the system will make sure the correct mode is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຟີເຈີກູ້ໄພອີກຢ່າງແມ່ນການບັງຄັບໃຫ້ usb-moded ເຂົ້າສູ່ \"rescue mode\" ຫຼື ເປີດ ADB ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ບູດ. "
"ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການວາງໄຟລ໌ຫວ່າງໄວ້ທີ່ ``/userdata/.force-ssh`` ຫຼື ``/userdata/.force-adb`` "
"(ເຊິ່ງກໍຄື ``/data/.force-ssh`` ຫຼື ``/data/.force-adb`` ໃນ recovery) "
"ແລ້ວລະບົບຈະຈັດການເປີດໂໝດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ເອງ."

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/USBModed.rst:88
msgid ""
"If using ADB, you may also have to disable ADB authorization prompt. "
"See :ref:`AdbdAuthz`."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກໃຊ້ ADB ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການຂໍອະນຸຍາດ ADB ນຳ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`AdbdAuthz`."

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/USBModed.rst:91
msgid "Configuring usb-moded directly"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ usb-moded ໂດຍກົງ"

#: ../../porting/configure_test_fix/USBModed.rst:93
msgid ""
"Besides tweaking options for the configurator script, porters can also set "
"usb-moded options directly via ``/etc/usb-moded/90-device-specific-"
"config.ini``. However, this is intended as an escape hatch in case the "
"automatic detection fails, and if you found yourself need to use this file, "
"consider filing issue over usb-moded's packaging repository. See `usb-"
"moded's docs <https://github.com/sailfishos/usb-moded/blob/master/docs/"
"usb_moded-doc.txt>` for the syntax."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກການປັບແຕ່ງຜ່ານ configurator script ແລ້ວ ຜູ້ພອດຍັງຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ usb-moded "
"ໂດຍກົງໄດ້ຜ່ານໄຟລ໌ ``/etc/usb-moded/90-device-specific-config.ini``. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກສຸດທ້າຍໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ການກວດພົບອັດຕະໂນມັດລົ້ມເຫຼວ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ "
"ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາແຈ້ງບັນຫາໄປທີ່ repository ຂອງ usb-moded. ສຳລັບຮູບແບບການຂຽນ (syntax) "
"ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ `usb-moded's docs <https://github.com/sailfishos/usb-moded/blob/"
"master/docs/usb_moded-doc.txt>`"

