#: ../../porting/introduction/Intro.rst:108
msgid "General advice"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳທົ່ວໄປ"

#: ../../porting/introduction/Intro.rst:110
msgid ""
"The more rigorous you are at making notes and documenting your steps, the "
"less time you will spend backtracking your steps and guessing your way "
"along. When dealing with issues that arise along the way, it is wise to work "
"on them one at a time. If you try to correct several things at once, you "
"risk ending up trying to guess which changes solved a given issue, which "
"easily leads to breaking the functionality in question once more at some "
"later stage."
msgstr ""
"ຍິ່ງທ່ານຈົດບັນທຶກຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ລະອຽດເທົ່າໃດ, "
"ທ່ານກໍຈະຍິ່ງປະຢັດເວລາໃນການຫາສາເຫດຂອງບັນຫາໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເມື່ອພົບບັນຫາ ຄວນແກ້ໄຂເທື່ອລະຢ່າງ. "
"ຫາກແກ້ໄຂຫຼາຍຢ່າງພ້ອມກັນ ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງໃດທີ່ແກ້ບັນຫາໄດ້ແທ້ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບພັງໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Intro.rst:112
msgid ""
"If you are not discouraged after reading this, we welcome your efforts and "
"wish you the best of luck!"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ທໍ້ຖອຍຫຼັງຈາກອ່ານຈົບ, ພວກເຮົາຂໍສະໜັບສະໜູນຄວາມພະຍາຍາມຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຂໍໃຫ້ໂຊກດີ!"

#: ../../porting/introduction/Intro.rst:114
msgid "The next section presents a key to the rest of this guide."
msgstr "ພາກຕໍ່ໄປຈະເປັນຂໍ້ມູນສຳຄັນສຳລັບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງຄູ່ມືນີ້."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:4
msgid "Preparations"
msgstr "ການກະກຽມ"

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:6
msgid ""
"Not all devices can be made to run Ubuntu Touch. Research your target device "
"before you start."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກອຸປະກອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ Ubuntu Touch ໄດ້. ຄວນຄົ້ນຄວ້າອຸປະກອນເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:8
msgid ""
"To determine your device's specifications, search for it on `GSM Arena "
"<https://www.gsmarena.com>`_ and/or `Device Specification <https://"
"www.devicespecifications.com/en>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:10
msgid "We encourage the following specifications:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:12
msgid "Kernel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:13
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Touch currently requires a device with a Linux kernel version greater "
"than or equal to 3.15. According to the `systemd v255 README <https://"
"github.com/systemd/systemd/blob/v255/README#L32>`_, older device kernels are "
"not compatible with systemd v255 or newer. You may learn your device's "
"kernel version by finding \"Kernel Version\" in the About page of your "
"Android settings. The kernel version can also be found in the ``Makefile`` "
"at the top level of any Linux kernel source tree."
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:15
msgid "RAM"
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:16
msgid ""
"At least 1GB is required for Operating System to work. 3GB or higher is "
"recommended for a better end-user experience."
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:18
msgid ""
"At least 16GB of storage is required. Devices with less storage will likely "
"not have enough space for a full Ubuntu Touch installation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:23
msgid "Locate relevant guides and other information"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຄູ່ມື ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:25
msgid ""
"If your desired target device complies to the above, the next thing to do is "
"locate the available guides and other documentation. This step will help you "
"later on when you run into issues developing your port. For now, the main "
"thing to look for is how to unlock your bootloader. (See below)."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານເກນ, ສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດແມ່ນຊອກຫາຄູ່ມືຕ່າງໆ. "
"ສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດໃນຕອນນີ້ຄືວິທີການປົດລັອກ bootloader."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:27
msgid ""
"Head over to the `LineageOS Wiki <https://wiki.lineageos.org/>`_. Look up "
"your device and read and bookmark the guides that are listed there. Try a "
"web search for additional information, specifying both its retail name and "
"the code name you found on the LineageOS site. Be careful to check that the "
"information you gather applies to your specific device, keeping in mind that "
"many devices are sold in a number of different variants with different "
"hardware specifications."
msgstr ""
"ໄປທີ່ `LineageOS Wiki <https://wiki.lineageos.org/>`_ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາຂໍ້ມູນອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ຄວນກວດສອບໃຫ້ດີວ່າຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນກົງກັບລຸ້ນທີ່ທ່ານມີແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ເພາະບາງລຸ້ນອາດມີສະເປັກທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະປະເທດ."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:29
msgid ""
"Another rich source of information is the `XDA Developers Forum <https://"
"www.xda-developers.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"ອີກແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນຄື `XDA Developers Forum <https://www.xda-developers.com/>`_."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:34
msgid "Unlock the bootloader"
msgstr "ປົດລັອກ bootloader"

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:36
msgid ""
"Vendors usually provide their devices in a locked bootloader state. This is "
"a kind of software \"seal\" intended to prevent modifications directly to "
"the operating system and system software. If you unlock the bootloader, you "
"will be able to make such modifications, but in this state your device's "
"warranty might be void. The choice is yours, but this step is mandatory if "
"you wish to install Ubuntu Touch on the device."
msgstr ""
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວອຸປະກອນຈະຖືກລັອກ bootloader ມາແຕ່ໂຮງງານ. ການປົດລັອກຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປ່ຽນແປງລະບົບໄດ້ "
"ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໝົດປະກັນ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຫາກຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ Ubuntu Touch."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:38
msgid ""
"Devices differ and there is no general method that covers all makes and "
"models. Therefore, you need to check the aforementioned guides for "
"instructions on how to unlock the bootloader of your particular device."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນມີວິທີປົດລັອກທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງກວດສອບວິທີສະເພາະສຳລັບລຸ້ນຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:43
msgid "Install TWRP recovery"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ TWRP recovery"

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:45
msgid ""
"You need to install a custom recovery image on your device in order to "
"handle formatting and flashing image files onto it. Head over to the `Team "
"Win Recovery Project <https://twrp.me/Devices/>`_  and locate the image file "
"for your device. Follow the installation instructions provided on the "
"website."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ custom recovery ເພື່ອຈັດການການຟໍແມັດ (format) ແລະ ແຟລດ (flash) ໄຟລ໌. "
"ສາມາດຫາໄດ້ທີ່ `TWRP <https://twrp.me/Devices/>`_."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:48
msgid ""
"Some devices do not have a TWRP image available. While it is technically "
"possible to port a device without a recovery, it makes the process a lot "
"more complicated, especially when debugging early in the porting process."
msgstr ""
"ບາງອຸປະກອນອາດບໍ່ມີ TWRP. ເຖິງວ່າທາງເຕັກນິກຈະພອດໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ recovery "
"ແຕ່ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການຫຍຸ້ງຍາກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:53
msgid "Recommendations for the host/build PC"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບຄອມພິວເຕີທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງ (Host PC)"

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:55
msgid ""
"The remainder of this guide presumes you are using a build PC running Linux. "
"Although high performance always is nice, stability and sufficient RAM and "
"harddisk space are the main concerns here. You do not need the latest and "
"the best hardware, nor do you need the latest distribution release. In fact, "
"it is not uncommon to run into issues when choosing the very newest release, "
"as some of the software needed may not yet have been built for it. For "
"example, using a Ubuntu LTS release, or a LTS release of another "
"distribution, is often a good choice."
msgstr ""
"ຄອມພິວເຕີທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງຄວນໃຊ້ລະບົບ Linux. ຄວນເນັ້ນໃສ່ຄວາມສະຖຽນ, RAM ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຮາດດິດທີ່ພຽງພໍ. "
"ການໃຊ້ Ubuntu ເວີຊັນ LTS ມັກຈະເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Preparations.rst:57
msgid ""
"Having completed the steps above, you are now ready to set up your build "
"environment and start the porting process per se (next section)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຂ້າງເທິງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານກໍພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ແລະ "
"ເລີ່ມຂະບວນການພອດໃນພາກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: ../../porting/introduction/Setting_up.rst:4
msgid "Setting up the build environment"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການສ້າງ (Build Environment)"

