msgstr ""
"``system-settings-plugin``: ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຖບບັນຊີ (Accounts panel) ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ "
"System Settings."

#: ../../systemdev/online-accounts.rst:15
msgid ""
"The `Account plugins <https://github.com/ubports/account-plugins>`_ define "
