"review your changes and create a pull request."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດ branch ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"New pull request\" ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ທ່ານຈະຖືກນຳໄປໜ້າເວັບທີ່ສາມາດກວດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ສ້າງ pull request ໄດ້."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:119
msgid ""
"Give your pull request a descriptive title and description (include links to "
"reference bugs or other material). Ensure that the \"base\" branch is the "
"one you want your changes to be applied to (likely ``xenial``), then click "
"\"Create pull request\"."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຫົວຂໍ້ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍທີ່ຊັດເຈນໃຫ້ກັບ pull request ຂອງທ່ານ (ລວມທັງລິ້ງອ້າງອີງ bugs ຫຼື "
"ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ). ຮັບປະກັນວ່າ \"base\" branch ແມ່ນອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງ (ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນ "
"``xenial``), ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ \"Create pull request\"."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:121
msgid ""
"With your pull request created, we can move on to testing your changes using "
"the UBports build service!"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ້າງ pull request ແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາສາມາດກ້າວໄປສູ່ການທົດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ UBports "
"build service!"

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:124
msgid "Test your changes"
msgstr "ທົດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:126
msgid ""
"Once your pull request is built (a green check mark appears next to your "
"last commit), you are ready to test your changes on your device."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ pull request ຂອງທ່ານຖືກສ້າງສຳເລັດ (ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກສີຂຽວປະກົດຂຶ້ນຖັດຈາກ commit ຫຼ້າສຸດ), "
"ທ່ານພ້ອມທີ່ຈະທົດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງໃນອຸປະກອນແລ້ວ."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:130
msgid ""
"If a red \"X\" appears next to your last commit, your pull request has "
"failed to build. Click the red \"X\" to view the build log. Until your build "
"errors are resolved, your pull request cannot be installed or accepted."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຄື່ອງໝາຍ \"X\" ສີແດງປະກົດຂຶ້ນ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ pull request ຂອງທ່ານສ້າງບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. "
"ຄລິກທີ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ \"X\" ເພື່ອເບິ່ງ build log. ທ່ານຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ build errors ໃຫ້ສຳເລັດກ່ອນ pull "
"request ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບ."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:132
msgid ""
"We'll use ``ubports-qa`` to install your changes. Take note of your pull "
"request's ID (noted as ``#number`` after the title of the pull request) and "
"follow these steps to install your changes:"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ ``ubports-qa`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງການປ່ຽນແປງ. ໃຫ້ຈົດໝາຍເລກ ID ຂອງ pull request "
"ຂອງທ່ານ (ລະບຸເປັນ ``#number`` ຫຼັງຫົວຂໍ້) ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:134
msgid ""
"Ensure your device is running the newest version of Ubuntu Touch from the "
"``devel`` channel."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບປະກັນວ່າອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານກຳລັງນຳໃຊ້ Ubuntu Touch ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ສຸດຈາກ ``devel`` channel."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:135
msgid ""
"Get shell access to your device using :doc:`/userguide/advanceduse/adb` "
"or :doc:`/userguide/advanceduse/ssh`."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າເຖິງ shell ຂອງອຸປະກອນໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ :doc:`/userguide/advanceduse/adb` ຫຼື :doc:`/"
"userguide/advanceduse/ssh`."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:136
msgid ""
"Run ``sudo ubports-qa install REPOSITORY PR``, replacing ``REPOSITORY`` with "
"the name of the repository you have submitted a PR to and ``PR`` with the "
"number of your pull request without the ``#``. For example run ``sudo "
"ubports-qa morph-browser 123`` to install the PR number 123 to morph-browser "
"repo."
msgstr ""
"ແລ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ ``sudo ubports-qa install REPOSITORY PR``, ໂດຍປ່ຽນແທນ ``REPOSITORY`` "
"ດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງ repository ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ສົ່ງ PR ແລະ ປ່ຽນ ``PR`` ດ້ວຍໝາຍເລກ pull request (ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃສ່ "
"``#``). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແລ່ນ ``sudo ubports-qa morph-browser 123`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ PR ໝາຍເລກ "
"123 ໄປຍັງ morph-browser repo."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:138
msgid ""
"``ubports-qa`` will automatically add the repository containing your changed "
"software and start the installation for you. All you will need to do is "
"check the packages it asks you to install and say \"yes\" if they are "
"correct."
msgstr ""
"``ubports-qa`` ຈະເພີ່ມ repository ທີ່ມີຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ "
"ເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້. ສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດແມ່ນກວດເບິ່ງແພັກເກັດທີ່ລະບົບຖາມ ແລະ ຕອບ \"yes\" "
"ຖ້າພວກມັນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:140
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If ``ubports-qa`` fails to install your packages, run it again with the ``-"
"v`` flag (for example, ``ubports-qa -v install ...``). If it still fails, "
"submit the entire log (starting from the ``$`` before the ``ubports-qa`` "
"command) to `Ubuntu Pastebin <https://paste.ubuntu.com/>`_ and contact us "
"for help."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ ``ubports-qa`` ຕິດຕັ້ງບໍ່ສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ແລ່ນອີກຄັ້ງດ້ວຍ ``-v`` flag (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``ubports-qa "
"-v install ...``). ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງ log ທັງໝົດໄປທີ່ `Ubuntu Pastebin <https://"
"paste.ubuntu.com/>`_ ແລະ ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາເພື່ອຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:142
msgid ""
"Once ``ubports-qa`` is finished, test your changes to ensure they have fixed "
"the original bug. Add the ``ubports-qa`` command to your pull request, then "
"send the link to the pull request to other developers and testers so they "
"may also test your changes."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ ``ubports-qa`` ສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ທົດສອບເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າ bug ໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ. ເພີ່ມຄຳສັ່ງ "
"``ubports-qa`` ໃສ່ໃນ pull request, ຈາກນັ້ນສົ່ງລິ້ງໃຫ້ກັບນັກພັດທະນາ ແລະ ຜູ້ທົດສອບຄົນອື່ນໆ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາຊ່ວຍກວດສອບ."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:144
msgid ""
"When getting feedback from your testers, be sure to add the information to "
"the pull request (or ask them to do it for you) so that everyone is updated "
"on the status of your code."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບຄຳຕິຊົມຈາກຜູ້ທົດສອບ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນໃສ່ໃນ pull request "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທຸກຄົນໄດ້ຮັບຊາບສະຖານະຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງໂຄດ."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:146
msgid ""
"Every time you make a change and push it to GitHub, it will trigger a new "
"build. You can run ``sudo ubports-qa update`` to get the freshest changes "
"every time this happens."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ push ໄປ GitHub, ມັນຈະເຮັດການສ້າງ (build) ໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດແລ່ນ ``sudo ubports-qa update`` ເພື່ອຮັບການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:149
msgid "Celebrate!"
msgstr "ສະຫຼອງໄດ້ເລີຍ!"

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:151
msgid ""
"If you and your testers are satisfied with the results of your pull request, "
"it will be merged. Following the merge, the UBports build service will build "
"your code and deploy it to Ubuntu Touch users worldwide."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານ ແລະ ຜູ້ທົດສອບພໍໃຈກັບຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ, pull request ຈະຖືກ merged. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, UBports "
"build service ຈະສ້າງໂຄດ ແລະ deploy ໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ Ubuntu Touch ທົ່ວໂລກ."

#: ../../systemdev/uploading-changes.rst:153
msgid "Thank you for your contribution to Ubuntu Touch!"
msgstr "ຂອບໃຈສຳລັບການປະກອບສ່ວນຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ກັບ Ubuntu Touch!"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:2
msgid "Shell access via ADB"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Shell ຜ່ານ ADB"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:4
msgid ""
"You can put your UBports device into developer mode and access a Bash shell "
"from your PC. This is useful for debugging or more advanced shell usage."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງອຸປະກອນ UBports ໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດນັກພັດທະນາ ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງ Bash shell ຈາກ PC. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການ debugging ຫຼື ການນຳໃຊ້ shell ຂັ້ນສູງ."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:8
msgid "Install ADB"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ ADB"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:10
msgid "First, you'll need ADB installed on your computer."
msgstr "ທຳອິດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ ADB ໃສ່ໃນຄອມພິວເຕີ."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:12
#, fuzzy
msgid "On Ubuntu::"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Ubuntu::"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:16
#, fuzzy
msgid "On Fedora::"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Fedora::"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:20
#, fuzzy
msgid "And on macOS with `Homebrew <https://brew.sh>`_::"
msgstr "ແລະ ສຳລັບ macOS ຜ່ານ `Homebrew <https://brew.sh>`_::"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:24
msgid ""
"For Windows, grab the command-line tools only package from "
"`developer.android.com <https://developer.android.com/studio/"
"index.html#downloads>`_."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ Windows, ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດ command-line tools ຈາກ `developer.android.com "
"<https://developer.android.com/studio/index.html#downloads>`_."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:27
msgid "Enable developer mode"
msgstr "ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ໂໝດນັກພັດທະນາ"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:29
msgid "Next, you'll need to turn on Developer Mode."
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດ Developer Mode."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:31
msgid ""
"Place your device into developer mode (Settings - About - Developer Mode - "
"check the box to turn it on)"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງອຸປະກອນໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດນັກພັດທະນາ (ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ - ກ່ຽວກັບ - ໂໝດນັກພັດທະນາ - ໝາຍຕິກເພື່ອເປີດນຳໃຊ້)"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:32
msgid "Reboot your device"
msgstr "Reboot ອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:33
msgid "Plug the device into a computer with ADB installed"
msgstr "ສຽບອຸປະກອນເຂົ້າກັບຄອມພິວເຕີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ADB ແລ້ວ"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:34
msgid "Open a terminal and run ``adb devices``."
msgstr "ເປີດ terminal ແລະ ແລ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ ``adb devices``."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:37
msgid ""
"When you're done using the shell, it's a good idea to turn Developer Mode "
"off again."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ shell ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຄວນປິດ Developer Mode ຄືນໃໝ່."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:39
msgid ""
"If there's a device in the list here (The command doesn't print \"List of "
"devices attached\" and a blank line), you are able to use ADB. If not, "
"continue to the next section."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີລາຍຊື່ອຸປະກອນປະກົດຂຶ້ນ (ຄຳສັ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ສະແດງແຖວວ່າງ), ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ ADB ໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນຖັດໄປ."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:45
msgid "Authorize access to the device"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດການເຂົ້າເຖິງອຸປະກອນ"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:47
msgid ""
"When using adb for the first time on a computer, the following dialog will "
"appear when you unlock the screen."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ ADB ເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດໃນຄອມພິວເຕີ, ຈະມີກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບປະກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອທ່ານປົດລັອກໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/adb.rst:51
msgid ""
"This ensures that ADB commands will not work on a new computer unless user "
"unlock the phone and acknowledge the dialog. Selecting \"Allow\" will make "
"the ADB commands work for this session, and will also remember this computer "
"so that it won't prompt you again in the future."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຄຳສັ່ງ ADB ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນຄອມພິວເຕີໃໝ່ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະປົດລັອກໂທລະສັບ ແລະ "
"ຢືນຢັນ. ການເລືອກ \"Allow\" (ອະນຸຍາດ) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງ ADB ເຮັດວຽກສຳລັບ session ນີ້, ແລະ "
