#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/dav.rst:2
msgid "CalDAV and CardDAV syncing"
msgstr "ການຊິງຄ໌ (Syncing) CalDAV ແລະ CardDAV"

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/dav.rst:4
msgid ""
"CalDAV and CardDAV are protocols to sync calendars and contacts with a "
"remote server. Many e-mail hosters provide a CalDAV and CardDAV interface."
msgstr ""
"CalDAV ແລະ CardDAV ແມ່ນໂປຣໂຕຄໍ (protocols) ສຳລັບການຊິງຄ໌ປະຕິທິນ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ກັບ "
"remote server. ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການອີເມວຫຼາຍແຫ່ງຮອງຮັບ CalDAV ແລະ CardDAV interface."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/dav.rst:7
msgid ""
"CalDAV sync can be set up by using the calendar app. Open it, click on the "
"little calendar icon in the top right corner and select \"Add internet "
"calendar > Generic CalDAV\". Enter your calendar URL as well as your "
"username and password to complete the process."
msgstr ""
"ການຊິງຄ໌ CalDAV ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຜ່ານແອັບປະຕິທິນ. ໃຫ້ເປີດແອັບ, ຄລິກໄອຄອນປະຕິທິນນ້ອຍໆຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ "
"ແລະ ເລືອກ \"Add internet calendar > Generic CalDAV\". ໃສ່ URL ປະຕິທິນ ພ້ອມທັງຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ ເພື່ອສຳເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#: ../../userguide/advanceduse/dav.rst:11
msgid ""
"CardDAV sync can be set up by using two different ways detailed in the "
"following instructions. These instructions work for CalDAV as well."
msgstr ""
"ການຊິງຄ໌ CardDAV ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ສອງວິທີຕາມຄຳແນະນຳລຸ່ມນີ້. ເຊິ່ງວິທີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ CalDAV "
"ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

