#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:18
msgid "The Location Indicator, showing location on but not in use."
msgstr "ຕົວຊີ້ບອກສະຖານທີ່ ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າບໍລິການເປີດຢູ່ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ງານ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:20
msgid "If an app is accessing location data, the Location Indicator brightens."
msgstr "ຫາກແອັບໃດໜຶ່ງກຳລັງເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່ ຕົວຊີ້ບອກສະຖານທີ່ຈະສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:24
msgid "The Location Indicator, showing location on and in use."
msgstr "ຕົວຊີ້ບອກສະຖານທີ່ ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າບໍລິການເປີດຢູ່ ແລະ ກຳລັງຖືກໃຊ້ງານ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:29
msgid "Accessing location services settings"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:31
msgid ""
"There are several ways to access settings related to location services in "
"Ubuntu Touch."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ໃນ Ubuntu Touch."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:34
msgid "Open location quick settings"
msgstr "ເປີດການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນຂອງສະຖານທີ່"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:36
msgid ""
"The Location Indicator contains quick settings related to location services, "
"including a switch to turn services on or off."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຊີ້ບອກສະຖານທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ ລວມທັງສະວິດສຳລັບເປີດ ຫຼື "
"ປິດບໍລິການ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:40
msgid ""
"To access these settings, press the Location Indicator and pull down toward "
"the bottom of the screen."
msgstr "ໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ໃຫ້ກົດທີ່ຕົວຊີ້ບອກສະຖານທີ່ແລ້ວຮູດລົງໄປທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:42
msgid ""
"If location services are off, you can access the location quick settings by "
"pressing on any other indicator and pulling down. Then, scroll through the "
"icons at the top of the screen to find Location. Select \"Location to open "
"the quick settings."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ປິດຢູ່ ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດທີ່ຕົວຊີ້ບອກອື່ນແລ້ວຮູດລົງ. "
"ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ເລື່ອນເບິ່ງໄອຄອນຕ່າງໆຢູ່ທາງເທິງເພື່ອຊອກຫາ \"ສະຖານທີ່\" (Location) "
"ແລ້ວເລືອກມັນເພື່ອເປີດການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:47
msgid "Open location settings in the settings app"
msgstr "ເປີດການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານທີ່ໃນແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:49
msgid ""
"The system settings app can be used to control location services. There are "
"more controls in the system settings app than in the Location Indicator."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ໄດ້. "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະມີລາຍລະອຽດການຄວບຄຸມຫຼາຍກວ່າຢູ່ໃນຕົວຊີ້ບອກສະຖານທີ່."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:54
msgid ""
"There are two ways to access location services controls in the system "
"settings app."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງການຄວບຄຸມບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ໃນແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:57
#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:78
msgid "Quick settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:59
msgid "`Open location quick settings`_, then select ``Location settings...``."
msgstr ""
"`ເປີດການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນຂອງສະຖານທີ່`_ ແລ້ວເລືອກ ``ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານທີ່...`` (Location "
"settings...)."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:62
#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:84
msgid "System settings app"
msgstr "ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:64
msgid ""
"Launch the ``System Settings`` app. Select ``Security & Privacy``, then "
"select ``Location``."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບ ``ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ`` (System Settings). ເລືອກ ``ຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ`` (Security & Privacy), ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກ ``ສະຖານທີ່`` (Location)."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:68
msgid "Enabling or disabling location services"
msgstr "ການເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:70
msgid ""
"If location services are on, apps you have granted access to your location "
"data may request your current location. Location services are on by default "
"on Ubuntu Touch."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ ແອັບທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່ "
"ຈະສາມາດຮ້ອງຂໍຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ ບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ໃນ Ubuntu Touch "
"ຈະຖືກເປີດໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:73
msgid ""
"If location services are off, apps will not be able to access your current "
"location."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ປິດຢູ່ ແອັບຕ່າງໆຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:75
msgid ""
"There are several ways to turn on or off location services in Ubuntu Touch."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ໃນ Ubuntu Touch."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:80
msgid ""
"`Open location quick settings`_. Select the ``Location detection`` switch to "
"turn on or off location services."
msgstr ""
"`ເປີດການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນຂອງສະຖານທີ່`_. ເລືອກສະວິດ ``ການກວດຫາສະຖານທີ່`` (Location detection) "
"ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:86
msgid ""
"`Open location settings in the settings app`_. Under ``Let the device detect "
"your location:``, select the appropriate option:"
msgstr ""
"`ເປີດການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານທີ່ໃນແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ`_. ພາຍໃຕ້ຫົວຂໍ້ ``ໃຫ້ອຸປະກອນກວດຫາສະຖານທີ່ຂອງທ່ານ:`` "
"(Let the device detect your location:) ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຕ້ອງການ:"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:89
msgid "``Using GPS`` turns on location services."
msgstr "``ໃຊ້ GPS`` (Using GPS) ເພື່ອເປີດບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:90
msgid "``Not at all`` turns off location services."
msgstr "``ບໍ່ເລີຍ`` (Not at all) ເພື່ອປິດບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:93
msgid "Allowing apps access to location data"
msgstr "ການອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:95
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Touch allows you to allow or deny apps access to your location data. "
"This decision is presented the first time the app tries to access your "
"current location. You can change your decision later."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Touch ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກທີ່ຈະຍິນຍອມ ຫຼື "
"ປະຕິເສດແອັບໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. "
"ໂດຍຄຳຖາມນີ້ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ແອັບພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັດສິນໃຈນີ້ໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:99
msgid ""
"An app will show the location permission request the first time it tries to "
"access your current location."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບຈະສະແດງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອະນຸຍາດເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ ໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ມັນພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:104
msgid ""
"Select ``Allow`` to give the app access to your current location. Select "
"``Don't Allow`` to deny the app access to your current location. Some app "
"features may not work correctly if you select ``Don't Allow``."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ ``ອະນຸຍາດ`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແອັບເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ. ເລືອກ ``ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດ`` "
"ເພື່ອປະຕິເສດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ. ຄຸນສົມບັດບາງຢ່າງຂອງແອັບອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ ຫາກທ່ານເລືອກ "
"``ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດ``."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:109
msgid "Changing your permissions"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງການອະນຸຍາດຂອງທ່ານ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:111
msgid ""
"You can change your decision to allow an app access to your location data. "
"This is useful if you have granted an app access to your location but would "
"now like to revoke it, or if you denied access but would like to grant "
"access again."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັດສິນໃຈໃນການອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແອັບເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານເຄີຍອະນຸຍາດໄປແລ້ວແຕ່ຕ້ອງການຖອນສິດຄືນ, ຫຼື "
"ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສິດໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເຄີຍປະຕິເສດໄປ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:114
msgid "There are several ways to find these controls."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການຄົ້ນຫາການຄວບຄຸມເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:117
msgid "Location settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານທີ່"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:119
msgid ""
"`Open location settings in the settings app`_. All apps that have requested "
"access to your location are listed under ``Let apps access this location:``. "
"Toggle the switch next to an app \"on\" to allow it to access your location "
"data. Toggle the switch \"off\" to deny access."
msgstr ""
"`ເປີດການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານທີ່ໃນແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ`_. ແອັບທັງໝົດທີ່ເຄີຍຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ຂອງທ່ານ "
"ຈະຖືກສະແດງໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ຫົວຂໍ້ ``ໃຫ້ແອັບເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ນີ້:``. ໃຫ້ເປີດສະວິດຂ້າງແອັບເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດ ຫຼື "
"ປິດສະວິດເພື່ອປະຕິເສດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:125
msgid "App permission settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການອະນຸຍາດແອັບ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:127
msgid ""
"Launch the ``System Settings`` app. Select ``Security & Privacy``, then "
"select ``App permissions``, followed by ``Location``. All of the apps that "
"have requested access to your location are listed. Toggle the switch next to "
"an app \"on\" to allow it to access your location data. Toggle the switch "
"\"off\" to deny access."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບ ``ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ``. ເລືອກ ``ຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ``, ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກ "
"``ການອະນຸຍາດແອັບ``, ແລ້ວເລືອກ ``ສະຖານທີ່``. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນລາຍຊື່ແອັບທັງໝົດທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍການເຂົ້າເຖິງ. "
"ເປີດສະວິດຂ້າງແອັບເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດ ຫຼື ປິດເພື່ອປະຕິເສດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:134
msgid "Using apps with location services"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ແອັບຮ່ວມກັບບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:136
msgid ""
"Apps will be able to access your current location after they are granted "
"access to location data. However, there are some things to note while using "
"apps with location services."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸຍາດ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ມີບາງສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນສັງເກດໃນຂະນະທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:140
msgid "Time to first fix"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໃນການຈັບສັນຍານຄັ້ງທຳອິດ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:142
msgid ""
"A \"fix\" is a data point generated by GPS hardware that contains its "
"current location and the expected accuracy of that location. GPS hardware is "
"rated by how long it takes to return one of these data points after the "
"device is activated. This rating is called \"`Time To First Fix <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_to_first_fix>`_,\" or TTFF."
msgstr ""
"\"fix\" ແມ່ນຈຸດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍຮາດແວ GPS ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍທີ່ຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ "
"ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນ. ຮາດແວ GPS "
"ຖືກວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາບຈາກໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງຫຼັງຈາກເປີດເຄື່ອງ. ຄ່າວັດແທກນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"\"`Time To First Fix <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time_to_first_fix>`_,\" "
"ຫຼື TTFF."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:146
msgid ""
"A device with a mobile data connection should take one to four minutes to "
"receive its first fix. If location services have not been used for a long "
"time *and* the device does not have a mobile data connection, the first fix "
"can take up to an hour. To prevent this from causing problems for you, "
"follow these instructions:"
msgstr ""
"ອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດມືຖື ຄວນໃຊ້ເວລາປະມານ 1 ຫາ 4 ນາທີ ໃນການຈັບສັນຍານຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. "
"ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ເປັນເວລານານ *ແລະ* ອຸປະກອນບໍ່ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດມືຖື, "
"ການຈັບສັນຍານຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາເຖິງໜຶ່ງຊົ່ວໂມງ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:151
msgid ""
"Do not leave your device in direct sunlight. (The heat can damage the "
"device.)"
msgstr "ຢ່າວາງອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ກາງແດດໂດຍກົງ (ຄວາມຮ້ອນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ອຸປະກອນເສຍຫາຍໄດ້)."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:153
msgid "Turn off ``Lock when idle`` in the Battery settings"
msgstr "ປິດໂໝດ ``ລັອກເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ`` ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບັດເຕີຣີ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:154
msgid ""
"Download an app which uses location services and use it to start accessing "
"location data."
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດແອັບທີ່ໃຊ້ບໍລິການສະຖານທີ່ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອເລີ່ມການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕັ້ງ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:155
msgid "Leave your device near a window, but out of direct sunlight."
msgstr "ວາງອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ໃກ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ ແຕ່ໃຫ້ພົ້ນຈາກແສງແດດໂດຍກົງ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:157
msgid "(Turn the screen brightness down to reduce energy consumption.)"
msgstr "(ຫຼຸດຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງໜ້າຈໍລົງ ເພື່ອປະຢັດພະລັງງານ.)"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:159
msgid ""
"After 20-60 minutes, your device should display your current location. You "
"can now close the app and turn on ``Lock when idle``. Future attempts to "
"aquire your location should now take 1-4 minutes."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກ 20-60 ນາທີ, ອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະສະແດງທີ່ຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດປິດແອັບ ແລະ "
"ກັບໄປເປີດໂໝດ ``ລັອກເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ`` ໄດ້ຄືເກົ່າ. ການຈັບສັນຍານໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຈະໃຊ້ເວລາພຽງ 1-4 ນາທີ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:164
msgid "App suspension"
msgstr "ການພັກການເຮັດວຽກຂອງແອັບ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/location.rst:166
msgid ""
"Apps are suspended whenever not in the foreground, or when the device is "
"locked. When an app is suspended, it cannot receive location data. For this "
"reason, apps will not be able to track your location whenever they are not "
"in use or the device is locked."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບຈະຖືກພັກການເຮັດວຽກທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່ໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ ຫຼື ເມື່ອອຸປະກອນຖືກລັອກ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແອັບຖືກພັກ, "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່ໄດ້. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ແອັບຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕາມທີ່ຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ "
"ຫຼື ໃນເວລາທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຖືກລັອກ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/tethering.rst:2
msgid "Tethering"
msgstr "ການປ່ອຍສັນຍານອິນເຕີເນັດ (Tethering)"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/tethering.rst:4
msgid ""
"This tutorial explains how to enable USB Tethering on your Ubuntu Touch "
"device to share it's internet connection over a USB cable with a computer."
msgstr ""
"ບົດສອນນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີເປີດໃຊ້ USB Tethering ໃນອຸປະກອນ Ubuntu Touch ຂອງທ່ານ "
"ເພື່ອແບ່ງປັນອິນເຕີເນັດໃຫ້ກັບຄອມພິວເຕີຜ່ານສາຍ USB."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/tethering.rst:6
msgid "Go to the settings app and look for the usb icon"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລ້ວຊອກຫາໄອຄອນ USB"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/tethering.rst:10
msgid "The USB Setting in the settings app."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ USB ໃນແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/tethering.rst:12
msgid "On the USB page you can then choose for the USB tethering option"
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ USB ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ USB tethering ໄດ້"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/tethering.rst:16
msgid "The USB Setting page."
msgstr "ໜ້າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ USB."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/tethering.rst:18
msgid ""
"And that's it, you are now sharing the internet from your Ubuntu Touch "
"device to your computer"
msgstr ""
"ພຽງເທົ່ານີ້, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດແບ່ງປັນອິນເຕີເນັດຈາກອຸປະກອນ Ubuntu Touch ໄປຍັງຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:2
msgid "Voice over LTE (VoLTE)"
msgstr "ການໂທຜ່ານ LTE (VoLTE)"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:4
msgid ""
"Voice over LTE (VoLTE) is a technology that allows a phone to take a call "
"and send a message while connected to a 4G/LTE cellular network. The "
"benefits of VoLTE include quicker call setup, higher quality voice, and "
"seamless mobile data while on a call."
msgstr ""
"Voice over LTE (VoLTE) ແມ່ນເຕັກໂນໂລຊີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໂທລະສັບສາມາດໂທ ແລະ ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້ "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ 4G/LTE. ປະໂຫຍດຂອງ VoLTE ຄືການຕໍ່ສາຍທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ, ຄຸນນະພາບສຽງທີ່ຄົມຊັດ "
"ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ອິນເຕີເນັດມືຖືໄດ້ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງໂທ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:6
msgid ""
"Carriers in some parts of the world have started phasing out 3G cellular "
"networks, making VoLTE mandatory in order to place a call on that carrier. "
"If VoLTE is not supported or not enabled by the phone, and the carrier still "
"supports 3G network, the phone will automatically switch to 3G network for "
"the duration of the call and will switch back to 4G network after the call "
"ends."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນບາງພາກສ່ວນຂອງໂລກໄດ້ເລີ່ມຍົກເລີກເຄືອຂ່າຍ 3G, ເຮັດໃຫ້ VoLTE "
"ກາຍເປັນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນໃນການໂທ. ຫາກໂທລະສັບບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ VoLTE ແຕ່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຍັງມີ 3G ຢູ່, "
"ໂທລະສັບຈະປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ 3G ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການໂທ ແລະ ຈະກັບມາໃຊ້ 4G ຄືເກົ່າເມື່ອວາງສາຍ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:8
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Touch supports VoLTE on some devices. Support for VoLTE on Ubuntu "
"Touch depends on the phone's chipset, the Android version the port is based "
"on, and whether the port has enabled support for VoLTE. As of Ubuntu Touch "
"20.04 OTA-8, VoLTE is enabled on Volla Phone X23 and Volla Phone 22 running "
"Android 12-based port."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Touch ຮອງຮັບ VoLTE ໃນບາງອຸປະກອນ. ການຮອງຮັບແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຊິບເຊັດ, ເວີຊັນ Android "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການພອດ (port), ແລະ ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນພອດນັ້ນໆ. ສຳລັບ Ubuntu Touch 20.04 OTA-8, "
"VoLTE ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວໃນ Volla Phone X23 ແລະ Volla Phone 22 ລຸ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ພອດ Android "
"12."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:11
msgid "How do I know if VoLTE is supported on my phone?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະຮູ້ໄດ້ແນວໃດວ່າໂທລະສັບຂອງຂ້ອຍຮອງຮັບ VoLTE?"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:13
msgid ""
"To check if your phone supports VoLTE, go to *System Settings* > *Cellular* "
"> *Carrier & APN*. If VoLTE is supported, you will be able to toggle *4G "
"calling (VoLTE)*. If the toggle does not appear, or the toggle is disabled, "
"then your phone does not yet support VoLTE on Ubuntu Touch."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອກວດສອບ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ *ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບ* > *ເຄືອຂ່າຍມືຖື* > *ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ແລະ APN*. ຫາກຮອງຮັບ, "
"ທ່ານຈະເຫັນປຸ່ມເປີດປິດ *ການໂທຜ່ານ 4G (VoLTE)*. ຫາກບໍ່ມີປຸ່ມນີ້ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້, "
"ສະແດງວ່າໂທລະສັບຂອງທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ VoLTE ໃນ Ubuntu Touch."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:18
msgid "How do I know if VoLTE is working?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະຮູ້ໄດ້ແນວໃດວ່າ VoLTE ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ?"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:20
msgid "For VoLTE to work, the following conditions have to be met:"
msgstr "VoLTE ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄົບເງື່ອນໄຂດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:22
msgid "Your phone supports VoLTE on Ubuntu Touch."
msgstr "ໂທລະສັບຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບ VoLTE ໃນ Ubuntu Touch."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:23
msgid "Your carrier and your SIM card supports VoLTE."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ແລະ ຊິມກາດຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບ VoLTE."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:24
msgid "Ubuntu Touch contains a VoLTE configuration for your carrier."
msgstr "Ubuntu Touch ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ VoLTE ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/volte.rst:26
msgid ""
"If the conditions are met, and the phone successfully establishes a VoLTE "
"connection, the VoLTE logo will appear after your carrier name in the "
"Network indicator."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຄົບເງື່ອນໄຂ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ VoLTE ສຳເລັດ, ໂລໂກ້ VoLTE ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນຖັດຈາກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ "
"ໃນແຖບສະຖານະເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:2
msgid "Android apps"
msgstr "ແອັບ Android"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:4
msgid ""
"`Waydroid <https://waydro.id>`_ is a minimal Android container and "
"compatibility layer to run Android apps on GNU/Linux operating systems such "
"as Ubuntu Touch."
msgstr ""
"`Waydroid <https://waydro.id>`_ ແມ່ນຄອນເທນເນີ Android ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ແລະ "
"ຊັ້ນຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດແລ່ນແອັບ Android ເທິງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ GNU/Linux ເຊັ່ນ Ubuntu "
"Touch ໄດ້."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:7
msgid ""
"You will need to execute commands on your Ubuntu Touch device (locally via "
"the terminal application or remotely via :doc:`ADB </userguide/advanceduse/"
"adb>`/:doc:`SSH </userguide/advanceduse/ssh>` ) to initialize Waydroid, "
"install APKs and uninstall applications."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃນອຸປະກອນ Ubuntu Touch (ຜ່ານແອັບ Terminal ຫຼື ທາງໄກຜ່ານ :doc:`ADB "
"</userguide/advanceduse/adb>`/:doc:`SSH </userguide/advanceduse/ssh>`) "
"ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Waydroid, ຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ APK ແລະ ຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:12
msgid ""
"Before installing Waydroid on your device, please note that there are "
"limitations to its support and integration:"
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ Waydroid, ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ຍັງມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃນການຮອງຮັບ ແລະ "
"ການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນບາງຢ່າງ:"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:14
msgid ""
"After installing Waydroid on Ubuntu Touch, you may notice higher battery "
"consumption. To mitigate this, Waydroid can be stopped manually when not in "
"use."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງ Waydroid, ທ່ານອາດຈະສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າແບັດເຕີຣີໝົດໄວຂຶ້ນ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Waydroid ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:15
msgid ""
"Not all Android applications will work with Waydroid. Apps that require "
"Google's Play Integrity service or SafetyNet, such as banking apps, are "
"unlikely to run."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກແອັບ Android ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້. ແອັບທີ່ຕ້ອງການບໍລິການ Google Play Integrity ຫຼື "
"SafetyNet ເຊັ່ນ ແອັບທະນາຄານ, ມັກຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:16
msgid ""
"Problems may occur if both Ubuntu Touch and Waydroid request the use of the "
"same peripherals, and one will not be able to claim them (e.g. `camera "
"access not permitted <https://gitlab.com/ubports/porting/reference-device-"
"ports/android11/fairphone-4/fairphone-fp4/-/issues/67>`_)."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຫາອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນຫາກທັງ Ubuntu Touch ແລະ Waydroid ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນຮ່ວມກັນໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ, "
"ເຊັ່ນ `ການເຂົ້າເຖິງກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ <https://gitlab.com/ubports/porting/"
"reference-device-ports/android11/fairphone-4/fairphone-fp4/-/issues/67>`_."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:19
msgid "How to set up"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:21
msgid ""
"All Halium 9 and newer devices ship with waydroid out of the box starting "
"with Ubuntu Touch focal, if your device fits these requirements you can "
"follow the following steps"
msgstr ""
"ອຸປະກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ Halium 9 ຂຶ້ນໄປ ຈະມາພ້ອມກັບ Waydroid ໃນ Ubuntu Touch Focal (20.04). "
"ຫາກອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານຕົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂ, ສາມາດເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:23
#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:31
#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:55
msgid ""
"Open a shell on your Ubuntu Touch device (remotely with ADB/SSH or locally "
"with the terminal app)."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ Shell ໃນອຸປະກອນ Ubuntu Touch (ທາງໄກດ້ວຍ ADB/SSH ຫຼື ຜ່ານແອັບ Terminal ໃນເຄື່ອງ)."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:24
msgid "Run the following command in your shell: ``waydroid init``."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ: ``waydroid init``."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:25
#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:33
msgid ""
"Done! You might have to refresh the apps scope (pull down from the center of "
"the screen and release) for the new Android apps to show up."
msgstr ""
"ສຳເລັດ! ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຣີເຟຣຊລາຍຊື່ແອັບ (ດຶງໜ້າຈໍລົງແລ້ວປ່ອຍ) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແອັບ Android ໃໝ່ປາກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:28
msgid "How to install new APKs"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ APK ໃໝ່"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:30
msgid ""
"Copy the APK to ``/home/phablet/Downloads`` on your Ubuntu Touch device."
msgstr "ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ APK ໄປໄວ້ທີ່ ``/home/phablet/Downloads`` ໃນອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:32
msgid ""
"Run the following in your shell ``waydroid app install /home/phablet/"
"Downloads/my-app.apk``"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ: ``waydroid app install /home/phablet/Downloads/my-app.apk``"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:36
msgid "Using an appstore in Waydroid"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຮ້ານຄ້າແອັບໃນ Waydroid"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:38
msgid ""
"You can also install an appstore like F-Droid or Amazon Appstore to install "
"applications or keeping them up to date. If you want to install any of the "
"above apps you can find them here:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງຮ້ານຄ້າແອັບ ເຊັ່ນ F-Droid ຫຼື Amazon Appstore ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ອັບເດດແອັບຕ່າງໆ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້:"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:40
msgid "F-Droid: https://f-droid.org/"
msgstr "F-Droid: https://f-droid.org/"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:41
msgid "Amazon Appstore: https://www.amazon.com/gp/mas/get-appstore/android"
msgstr "Amazon Appstore: https://www.amazon.com/gp/mas/get-appstore/android"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:43
msgid ""
"Note that due to nature of Waydroid, neither of these will automatically "
"keep your applications up-to-date. You will have to manually open the "
"appstore and check for updates. Additionally you will have to authorize each "
"app install or update as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ລະບົບ Waydroid ຈະບໍ່ອັບເດດແອັບໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດຮ້ານຄ້າແອັບ ແລະ "
"ກວດສອບການອັບເດດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງອະນຸຍາດການຕິດຕັ້ງແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:45
msgid "search for the app to install or update"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາແອັບທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:46
msgid "press the install or update button"
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:47
msgid ""
"wait for the download to finish, there will be a prompt to install the "
"application/update"
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດສຳເລັດ, ຈະມີປ໊ອບອັບໃຫ້ຢືນຢັນການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:48
msgid "press the install button on the above prompt"
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມຕິດຕັ້ງໃນປ໊ອບອັບດັ່ງກ່າວ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:50
msgid ""
"For more advanced users this could be remedied by building a custom waydroid "
"image that ships with either appstore."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂັ້ນສູງ, ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການສ້າງ Waydroid Image "
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຮ້ານຄ້າແອັບມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:53
msgid "How to uninstall apps"
msgstr "ວິທີການຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:56
msgid ""
"To uninstall apps from the Ubuntu Touch device, run ``adb uninstall "
"[APP_ID]`` in your shell"
msgstr "ການຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບຜ່ານ Shell ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ: ``adb uninstall [ລະຫັດແອັບ]``"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:57
msgid ""
"Run the following in your shell ``waydroid app remove [APP_ID]`` (you can "
"find the APP_ID by using 'waydroid app list')"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼືໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ: ``waydroid app remove [ລະຫັດແອັບ]`` (ກວດສອບລະຫັດແອັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ 'waydroid "
"app list')"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:58
msgid ""
"Done! You might have to pull down from the app list for the old Android apps "
"to go away."
msgstr "ສຳເລັດ! ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຣີເຟຣຊລາຍຊື່ແອັບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄອຄອນແອັບທີ່ຖອນໄປແລ້ວຫາຍໄປ."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:61
msgid ""
"If you are using an appstore in waydroid you can also uninstall apps through "
"said appstore"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ຮ້ານຄ້າແອັບ, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານຮ້ານຄ້ານັ້ນໆໄດ້ເລີຍ"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:64
msgid "Access Android storage"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ Android"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:66
msgid ""
"The Android storage is located at ``/home/phablet/.local/share/waydroid/data/"
"media/0``."
msgstr ""
"ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ Android ຈະຢູ່ທີ່: ``/home/phablet/.local/share/waydroid/data/media/0``."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:68
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Links to android libraries can be made in their respective XDG counterparts::"
msgstr "ສາມາດສ້າງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ (Link) ໄປຍັງໂຟນເດີຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້::"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:79
msgid ""
"When you are installing an APK, but run into the following error ``Invalid "
"APK file``, this could simply mean that it could not find the apk file. Try "
"the following steps to double check:"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``Invalid APK file`` ໃນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ, ອາດຈະເປັນຍ້ອນຊອກຫາໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ເຫັນ. "
"ໃຫ້ກວດສອບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:82
msgid "Check that you typed the filename correctly."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າພິມຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:83
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the APK does not reside in the folder you are in when you run adb, you "
"have to specify the full path, e.g. ``/home/phablet/Downloads/my-app.apk`` "
"instead of just ``my-app.apk``"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກໄຟລ໌ APK ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ໄຟລ໌ແບບເຕັມ ເຊັ່ນ: ``/home/phablet/"
"Downloads/my-app.apk``"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:87
msgid "Reporting bugs"
msgstr "ການລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (Bugs)"

#: ../../userguide/dailyuse/waydroid.rst:89
msgid ""
"Please :doc:`report any bugs </contribute/bugreporting>` you come across. "
"Bugs concerning Ubuntu Touch are reported in `the normal Ubuntu Touch "
"tracker <https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/ubuntu-touch/-/issues>`_ and "
"issues with Waydroid are reported on `our waydroid issue tracker <https://"
"gitlab.com/ubports/development/core/packaging/waydroid/-/issues>`_. Thank "
"you!"
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາ :doc:`ລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ </contribute/bugreporting>` ທີ່ທ່ານພົບ. ສຳລັບບັນຫາຂອງ "
"Ubuntu Touch ໃຫ້ລາຍງານທີ່ `Ubuntu Touch tracker <https://gitlab.com/ubports/"
"development/ubuntu-touch/-/issues>`_ ແລະ ບັນຫາຂອງ Waydroid ໃຫ້ລາຍງານທີ່ "
"`Waydroid issue tracker <https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/core/"
"packaging/waydroid/-/issues>`_. ຂໍຂອບໃຈ!"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:2
msgid "Install Ubuntu Touch"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Ubuntu Touch"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:4
msgid ""
"Installing Ubuntu Touch is easy, and a lot of work has gone in to making the "
"installation process less intimidating to the average user. The UBports "
"Installer is a nice graphical tool that you can use to install Ubuntu Touch "
"on a `supported device <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/>`_ from your `Linux "
"<https://snapcraft.io/ubports-installer>`_, `Mac <https://devices.ubuntu-"
"touch.io/installer/?package=dmg>`_ or `Windows <https://devices.ubuntu-"
"touch.io/installer/?package=exe>`_ computer. For more experienced users, we "
"also have manual installation instructions for every device `on the devices "
"page <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/>`_."
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Ubuntu Touch ນັ້ນງ່າຍກວ່າທີ່ຄິດ. UBports Installer ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານ "
"ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ Ubuntu Touch ລົງໃນ `ອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/"
">`_ ຜ່ານຄອມພິວເຕີ `Linux <https://snapcraft.io/ubports-installer>`_, `Mac "
"<https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/installer/?package=dmg>`_ ຫຼື `Windows "
"<https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/installer/?package=exe>`_ ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງສະດວກ. "
"ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂັ້ນສູງ, ພວກເຮົາຍັງມີຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນ `ໜ້າລາຍຊື່ອຸປະກອນ <https://"
"devices.ubuntu-touch.io/>`_."

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:7
msgid ""
"If you're switching your device over from Android, you will not be able to "
"keep any data that is currently on the device. Create an external backup if "
"you want to keep it."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານປ່ຽນຈາກ Android ມາໃຊ້ Ubuntu Touch, ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໃນເຄື່ອງຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ. "
"ກະລຸນາສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ບ່ອນອື່ນກ່ອນເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:9
msgid ""
"You can `Download the UBports Installer from GitHub <https://github.com/"
"ubports/ubports-installer/releases/latest>`_. The following packages are "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດ `ດາວໂຫຼດ UBports Installer ໄດ້ຈາກ GitHub <https://github.com/ubports/"
"ubports-installer/releases/latest>`_. ມີແພັກເກັດ (Package) ໃຫ້ເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Windows <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/installer/?package=exe>`_: "
"``ubports-installer-<version-number>.exe``"
msgstr ""
"`Windows <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/installer/?package=exe>`_: "
"``ubports-installer-<ເລກເວີຊັນ>.exe``"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:12
msgid ""
"`macOS <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/installer/?package=dmg>`_: ``ubports-"
"installer-<version-number>.dmg``"
msgstr ""
"`macOS <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/installer/?package=dmg>`_: ``ubports-"
"installer-<ເລກເວີຊັນ>.dmg``"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:13
msgid ""
"`Ubuntu or Debian <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/installer/?"
"package=deb>`_: ``ubports-installer-<version-number>.deb``"
msgstr ""
"`Ubuntu ຫຼື Debian <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/installer/?package=deb>`_: "
"``ubports-installer-<ເລກເວີຊັນ>.deb``"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:14
msgid ""
"`Other Linux distributions (snap) <https://snapcraft.io/ubports-"
"installer>`_: ``ubports-installer-<version-number>.snap``"
msgstr ""
"`Linux ອື່ນໆ (Snap) <https://snapcraft.io/ubports-installer>`_: ``ubports-"
"installer-<ເລກເວີຊັນ>.snap``"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:15
msgid ""
"`Other Linux distributions (AppImage) <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/"
"installer/?package=appimage>`_: ``ubports-installer-<version-"
"number>.AppImage``"
msgstr ""
"`Linux ອື່ນໆ (AppImage) <https://devices.ubuntu-touch.io/installer/?"
"package=appimage>`_: ``ubports-installer-<ເລກເວີຊັນ>.AppImage``"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:17
msgid ""
"Start the installer and follow the on-screen instructions that will walk you "
"through the installation process. That's it! Have fun exploring Ubuntu Touch!"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ພຽງເທົ່ານີ້ທ່ານກໍສາມາດເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານ Ubuntu Touch "
"ໄດ້ແລ້ວ!"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:19
msgid ""
"If you're an experienced android developer and want to help us bring Ubuntu "
"Touch to more devices, visit the :doc:`porting section </porting/"
"introduction/index>`."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານເປັນນັກພັດທະນາ Android ທີ່ມີປະສົບການ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຊ່ວຍພວກເຮົານຳ Ubuntu Touch "
"ໄປສູ່ອຸປະກອນອື່ນໆ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ :doc:`ພາກສ່ວນການພອດ (Porting) </porting/"
"introduction/index>`."

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:22
msgid ""
"Please do **not** start the installer with ``sudo``. It is meant to be run "
"as a normal user, not as root. Using the installer with sudo will mess up "
"permissions in the installer's cached files and lead to problems down the "
"road. If the installer does not recognize your device, check the "
"troubleshooting information below."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາ **ຢ່າ** ເປີດຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``sudo``. ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ແລ່ນດ້ວຍສິດຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ. "
"ການໃຊ້ sudo ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ Cache ເສຍຫາຍ ແລະ ເກີດບັນຫາຕາມມາ. "
"ຫາກຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງບໍ່ເຫັນອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງວິທີແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້."

