#: ../../userguide/install.rst:37
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We have contacted Microsoft about this problem, but they seem to think it's "
"`enjoyable <https://twitter.com/Windows/status/1014984163433295875>`__. To "
"dismiss the warning, click on \"More Information\", then select \"Run "
"anyway\"."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ແຈ້ງບັນຫານີ້ໃຫ້ Microsoft ແລ້ວ. ເພື່ອຂ້າມຄຳເຕືອນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ \"More Information\" "
"ແລ້ວເລືອກ \"Run anyway\"."

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:40
msgid "Device not detected"
msgstr "ກວດບໍ່ພົບອຸປະກອນ"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:43
msgid "Virtual Machine"
msgstr "Virtual Machine"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:45
msgid ""
"If you're running the installer in a virtual machine, make sure the virtual "
"machine is allowed to access the USB port."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ Virtual Machine, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ມັນເຂົ້າເຖິງພອດ USB ຂອງເຄື່ອງໄດ້."

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:48
msgid "Windows ADB drivers"
msgstr "ໄດຣເວີ (Driver) ADB ສຳລັບ Windows"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:50
msgid ""
"Install the `universal adb driver <http://adb.clockworkmod.com/>`_ and "
"reboot your computer."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕັ້ງ `Universal ADB Driver <http://adb.clockworkmod.com/>`_ ແລະ "
"ເລີ່ມລະບົບຄອມພິວເຕີໃໝ່."

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:53
msgid "Fairphone 2 Vendor-ID"
msgstr "Vendor-ID ຂອງ Fairphone 2"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:55
msgid ""
"Run ``echo 0x2ae5 >> ~/.android/adb_usb.ini`` in the terminal and restart "
"the installer. This does not affect the snap package."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ ``echo 0x2ae5 >> ~/.android/adb_usb.ini`` ໃນ Terminal ແລະ "
"ເປີດຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ Snap."

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:58
msgid "Missing udev-rules"
msgstr "ຂາດ udev-rules"

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:60
msgid ""
"If the device is not detected on Linux and you are not using the snap "
"package, then you might be missing some **udev-rules**."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ Linux ບໍ່ເຫັນອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດ Snap, ອາດຈະເປັນຍ້ອນຂາດ **udev-rules**."

#: ../../userguide/install.rst:62
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"See if ``/etc/udev/rules.d/51-android.rules`` exists and contains the rules "
"below. If not, add them to the file and run ``sudo service udev restart`` or "
"``sudo udevadm control --reload-rules && udevadm trigger``."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບວ່າໄຟລ໌ ``/etc/udev/rules.d/51-android.rules`` ມີຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່. ຫາກບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມກົດລະບຽບ "
"ແລ້ວໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຣີສະຕາດບໍລິການ udev."

